(1864024, 257381, 47487, '<td valign="top">Oh, interesting.</td>', 'Oh, interesting.', '2005-11-14 02:07:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1864025, 256909, 15711, '<td valign="top">simple and so well done with the two silhouettes on either side.  I like the shadowing of each image against the white background.  Like they are coming out of the wall.  NICE. 9</td>', 'simple and so well done with the two silhouettes on either side.  I like the shadowing of each image against the white background.  Like they are coming out of the wall.  NICE. 9', '2005-11-14 02:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1864026, 257112, 47487, '<td valign="top">I really like this idea! Good thinking, and well-executed, too.</td>', 'I really like this idea! Good thinking, and well-executed, too.', '2005-11-14 02:08:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1864027, 257125, 15711, '<td valign="top">An overdone subject, so you stood up, raised the bar and made it magnificent!! BRAVO The clarity, color and contrast are just outstanding.  9</td>', 'An overdone subject, so you stood up, raised the bar and made it magnificent!! BRAVO The clarity, color and contrast are just outstanding.  9', '2005-11-14 02:09:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1864028, 257156, 29269, '<td valign="top">You could have cropped more on the right, and placed the right side separator more to the left, so that you have symmetry of the bridge. The frame #3 is a bit dark, too, so it would not have hurt if you lost it.</td>', 'You could have cropped more on the right, and placed the right side separator more to the left, so that you have symmetry of the bridge. The frame #3 is a bit dark, too, so it would not have hurt if you lost it.', '2005-11-14 02:09:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1864030, 257337, 15711, '<td valign="top">My favorite of the land/seascape type shots.  Lovely soothing hues of lavender to blue to aqua.  Just love it.  Really pretty with the shadow around each one.  8</td>', 'My favorite of the land/seascape type shots.  Lovely soothing hues of lavender to blue to aqua.  Just love it.  Really pretty with the shadow around each one.  8', '2005-11-14 02:09:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1864031, 256814, 15711, '<td valign="top">Lovely with warm hues and perfect reflection.  I really like this alot. 8</td>', 'Lovely with warm hues and perfect reflection.  I really like this alot. 8', '2005-11-14 02:10:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1864032, 257233, 47487, '<td valign="top">ehh. Good effort, but the subjects just aren''t that compelling to me -- the leaf''s still green (although I like the drops), and mushrooms and "glory" don''t seem to go so well together. The frames are well-captured, especially the top and the bottom, but I''d have left off the text, personally.</td>', 'ehh. Good effort, but the subjects just aren''t that compelling to me -- the leaf''s still green (although I like the drops), and mushrooms and "glory" don''t seem to go so well together. The frames are well-captured, especially the top and the bottom, but I''d have left off the text, personally.', '2005-11-14 02:10:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1864033, 257255, 15711, '<td valign="top">DOORS! one of my favs.  Really clever take on the challenge. 8</td>', 'DOORS! one of my favs.  Really clever take on the challenge. 8', '2005-11-14 02:10:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1864034, 256381, 47487, '<td valign="top">Good job! Is that framed through actual gaps in something, or did you edit it to look that way? either way, I like it. My only complaint is that there''s maybe just a titch too much blank space. 7.</td>', 'Good job! Is that framed through actual gaps in something, or did you edit it to look that way? either way, I like it. My only complaint is that there''s maybe just a titch too much blank space. 7.', '2005-11-14 02:11:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1864036, 256221, 47487, '<td valign="top">Good job, looks like a travel brochure.</td>', 'Good job, looks like a travel brochure.', '2005-11-14 02:12:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1864037, 257257, 29269, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure what was the purpose of leaving the head out of this one. In my opinion, It subtracts from the image. Otherwise, a very nice composition with pleasant colors. Looks like a painting, good job!</td>', 'I''m not sure what was the purpose of leaving the head out of this one. In my opinion, It subtracts from the image. Otherwise, a very nice composition with pleasant colors. Looks like a painting, good job!', '2005-11-14 02:12:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1864042, 256353, 47487, '<td valign="top">Clever! Was he planning to shave it off anyway, or did you cajole him into it for the sake of the challenge?  Good job capturing his expression, especially in the middle frame.</td>', 'Clever! Was he planning to shave it off anyway, or did you cajole him into it for the sake of the challenge?  Good job capturing his expression, especially in the middle frame.', '2005-11-14 02:14:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1864043, 256864, 47487, '<td valign="top">Oh, I like it. I''m a sucker for flame pictures.</td>', 'Oh, I like it. I''m a sucker for flame pictures.', '2005-11-14 02:15:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1864044, 256690, 29269, '<td valign="top">It looks like it is going after the photographer now... <br/>I''m not sure about the composition of the images. I like it, but at the same time it bothers me that there is so much empty space in the 2nd row. And, the image #3 is smaller than the other two. It does break the monotony, but not in a good way, it seems to me. Good luck!</td>', 'It looks like it is going after the photographer now... I''m not sure about the composition of the images. I like it, but at the same time it bothers me that there is so much empty space in the 2nd row. And, the image #3 is smaller than the other two. It does break the monotony, but not in a good way, it seems to me. Good luck!', '2005-11-14 02:15:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1864050, 257140, 47487, '<td valign="top">Wow. Excellent. Really tells so much in so few pixels, especially the eye which was very, very well-shot. My only quibble is that maybe it would have been balanced a little better if the eye or the face (which seem to me to be the most important shots) was in the middle? Still... going in my favorites list for sure. 9.</td>', 'Wow. Excellent. Really tells so much in so few pixels, especially the eye which was very, very well-shot. My only quibble is that maybe it would have been balanced a little better if the eye or the face (which seem to me to be the most important shots) was in the middle? Still... going in my favorites list for sure. 9.', '2005-11-14 02:18:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1864051, 256191, 29269, '<td valign="top">Very nice use of space - the smaller height does not bother me at all with this one!<br/>On the #1, the reflection of the window (?) is unnecessary. It ruins it for me. The #3 is perfect, and #2 does not look human, probably because of the another unnatural bright spot.<br/>Lovely composition, good luck!</td>', 'Very nice use of space - the smaller height does not bother me at all with this one!On the #1, the reflection of the window (?) is unnecessary. It ruins it for me. The #3 is perfect, and #2 does not look human, probably because of the another unnatural bright spot.Lovely composition, good luck!', '2005-11-14 02:18:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1864052, 257130, 47487, '<td valign="top">Original idea, welll-executed. The colors and lighting are excellent.</td>', 'Original idea, welll-executed. The colors and lighting are excellent.', '2005-11-14 02:18:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1864055, 256982, 47487, '<td valign="top">Good! It looks good in b/w, but I''m curious how it would have been in color as well.  What a great subject.</td>', 'Good! It looks good in b/w, but I''m curious how it would have been in color as well.  What a great subject.', '2005-11-14 02:21:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1864056, 257201, 47487, '<td valign="top">I like your idea; it''s a bit of a shame that the birds were so hard to see.  I know how hard it is to capture wildlife satisfactorily.</td>', 'I like your idea; it''s a bit of a shame that the birds were so hard to see.  I know how hard it is to capture wildlife satisfactorily.', '2005-11-14 02:22:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1864057, 257305, 47487, '<td valign="top">This made me smile. Good captures. :)</td>', 'This made me smile. Good captures. :)', '2005-11-14 02:22:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1864058, 255857, 29269, '<td valign="top">Very nice idea. I think that it would have worked much better if you haven''t sliced it, but rather just striken over it with black frames.<br/>The bottom separator looks fine, because of the nonexistent curve at the secession point. On the top, it looks like it is a part of another pear.</td>', 'Very nice idea. I think that it would have worked much better if you haven''t sliced it, but rather just striken over it with black frames.The bottom separator looks fine, because of the nonexistent curve at the secession point. On the top, it looks like it is a part of another pear.', '2005-11-14 02:22:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1864059, 256667, 47487, '<td valign="top">You did a good job of capturing the exuberance and curiosity of childhood here. I''d have liked a little more face in the middle image.</td>', 'You did a good job of capturing the exuberance and curiosity of childhood here. I''d have liked a little more face in the middle image.', '2005-11-14 02:24:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1864060, 257111, 47487, '<td valign="top">Oh, bliss.  All three images are just breathtaking.</td>', 'Oh, bliss.  All three images are just breathtaking.', '2005-11-14 02:24:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1864061, 256120, 47487, '<td valign="top">Creative, and well-done.</td>', 'Creative, and well-done.', '2005-11-14 02:25:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1864062, 256334, 47487, '<td valign="top">Oh, the expressions! Priceless. The selective desat is good here -- doesn''t have that "gimmicky" feel that it sometimes can have.</td>', 'Oh, the expressions! Priceless. The selective desat is good here -- doesn''t have that "gimmicky" feel that it sometimes can have.', '2005-11-14 02:26:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1864063, 256676, 47487, '<td valign="top">Brilliant; hat a good idea!  Trying to decide if I''d have liked it even better if it had been three different cameras, but even if I would, it''s fantastic the way it is.</td>', 'Brilliant; hat a good idea!  Trying to decide if I''d have liked it even better if it had been three different cameras, but even if I would, it''s fantastic the way it is.', '2005-11-14 02:27:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1864064, 256902, 47487, '<td valign="top">cute! good idea.</td>', 'cute! good idea.', '2005-11-14 02:28:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1864065, 256821, 47487, '<td valign="top">I like that a lot; it''s quite original. One small quibble; the corners of the images and the corners of the outlines don''t match up exactly, and it''s a bit distracting. But I like the idea, and overall the image is very pretty.</td>', 'I like that a lot; it''s quite original. One small quibble; the corners of the images and the corners of the outlines don''t match up exactly, and it''s a bit distracting. But I like the idea, and overall the image is very pretty.', '2005-11-14 02:29:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1864066, 257430, 47487, '<td valign="top">What a good idea.</td>', 'What a good idea.', '2005-11-14 02:29:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1864069, 257441, 47487, '<td valign="top">I like the idea, but the squeezed/stretched images... I dunno.</td>', 'I like the idea, but the squeezed/stretched images... I dunno.', '2005-11-14 02:31:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1864072, 257334, 47487, '<td valign="top">I think perhaps this would have been better in color.</td>', 'I think perhaps this would have been better in color.', '2005-11-14 02:34:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1864074, 257307, 47487, '<td valign="top">That''s very nice. Good use of repetition, and I like the seamless appearance.</td>', 'That''s very nice. Good use of repetition, and I like the seamless appearance.', '2005-11-14 02:35:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1864075, 255758, 47487, '<td valign="top">Excellent! So sharp, and the colors are so vivid. Looks like a poster. :)</td>', 'Excellent! So sharp, and the colors are so vivid. Looks like a poster. :)', '2005-11-14 02:36:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1864076, 256804, 47487, '<td valign="top">Ha, cute.</td>', 'Ha, cute.', '2005-11-14 02:36:54.000000', NULL, 1),
