(1864081, 256898, 47487, '<td valign="top">I like this. Would look good on the parents'' wall. :)</td>', 'I like this. Would look good on the parents'' wall. :)', '2005-11-14 02:40:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1864083, 256137, 47487, '<td valign="top">every mom knows about this feeling! :)  Clever idea.</td>', 'every mom knows about this feeling! :)  Clever idea.', '2005-11-14 02:41:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1864084, 257310, 47487, '<td valign="top">Interesting. One wants to keep looking at it.</td>', 'Interesting. One wants to keep looking at it.', '2005-11-14 02:42:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1864085, 257111, 28742, '<td valign="top">3 excellent images, but to me they don''t go together visually. The one in the middle especially disrupts the overall triptych because the outer two match up in color at least.</td>', '3 excellent images, but to me they don''t go together visually. The one in the middle especially disrupts the overall triptych because the outer two match up in color at least.', '2005-11-14 02:42:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1864088, 257390, 28742, '<td valign="top">Funny stuff. I have an inkling who might do something like this. If I am right - "Aha, I knew it!" If I am wrong, take it as a compliment. :)</td>', 'Funny stuff. I have an inkling who might do something like this. If I am right - "Aha, I knew it!" If I am wrong, take it as a compliment. :)', '2005-11-14 02:44:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1864094, 257035, 28742, '<td valign="top">Woops - I am going to guess that this one will be DQ''d for using artwork in the border itself. Too bad, because even with a black border, this would have done quite well I think. I''ll give it an 8 in case it survives. Good luck. :)</td>', 'Woops - I am going to guess that this one will be DQ''d for using artwork in the border itself. Too bad, because even with a black border, this would have done quite well I think. I''ll give it an 8 in case it survives. Good luck. :)', '2005-11-14 02:47:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1864095, 256347, 28742, '<td valign="top">Unique and interesting.</td>', 'Unique and interesting.', '2005-11-14 02:47:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1864100, 257156, 28742, '<td valign="top">Not as balanced (color and lighting) as I would like, but an excellent image and decent for a triptych treatment.</td>', 'Not as balanced (color and lighting) as I would like, but an excellent image and decent for a triptych treatment.', '2005-11-14 02:48:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1864102, 257328, 28742, '<td valign="top">Too heavy on the border, IMO. Thin black seems like it would work better here. Otherwise a fine image - well done.</td>', 'Too heavy on the border, IMO. Thin black seems like it would work better here. Otherwise a fine image - well done.', '2005-11-14 02:49:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1864105, 257209, 28742, '<td valign="top">I was hoping I would see some traditional, but not so common triptych images. Happy to see this. Great shots - focus, crops, lighting - the upper left lip-biting bugs me a little mainly because it''s cropped right at the contorted lip. Otherwise, this is still one of my fav''s of the challenge. Well done.</td>', 'I was hoping I would see some traditional, but not so common triptych images. Happy to see this. Great shots - focus, crops, lighting - the upper left lip-biting bugs me a little mainly because it''s cropped right at the contorted lip. Otherwise, this is still one of my fav''s of the challenge. Well done.', '2005-11-14 02:51:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1864107, 257254, 28742, '<td valign="top">Too heavy on the border and the shot doesn''t seem to lend itself well to being split up. Otherwise a good photo - do it again with 5 aces for the latest member challenge. ;-)</td>', 'Too heavy on the border and the shot doesn''t seem to lend itself well to being split up. Otherwise a good photo - do it again with 5 aces for the latest member challenge. ;-)', '2005-11-14 02:53:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1864115, 257138, 28742, '<td valign="top">The pics are fine individually, but 2 colors and a bw doesn''t look too good - at least not here - and the border is uneven and the color would be better black. Any color other than black or white for borders is hard to get away with, but if you do pick a different color, it should come from the palette of one of the images or at least compliment the colors. Hope this helps.</td>', 'The pics are fine individually, but 2 colors and a bw doesn''t look too good - at least not here - and the border is uneven and the color would be better black. Any color other than black or white for borders is hard to get away with, but if you do pick a different color, it should come from the palette of one of the images or at least compliment the colors. Hope this helps.', '2005-11-14 02:56:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1864118, 257107, 28742, '<td valign="top">A great combination! Very well executed - nice photos, simple &amp; elegant borders, perfect arrangement. Definitely and advertising-esque collection. Well done.</td>', 'A great combination! Very well executed - nice photos, simple & elegant borders, perfect arrangement. Definitely and advertising-esque collection. Well done.', '2005-11-14 02:57:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1864119, 256679, 28742, '<td valign="top">...or "two against one" ;-) Very unique and creative.</td>', '...or "two against one" ;-) Very unique and creative.', '2005-11-14 02:58:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1864123, 257080, 28742, '<td valign="top">Well suited for this treatment - I, for some reason, always like to see movement direction left to right - might be a little better if the image were flipped horizontally and retitled "Heading West" ;-) Great job though.</td>', 'Well suited for this treatment - I, for some reason, always like to see movement direction left to right - might be a little better if the image were flipped horizontally and retitled "Heading West" ;-) Great job though.', '2005-11-14 03:00:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1864126, 255374, 28742, '<td valign="top">I like everything about this except the white bars disrupting the center photo. Except for that, a great entry.</td>', 'I like everything about this except the white bars disrupting the center photo. Except for that, a great entry.', '2005-11-14 03:02:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1864127, 256810, 35545, '<td valign="top">IMNSHO, triptych pictures should be three pictures that can stand independently, but together make a stronger whole.  You''ve done it.  The only thing I don''t like is the red and green colorization.  I think those frames would be better in B&amp;W and just have the little girl''s dress colored.  Great idea and execution.</td>', 'IMNSHO, triptych pictures should be three pictures that can stand independently, but together make a stronger whole.  You''ve done it.  The only thing I don''t like is the red and green colorization.  I think those frames would be better in B&W and just have the little girl''s dress colored.  Great idea and execution.', '2005-11-14 03:02:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1864130, 256814, 35545, '<td valign="top">Good subject matter for a triptych, but it bothers me that you broke the span of the bridge.</td>', 'Good subject matter for a triptych, but it bothers me that you broke the span of the bridge.', '2005-11-14 03:03:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1864131, 256765, 28742, '<td valign="top">Not a fan of the odd sized borders with some exceptions - I don''t think it works here, but just my opinion of course - however, the image(s) are so good, I''ll go easy on you for it :)</td>', 'Not a fan of the odd sized borders with some exceptions - I don''t think it works here, but just my opinion of course - however, the image(s) are so good, I''ll go easy on you for it :)', '2005-11-14 03:03:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1864132, 257151, 28742, '<td valign="top">Maybe swap the second and last images? Maybe not. Anyway - well done.</td>', 'Maybe swap the second and last images? Maybe not. Anyway - well done.', '2005-11-14 03:04:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1864134, 257444, 35545, '<td valign="top">You have three pictures that really work well together, I just don''t like the color of the frame.</td>', 'You have three pictures that really work well together, I just don''t like the color of the frame.', '2005-11-14 03:05:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1864135, 257152, 28742, '<td valign="top">Here I almost think the border should be wide enough to block out the gondola posts completely. Good image though!</td>', 'Here I almost think the border should be wide enough to block out the gondola posts completely. Good image though!', '2005-11-14 03:05:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1864136, 256221, 28742, '<td valign="top">Great images, unique arrangement - one that may be debated - but an awesome job!</td>', 'Great images, unique arrangement - one that may be debated - but an awesome job!', '2005-11-14 03:07:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1864137, 255954, 28742, '<td valign="top">Nice. Very well put together.</td>', 'Nice. Very well put together.', '2005-11-14 03:07:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1864139, 256288, 28742, '<td valign="top">Might have been good to leave an element of color in each image - a great job nonetheless!</td>', 'Might have been good to leave an element of color in each image - a great job nonetheless!', '2005-11-14 03:08:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1864140, 257310, 28742, '<td valign="top">Unique and interesting. :)</td>', 'Unique and interesting. :)', '2005-11-14 03:08:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1864141, 256414, 35545, '<td valign="top">I can''t see that the separations add anything to t his picture, and there doesn''t seem to be any rhyme nor reason to them.  The upper one breaks up the beautiful stained glass windows.</td>', 'I can''t see that the separations add anything to t his picture, and there doesn''t seem to be any rhyme nor reason to them.  The upper one breaks up the beautiful stained glass windows.', '2005-11-14 03:08:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1864142, 256120, 28742, '<td valign="top">"Rollover! Rollover!" :D A great series!! Only criticism may be that I think an even border would work better or at least not so heavy on top &amp; bottom. Very well done though!</td>', '"Rollover! Rollover!" :D A great series!! Only criticism may be that I think an even border would work better or at least not so heavy on top & bottom. Very well done though!', '2005-11-14 03:10:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1864144, 257138, 35545, '<td valign="top">The shot of the mallard is great.  The goose (?) on the right seems to be a little out of focus.  I don''t think the B&amp;W shot in the middle does much for the composition.  Next to the green of the mallard''s head, they seem sort of blah.</td>', 'The shot of the mallard is great.  The goose (?) on the right seems to be a little out of focus.  I don''t think the B&W shot in the middle does much for the composition.  Next to the green of the mallard''s head, they seem sort of blah.', '2005-11-14 03:12:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1864145, 256523, 28742, '<td valign="top">Great subject, setup, composition and compositing, nice border, great title. Be proud.</td>', 'Great subject, setup, composition and compositing, nice border, great title. Be proud.', '2005-11-14 03:12:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1864147, 256191, 28742, '<td valign="top">I predict top five for a beautiful and creative entry! Very well done!</td>', 'I predict top five for a beautiful and creative entry! Very well done!', '2005-11-14 03:13:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1864148, 255709, 28742, '<td valign="top">The green is a little hard on the eyes. Otherwise very well put together.</td>', 'The green is a little hard on the eyes. Otherwise very well put together.', '2005-11-14 03:14:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1864149, 257343, 35545, '<td valign="top">Is this going to be your Christmas card?  Good pictures of the dogs.  For purposes of the challenge, I would have made the border smaller, so the pictures of the dogs could be larger and we could see them better.</td>', 'Is this going to be your Christmas card?  Good pictures of the dogs.  For purposes of the challenge, I would have made the border smaller, so the pictures of the dogs could be larger and we could see them better.', '2005-11-14 03:14:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1864150, 256301, 28742, '<td valign="top">One of the few cases where a non-black or non-white border works. Great job.</td>', 'One of the few cases where a non-black or non-white border works. Great job.', '2005-11-14 03:15:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1864151, 257359, 28742, '<td valign="top">Had you reversed the sequence it would''ve been a little funnier. Great collection though. :)</td>', 'Had you reversed the sequence it would''ve been a little funnier. Great collection though. :)', '2005-11-14 03:16:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1864152, 256672, 28742, '<td valign="top">Very well executed.</td>', 'Very well executed.', '2005-11-14 03:16:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1864155, 256690, 28742, '<td valign="top">Very good shots, each of them - but doesn''t seem to work as a triptych. Not saying it doesn''t meet the challenge - just doesn''t work for me visually.</td>', 'Very good shots, each of them - but doesn''t seem to work as a triptych. Not saying it doesn''t meet the challenge - just doesn''t work for me visually.', '2005-11-14 03:18:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1864156, 257197, 30861, '<td valign="top">One of the 2-3 best of the "designer" shots. Very organic triptych, nice work with colors and forms. I hope you do well. SO many entries seem to be accidental triptychs, as it were; no special reason for them to be triparite except the challenge theme.</td>', 'One of the 2-3 best of the "designer" shots. Very organic triptych, nice work with colors and forms. I hope you do well. SO many entries seem to be accidental triptychs, as it were; no special reason for them to be triparite except the challenge theme.', '2005-11-14 03:18:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1864159, 257174, 28742, '<td valign="top">Bingo! Not just a shot with a border slapped over it. Love the colors and the arrangement.</td>', 'Bingo! Not just a shot with a border slapped over it. Love the colors and the arrangement.', '2005-11-14 03:19:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1864160, 256525, 28742, '<td valign="top">Very creative. Great colors too.</td>', 'Very creative. Great colors too.', '2005-11-14 03:20:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1864162, 256902, 28742, '<td valign="top">Clever and fun! And technically excellent. Great work!</td>', 'Clever and fun! And technically excellent. Great work!', '2005-11-14 03:21:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1864163, 255852, 30861, '<td valign="top">This is quite skilfully done.  I look forward to seeing how it was accomplished. My qibble with it is the car under the kid''s ass in the middle panel, but it''s just that; a quibble. I''d expect to see a ribbon hung oin this one next sunday.</td>', 'This is quite skilfully done.  I look forward to seeing how it was accomplished. My qibble with it is the car under the kid''s ass in the middle panel, but it''s just that; a quibble. I''d expect to see a ribbon hung oin this one next sunday.', '2005-11-14 03:21:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1864164, 256711, 29269, '<td valign="top">Excellent images that tell a story. Perhaps it could have been on a ligher/brighter side, as the image describes something positive.<br/></td>', 'Excellent images that tell a story. Perhaps it could have been on a ligher/brighter side, as the image describes something positive.', '2005-11-14 03:21:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1864166, 257137, 28742, '<td valign="top">Nice! Like the progressively larger widths.</td>', 'Nice! Like the progressively larger widths.', '2005-11-14 03:22:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1864167, 257373, 30861, '<td valign="top">This is quite precious. The conversion and lighting both are lovely. I wish there was a tad more breating room at the top on the bookend images, and I feel that the broad white dividers are obtrusive to a certain degree here, but it''s one of my higher scores regardless.</td>', 'This is quite precious. The conversion and lighting both are lovely. I wish there was a tad more breating room at the top on the bookend images, and I feel that the broad white dividers are obtrusive to a certain degree here, but it''s one of my higher scores regardless.', '2005-11-14 03:22:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1864169, 257373, 28742, '<td valign="top">Very cute! A consistent overall border in white would''ve helped, I think.</td>', 'Very cute! A consistent overall border in white would''ve helped, I think.', '2005-11-14 03:23:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1864170, 256734, 28742, '<td valign="top">Looks like a one-way friendship. LOL Nice series.</td>', 'Looks like a one-way friendship. LOL Nice series.', '2005-11-14 03:23:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1864171, 257206, 30861, '<td valign="top">Heck of a nice piece of work. Conceptually first rate. The leftmost panel doesn''t seem quite as crisp and pure as the other two, and that bothers me a bit.</td>', 'Heck of a nice piece of work. Conceptually first rate. The leftmost panel doesn''t seem quite as crisp and pure as the other two, and that bothers me a bit.', '2005-11-14 03:23:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1864172, 257131, 29269, '<td valign="top">I think that such triptychs would have worked much better if the frames did not distort the image. The resulting image could have only drawn the frame boxes around, and not actually moved/shifter other images</td>', 'I think that such triptychs would have worked much better if the frames did not distort the image. The resulting image could have only drawn the frame boxes around, and not actually moved/shifter other images', '2005-11-14 03:24:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1864174, 256909, 28742, '<td valign="top">A little too much shadow / depth in an otherwise fantastic set.</td>', 'A little too much shadow / depth in an otherwise fantastic set.', '2005-11-14 03:24:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1864175, 257376, 28742, '<td valign="top">Would be a good shot for a macro or other challenge, but not very well suited for a triptych arrangement.</td>', 'Would be a good shot for a macro or other challenge, but not very well suited for a triptych arrangement.', '2005-11-14 03:25:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1864177, 256840, 30861, '<td valign="top">This is exceptionally nice &amp; pure. Very Westonesque feel to it. I hope the site likes it as well as I do, but I suspect it''s a lost cause. We''ll see...</td>', 'This is exceptionally nice & pure. Very Westonesque feel to it. I hope the site likes it as well as I do, but I suspect it''s a lost cause. We''ll see...', '2005-11-14 03:27:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1864180, 257371, 28742, '<td valign="top">If the center image was the same height as the others, I would add a point. Or maybe if the white border went wide around the other images as well? That would make the overall entry much smaller though. nice job on the theme and the images.</td>', 'If the center image was the same height as the others, I would add a point. Or maybe if the white border went wide around the other images as well? That would make the overall entry much smaller though. nice job on the theme and the images.', '2005-11-14 03:27:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1864182, 257122, 30861, '<td valign="top">The balance of these elements, color-wise, is quite strange, but it works on a lot of levels. The massive framing coordinates well with the massive artwork in the center panel. Good luck with it :-)</td>', 'The balance of these elements, color-wise, is quite strange, but it works on a lot of levels. The massive framing coordinates well with the massive artwork in the center panel. Good luck with it :-)', '2005-11-14 03:28:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1864183, 255976, 28742, '<td valign="top">Being a man in touch with his masculine side, I wouldn''t hang it in my bedroom, but I wouldn''t object if my wife did. ;-) My feminine side loves it! Very, very well done.</td>', 'Being a man in touch with his masculine side, I wouldn''t hang it in my bedroom, but I wouldn''t object if my wife did. ;-) My feminine side loves it! Very, very well done.', '2005-11-14 03:29:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1864185, 255750, 28742, '<td valign="top">Hats off to this entry!! LOL Very creative and great for the challenge. You could have reversed the sequence and called it "The Season of Excitement!" Hmmm, I just might steal that idea for fun. :) GREAT JOB and good luck.</td>', 'Hats off to this entry!! LOL Very creative and great for the challenge. You could have reversed the sequence and called it "The Season of Excitement!" Hmmm, I just might steal that idea for fun. :) GREAT JOB and good luck.', '2005-11-14 03:31:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1864187, 257243, 28742, '<td valign="top">A nice collection of textures - good job!</td>', 'A nice collection of textures - good job!', '2005-11-14 03:32:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1864189, 256984, 28742, '<td valign="top">Haha! LOL Great stuff!</td>', 'Haha! LOL Great stuff!', '2005-11-14 03:32:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1864193, 256353, 28742, '<td valign="top">Polygamist, eh? LOL Nice job. Keep the facial hair. :)</td>', 'Polygamist, eh? LOL Nice job. Keep the facial hair. :)', '2005-11-14 03:35:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1864197, 257343, 28742, '<td valign="top">Boy I''ll bet this''d look great large! Well done! ...''cept the hat on dogs 2 and 3.  Tough to do though - I tried the other day.</td>', 'Boy I''ll bet this''d look great large! Well done! ...''cept the hat on dogs 2 and 3.  Tough to do though - I tried the other day.', '2005-11-14 03:36:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1864199, 255782, 28742, '<td valign="top">Title suggestion: "Little Things Can Make A Big Impact" - well done.</td>', 'Title suggestion: "Little Things Can Make A Big Impact" - well done.', '2005-11-14 03:37:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1864200, 256307, 3459, '<td valign="top">Great image! A 10</td>', 'Great image! A 10', '2005-11-14 03:38:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1864201, 257205, 28742, '<td valign="top">Outstanding! GREAT job all the way around.</td>', 'Outstanding! GREAT job all the way around.', '2005-11-14 03:38:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1864202, 256915, 3459, '<td valign="top">Perfect, if I could give 11, I would :)<br/></td>', 'Perfect, if I could give 11, I would :)', '2005-11-14 03:38:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1864203, 257272, 28742, '<td valign="top">Mmmmmmmmmmm ! I love Pumpkin pie! Nice, timely and well executed entry!</td>', 'Mmmmmmmmmmm ! I love Pumpkin pie! Nice, timely and well executed entry!', '2005-11-14 03:40:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1864204, 257389, 28742, '<td valign="top">Creative treatment!</td>', 'Creative treatment!', '2005-11-14 03:41:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1864205, 256334, 28742, '<td valign="top">Cuh Yute! :) Nice job.</td>', 'Cuh Yute! :) Nice job.', '2005-11-14 03:42:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1864207, 257206, 28742, '<td valign="top">Very creative and nicely done!</td>', 'Very creative and nicely done!', '2005-11-14 03:43:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1864208, 256414, 28742, '<td valign="top">Not a fan of the triptych treatment for such an awesome shot. Major kudos on the shot though!</td>', 'Not a fan of the triptych treatment for such an awesome shot. Major kudos on the shot though!', '2005-11-14 03:43:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1864211, 257418, 28742, '<td valign="top">Blindingly oversaturated, IMO. Beautiful place though!</td>', 'Blindingly oversaturated, IMO. Beautiful place though!', '2005-11-14 03:46:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1864213, 257444, 28742, '<td valign="top">Bad choice on the border color, IMO. Otherwise nice job.</td>', 'Bad choice on the border color, IMO. Otherwise nice job.', '2005-11-14 03:46:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1864215, 257108, 28742, '<td valign="top">Face looks like a furby! Unreal! Very interesting - cept for the dead fish.</td>', 'Face looks like a furby! Unreal! Very interesting - cept for the dead fish.', '2005-11-14 03:48:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1864217, 256893, 28742, '<td valign="top">Aaaaaaahhhhh!! Now I have to listen to the Numa Numa song to get the cheescake out of my head. <br/> <br/>...Oh - well done on the shots except for the border color - maybe a more tan / beige if not black or white.</td>', 'Aaaaaaahhhhh!! Now I have to listen to the Numa Numa song to get the cheescake out of my head.  ...Oh - well done on the shots except for the border color - maybe a more tan / beige if not black or white.', '2005-11-14 03:49:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1864223, 257307, 28742, '<td valign="top">Fantastic! You nailed it.</td>', 'Fantastic! You nailed it.', '2005-11-14 03:52:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1864224, 256910, 28742, '<td valign="top">Wonderful. A word I don''t use much.</td>', 'Wonderful. A word I don''t use much.', '2005-11-14 03:53:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1864225, 257112, 28742, '<td valign="top">Very cute and creative! Something I would certainly hang in a child''s room.</td>', 'Very cute and creative! Something I would certainly hang in a child''s room.', '2005-11-14 03:54:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1864226, 256804, 28742, '<td valign="top">I don''t see a brown pencil. ;-) Clever &amp; creative.</td>', 'I don''t see a brown pencil. ;-) Clever & creative.', '2005-11-14 03:55:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1864227, 257299, 46097, '<td valign="top">I love the blue. Was it like that out of the camera, or did you need to post process that? And the flow from frame 1 to frame 3, with a different subject in frame 2, works very well. Nice shot.</td>', 'I love the blue. Was it like that out of the camera, or did you need to post process that? And the flow from frame 1 to frame 3, with a different subject in frame 2, works very well. Nice shot.', '2005-11-14 03:57:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1864228, 257299, 22459, '<td valign="top">Nice cityscape with good framing. The verticles are converging a little but overall I really like this tells the tale of the city.</td>', 'Nice cityscape with good framing. The verticles are converging a little but overall I really like this tells the tale of the city.', '2005-11-14 03:57:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1864230, 256221, 22459, '<td valign="top">All three images would be great as standalones. But the whole arrangement has been done beautifully they compliment each other and no one image over rides the other. <br/>The only thing I would have done personally to improve this, would be to maybe crop the base image slightly from the top to bring the other two lower down.</td>', 'All three images would be great as standalones. But the whole arrangement has been done beautifully they compliment each other and no one image over rides the other. The only thing I would have done personally to improve this, would be to maybe crop the base image slightly from the top to bring the other two lower down.', '2005-11-14 04:04:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1864234, 257440, 46097, '<td valign="top">Sensual, saucy, stylish, seductive.....simply superb!</td>', 'Sensual, saucy, stylish, seductive.....simply superb!', '2005-11-14 04:08:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1864235, 256381, 23430, '<td valign="top">very nicely done</td>', 'very nicely done', '2005-11-14 04:11:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1864236, 257116, 46097, '<td valign="top">I just love the composition, and the "monochromatic" effect.<br/>But I wonder why the large frame has a grey background, while the others are black. And the left side of the lower right frame is also not black.<br/>Otherwise, very strong shot.</td>', 'I just love the composition, and the "monochromatic" effect.But I wonder why the large frame has a grey background, while the others are black. And the left side of the lower right frame is also not black.Otherwise, very strong shot.', '2005-11-14 04:19:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1864239, 256765, 22459, '<td valign="top">Nice work but the slight color variation in the three panels is distracting</td>', 'Nice work but the slight color variation in the three panels is distracting', '2005-11-14 04:25:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1864244, 256307, 22459, '<td valign="top">Nice concept</td>', 'Nice concept', '2005-11-14 04:34:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1864251, 257243, 46097, '<td valign="top">I really love the subject, the mood, and the individual pictures. I think that if they were larger, perhaps with a thinner border or taller format, it would have had even more impact. But still a very strong compilation.</td>', 'I really love the subject, the mood, and the individual pictures. I think that if they were larger, perhaps with a thinner border or taller format, it would have had even more impact. But still a very strong compilation.', '2005-11-14 04:39:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1864254, 257119, 16046, '<td valign="top">Excellent work, really "pops".</td>', 'Excellent work, really "pops".', '2005-11-14 04:42:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1864255, 257390, 46097, '<td valign="top">Very simple, and very effective</td>', 'Very simple, and very effective', '2005-11-14 04:46:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1864257, 257394, 36606, '<td valign="top">Love the smoke! only critisism is that the matches are not crisp.IMHO</td>', 'Love the smoke! only critisism is that the matches are not crisp.IMHO', '2005-11-14 04:49:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1864258, 256353, 46097, '<td valign="top">Very well thought out, and put together. So, was his beard sacrificed in the name of your art, or was he intending to shave it off anyway?<br/>Well done..great shot.</td>', 'Very well thought out, and put together. So, was his beard sacrificed in the name of your art, or was he intending to shave it off anyway?Well done..great shot.', '2005-11-14 04:49:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1864260, 257418, 36606, '<td valign="top">Some insane golf course!! Slightly too much saturation for me. Beautiful place</td>', 'Some insane golf course!! Slightly too much saturation for me. Beautiful place', '2005-11-14 04:50:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1864261, 257274, 16241, '<td valign="top">nice, very nice!</td>', 'nice, very nice!', '2005-11-14 04:51:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1864263, 255852, 36606, '<td valign="top">fantastic idea here. Nicely executed too. Only small critisism is that he is slightly blurred in the shots. IMHO Good luck(8)</td>', 'fantastic idea here. Nicely executed too. Only small critisism is that he is slightly blurred in the shots. IMHO Good luck(8)', '2005-11-14 04:51:52.000000', NULL, 1);
