(1864328, 257140, 39850, '<td valign="top">7 - Good selection and good character.  Criticism; tones work well on 1 &amp; 3, 2 undecided on, like the shot, but doesn''t ''flow'' with the other two in my opinion, not because of the ''character'', but the contrast/effect/''feel'' - might be the denim/clothing, darker colors, not sure.  Hard to explain but I tried.</td>', '7 - Good selection and good character.  Criticism; tones work well on 1 & 3, 2 undecided on, like the shot, but doesn''t ''flow'' with the other two in my opinion, not because of the ''character'', but the contrast/effect/''feel'' - might be the denim/clothing, darker colors, not sure.  Hard to explain but I tried.', '2005-11-14 06:34:28.000000', NULL, 1),
