(1864565, 255750, 37875, '<td valign="top">this is the first image that actually caught my eye as interesting!  congrats on a novel idea and a great holiday card!  my only criticism would be that the lighting on the spot lighting on the right side of the hat could have been a little bit softer or more diffused...it doesn''t really show until the third photo, but the third one looks a bit harshly lit (changing the color of red in the hat).  it''s a minor thing, but it''s the one thing that i''m noticing.<br/>congrats again on an AWESOME idea and fun holiday card.</td>', 'this is the first image that actually caught my eye as interesting!  congrats on a novel idea and a great holiday card!  my only criticism would be that the lighting on the spot lighting on the right side of the hat could have been a little bit softer or more diffused...it doesn''t really show until the third photo, but the third one looks a bit harshly lit (changing the color of red in the hat).  it''s a minor thing, but it''s the one thing that i''m noticing.congrats again on an AWESOME idea and fun holiday card.', '2005-11-14 09:48:57.000000', NULL, 1),
