(1864571, 257342, 35545, '<td valign="top">I''d have liked to see a little more color in the pictures -- it''s kind of hard to see the ducks, but that''s the nature of their plumage (you could use this for the camo. challenge!).  The white part of the frame is distracting.  It''s fighting with the light portions of the water.</td>', 'I''d have liked to see a little more color in the pictures -- it''s kind of hard to see the ducks, but that''s the nature of their plumage (you could use this for the camo. challenge!).  The white part of the frame is distracting.  It''s fighting with the light portions of the water.', '2005-11-14 09:50:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1864577, 257191, 35545, '<td valign="top">Well captured, but I would have cropped in more on the squirrell.  Also, the purple frame fights with the other colors.  You''d have done better with plain black and narrower.</td>', 'Well captured, but I would have cropped in more on the squirrell.  Also, the purple frame fights with the other colors.  You''d have done better with plain black and narrower.', '2005-11-14 09:52:46.000000', NULL, 1),
