(1864665, 257142, 7743, '<td valign="top">First off, the immages are quite sharp and each have their own qualities.  As a triptych I think the first one (left) lets the composition down as it does not flow into the second and third.  Both the second and third have some nice green tones in common which allow them to flow together.</td>', 'First off, the immages are quite sharp and each have their own qualities.  As a triptych I think the first one (left) lets the composition down as it does not flow into the second and third.  Both the second and third have some nice green tones in common which allow them to flow together.', '2005-11-14 10:33:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1864671, 257119, 41047, '<td valign="top">nice composition, looks a bit too sharpened tho.</td>', 'nice composition, looks a bit too sharpened tho.', '2005-11-14 10:35:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1864674, 256712, 26756, '<td valign="top">I really like the colors in this one.  The cool tones, grays...really nice.  Nicely presented with the border.  Nothing exciting, just pretty.  Good work.</td>', 'I really like the colors in this one.  The cool tones, grays...really nice.  Nicely presented with the border.  Nothing exciting, just pretty.  Good work.', '2005-11-14 10:36:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1864676, 256915, 7743, '<td valign="top">I like the mood in all three images and they complement each other quite nicely.<br/> <br/>A couple of observations:<br/> <br/>The collection feels bottom heavy.  If the two bottom images were above the full width image I believe this would be alleviated.<br/> <br/>The green/turquoise colour cast in the full width image seems to be out of place since the other two have more of a blue colour cast.  Toning it down slightly would probably help.</td>', 'I like the mood in all three images and they complement each other quite nicely. A couple of observations: The collection feels bottom heavy.  If the two bottom images were above the full width image I believe this would be alleviated. The green/turquoise colour cast in the full width image seems to be out of place since the other two have more of a blue colour cast.  Toning it down slightly would probably help.', '2005-11-14 10:38:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1864678, 256307, 41047, '<td valign="top">this is not triptych really..</td>', 'this is not triptych really..', '2005-11-14 10:40:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1864680, 255758, 7743, '<td valign="top">I see ''V'' for victory in this composition.  Though it goes against the grain of a traditional triptych I feel that it works quite well.<br/> <br/>What might improve it though is to make the black on the basketball the same as the black on the soccer ball and the white laces on the football the same as the white on the soccer ball.  This, to me, would increase the transition from one image to the next.</td>', 'I see ''V'' for victory in this composition.  Though it goes against the grain of a traditional triptych I feel that it works quite well. What might improve it though is to make the black on the basketball the same as the black on the soccer ball and the white laces on the football the same as the white on the soccer ball.  This, to me, would increase the transition from one image to the next.', '2005-11-14 10:41:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1864681, 256909, 14620, '<td valign="top">This must surely ribbon.  It''s exquisite in everyway.  The stark black silouhettes against the soft tones of grey is very pleasing and the composition is top notch.  Nicely set-up transitions. 10</td>', 'This must surely ribbon.  It''s exquisite in everyway.  The stark black silouhettes against the soft tones of grey is very pleasing and the composition is top notch.  Nicely set-up transitions. 10', '2005-11-14 10:42:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1864688, 256221, 7743, '<td valign="top">I like this take on a triptych.  To me it''s a study in colour and texture.<br/> <br/>What I think might improve it is to have less overlap of the smaller images and maybe have them the same size.  Also, the top image I think could be off center a bit.</td>', 'I like this take on a triptych.  To me it''s a study in colour and texture. What I think might improve it is to have less overlap of the smaller images and maybe have them the same size.  Also, the top image I think could be off center a bit.', '2005-11-14 10:45:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1864689, 256307, 16648, '<td valign="top">I''m curious to see the other comments you''re getting. This is interesting, but not what i think of with a triptych, does not seem to meet the 3-hinged-panel descriptin in anyway...I may have to be the out-of the box voter and fight the tide!  Seems very digital arty which is not popular here at DPC.  We''ll see as this is the first image i''ve voted on. Good luck.</td>', 'I''m curious to see the other comments you''re getting. This is interesting, but not what i think of with a triptych, does not seem to meet the 3-hinged-panel descriptin in anyway...I may have to be the out-of the box voter and fight the tide!  Seems very digital arty which is not popular here at DPC.  We''ll see as this is the first image i''ve voted on. Good luck.', '2005-11-14 10:46:34.000000', NULL, 1),
