(1864693, 256221, 14620, '<td valign="top">This is very pretty and nicely set-up.  Not sure that I like the gold around the edges of the inset pictures, a black or white may have been more my tastes, but overall this is a very nice triptych.</td>', 'This is very pretty and nicely set-up.  Not sure that I like the gold around the edges of the inset pictures, a black or white may have been more my tastes, but overall this is a very nice triptych.', '2005-11-14 10:47:30.000000', NULL, 1),
