(1864728, 256913, 16648, '<td valign="top">I am not a big fan on just cutting up one nice shot into 3 with distracting borders. Seems to easy, no real creativity required. However, this is a different take on that idea - i like this. A lot. This one shows some real creative thinnking IHO.</td>', 'I am not a big fan on just cutting up one nice shot into 3 with distracting borders. Seems to easy, no real creativity required. However, this is a different take on that idea - i like this. A lot. This one shows some real creative thinnking IHO.', '2005-11-14 10:58:46.000000', NULL, 1),
