(1864821, 255352, 37961, '<td valign="top">Your missing the Spiritual. I would have given this a 10 had you included that. <br/> <br/>Still an excellent Triptych. 9.</td>', 'Your missing the Spiritual. I would have given this a 10 had you included that.  Still an excellent Triptych. 9.', '2005-11-14 11:21:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1864825, 257395, 16648, '<td valign="top">I know this meets the challenge, but I am not a big fan on just cutting up one nice shot into 3 with distracting borders. Seems too easy, no real creativity required.<br/>Also seems over sharpened.</td>', 'I know this meets the challenge, but I am not a big fan on just cutting up one nice shot into 3 with distracting borders. Seems too easy, no real creativity required.Also seems over sharpened.', '2005-11-14 11:22:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1864837, 255352, 15711, '<td valign="top">This is one of those entries that I can''t decide on.  If I were to see each individual image on its own, I''d go nuts.  But when you put them together and with the color variation, I become confused.  The center shot is my fav. The purple cast one is also good with the light bouncing off of the right arm. I think I''d say up the contrast on the blue one a smidge. I didn''t vote it "down" per se, but gave it a 7. Upon 2nd review and comments, I''m sticking to it for the reasons given above.  I hope this makes sense.  Still well done.</td>', 'This is one of those entries that I can''t decide on.  If I were to see each individual image on its own, I''d go nuts.  But when you put them together and with the color variation, I become confused.  The center shot is my fav. The purple cast one is also good with the light bouncing off of the right arm. I think I''d say up the contrast on the blue one a smidge. I didn''t vote it "down" per se, but gave it a 7. Upon 2nd review and comments, I''m sticking to it for the reasons given above.  I hope this makes sense.  Still well done.', '2005-11-14 11:25:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1864856, 256734, 37961, '<td valign="top">10. I love this. Amazing. Very Emotive.</td>', '10. I love this. Amazing. Very Emotive.', '2005-11-14 11:32:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1864862, 256690, 37961, '<td valign="top">Not fond of the layout, but the pics are excellent and tell a great story. Poor Pup. He will be back for another fight someday I expect. 10</td>', 'Not fond of the layout, but the pics are excellent and tell a great story. Poor Pup. He will be back for another fight someday I expect. 10', '2005-11-14 11:34:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1864864, 256137, 36470, '<td valign="top">I feel your pain!  Very creative!</td>', 'I feel your pain!  Very creative!', '2005-11-14 11:35:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1864866, 257172, 37961, '<td valign="top">I really like the colors here. The blues and whites of the sky. 8</td>', 'I really like the colors here. The blues and whites of the sky. 8', '2005-11-14 11:35:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1864889, 256910, 42181, '<td valign="top">Great shots, shame those rocks are in each picture ;-)  9</td>', 'Great shots, shame those rocks are in each picture ;-)  9', '2005-11-14 11:47:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1864897, 256327, 42181, '<td valign="top">Great idea, good shots.</td>', 'Great idea, good shots.', '2005-11-14 11:49:34.000000', NULL, 1),
