(1864994, 256508, 208, '<td valign="top">Points for originality, but the soft border makes the overall effect confusing, especially the top two panels. Also, neither the sky nor the window match what we see in the middle panel. It''s a very good idea, and I like the individual photos, too.</td>', 'Points for originality, but the soft border makes the overall effect confusing, especially the top two panels. Also, neither the sky nor the window match what we see in the middle panel. It''s a very good idea, and I like the individual photos, too.', '2005-11-14 12:20:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1864995, 257122, 24642, '<td valign="top">Nice touch, has a stained glass feel to it.</td>', 'Nice touch, has a stained glass feel to it.', '2005-11-14 12:20:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1865004, 256146, 46510, '<td valign="top">This is a stunning image.    The colours work beautifully, and the overall impression is an ethereal simplicty that I find very appealing.  Very nicely done. 10.</td>', 'This is a stunning image.    The colours work beautifully, and the overall impression is an ethereal simplicty that I find very appealing.  Very nicely done. 10.', '2005-11-14 12:21:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1865009, 257045, 42181, '<td valign="top">Great shots showing all the beach. 9</td>', 'Great shots showing all the beach. 9', '2005-11-14 12:22:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1865012, 256305, 29658, '<td valign="top">I love the scene. A criticism: the three doors seems to come from one picture. This is not a problem, but there''s an evident distortion in the two external ones. Maybe, using three vertical pictures would have given you more alignment and more pixels... If I''m wrong, forget it.</td>', 'I love the scene. A criticism: the three doors seems to come from one picture. This is not a problem, but there''s an evident distortion in the two external ones. Maybe, using three vertical pictures would have given you more alignment and more pixels... If I''m wrong, forget it.', '2005-11-14 12:23:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1865022, 257243, 46586, '<td valign="top">Too bad it''s so small because textures and colors looked really interesting.</td>', 'Too bad it''s so small because textures and colors looked really interesting.', '2005-11-14 12:24:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1865025, 256835, 29658, '<td valign="top">4 pictures?</td>', '4 pictures?', '2005-11-14 12:25:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1865030, 256509, 208, '<td valign="top">These three together like this is a bit confusing to me, especially with the very different sky lines. As individual photos, they''re excellent; I like the look and feel of them.</td>', 'These three together like this is a bit confusing to me, especially with the very different sky lines. As individual photos, they''re excellent; I like the look and feel of them.', '2005-11-14 12:25:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1865034, 256087, 46510, '<td valign="top">I''m curious to see how your submission goes down with the other voters, but I really like the gritty graphical quality of this.  Very cool image.  10.</td>', 'I''m curious to see how your submission goes down with the other voters, but I really like the gritty graphical quality of this.  Very cool image.  10.', '2005-11-14 12:26:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1865036, 255352, 24642, '<td valign="top">I like how you have used the triptych form to make a point.  The concept is good,  lighting works well and the poses are classical.  The only thing that I think might improove is the color saturation,  A little less or perhaps pure B/W.</td>', 'I like how you have used the triptych form to make a point.  The concept is good,  lighting works well and the poses are classical.  The only thing that I think might improove is the color saturation,  A little less or perhaps pure B/W.', '2005-11-14 12:26:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1865057, 257111, 42181, '<td valign="top">Three lovely shots on their own, but together great. Might have been better with the passage way shot on the left, leading the eye into the shot but my guess is you tried it all ways. Just my thoughts, great triptych all the same.</td>', 'Three lovely shots on their own, but together great. Might have been better with the passage way shot on the left, leading the eye into the shot but my guess is you tried it all ways. Just my thoughts, great triptych all the same.', '2005-11-14 12:30:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1865067, 256751, 208, '<td valign="top">I hate to say it, but I don''t like the selective desaturation here. I do like the concept, each photo, and putting the individual people opposite of where they are in the middle.</td>', 'I hate to say it, but I don''t like the selective desaturation here. I do like the concept, each photo, and putting the individual people opposite of where they are in the middle.', '2005-11-14 12:32:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1865072, 256872, 46586, '<td valign="top">The last one is too dark imho..</td>', 'The last one is too dark imho..', '2005-11-14 12:32:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1865089, 256191, 15711, '<td valign="top">My favorite is by far the blue one on the right. As individual shots, I like them, but with all of the variation of color as a collaborative effort, it just loses something for me.  I''ve had that problem with others as well.  The focus on the left eye is awesome.  Clear and tack sharp. I like the single sat of the brown of the iris as well. The center one doesn''t depict joy, as you can''t really see the rest of the face creating the squinted eye.  This was a tough challenge and you certainly made a valiant efford.</td>', 'My favorite is by far the blue one on the right. As individual shots, I like them, but with all of the variation of color as a collaborative effort, it just loses something for me.  I''ve had that problem with others as well.  The focus on the left eye is awesome.  Clear and tack sharp. I like the single sat of the brown of the iris as well. The center one doesn''t depict joy, as you can''t really see the rest of the face creating the squinted eye.  This was a tough challenge and you certainly made a valiant efford.', '2005-11-14 12:36:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1865099, 256014, 47486, '<td valign="top">Beautiful! Very poetic. For this challenge it would habe been interesting to make the panels of the picture more original/dynamic.</td>', 'Beautiful! Very poetic. For this challenge it would habe been interesting to make the panels of the picture more original/dynamic.', '2005-11-14 12:38:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1865100, 257321, 208, '<td valign="top">It''s three of essentially the same thing, isn''t it? Other than she''s pretty to look at, why have three shots of her? Her expression is the same each time. I do like each picture taken individually.</td>', 'It''s three of essentially the same thing, isn''t it? Other than she''s pretty to look at, why have three shots of her? Her expression is the same each time. I do like each picture taken individually.', '2005-11-14 12:38:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1865117, 257394, 47486, '<td valign="top">Cool idea! But the tip of the match is hard to see. It took me a while to distinguish it from the background.</td>', 'Cool idea! But the tip of the match is hard to see. It took me a while to distinguish it from the background.', '2005-11-14 12:42:59.000000', NULL, 1),
