(1865421, 257257, 22479, '<td valign="top">Love the treatment of the background. I personally think this would work much better without the nude. Still a great entry!</td>', 'Love the treatment of the background. I personally think this would work much better without the nude. Still a great entry!', '2005-11-14 14:39:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1865423, 257277, 39664, '<td valign="top">I like photo 1 and 2 but would have rather seen a rose bud in #3.</td>', 'I like photo 1 and 2 but would have rather seen a rose bud in #3.', '2005-11-14 14:39:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1865424, 256765, 31133, '<td valign="top">Not only is this an awesome photo on its own, the framing is great. Nice to see something a little different.</td>', 'Not only is this an awesome photo on its own, the framing is great. Nice to see something a little different.', '2005-11-14 14:40:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1865425, 257130, 22379, '<td valign="top">I really enjoy the bold colours these artists have used compared to the drab colours they wear. I keep thinking the top one would look good at the bottom the middle at the top and the bottom in the middle. Did you try different arrangements?</td>', 'I really enjoy the bold colours these artists have used compared to the drab colours they wear. I keep thinking the top one would look good at the bottom the middle at the top and the bottom in the middle. Did you try different arrangements?', '2005-11-14 14:41:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1865427, 257371, 39664, '<td valign="top">Photo 1 is awesome.  Photo 2 looks off balance, tilted.  Photo 3 looks blurry and too dark.</td>', 'Photo 1 is awesome.  Photo 2 looks off balance, tilted.  Photo 3 looks blurry and too dark.', '2005-11-14 14:42:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1865437, 256751, 31133, '<td valign="top">I normally don''t care for selective desaturation, but here it clearly contributes to the story. The entries I''ve seen so far are for the most part very good images, but this is one of the few I''ve seen that requires a triptych to tell its story - so it''s the most fitting for the challenge in that sense.</td>', 'I normally don''t care for selective desaturation, but here it clearly contributes to the story. The entries I''ve seen so far are for the most part very good images, but this is one of the few I''ve seen that requires a triptych to tell its story - so it''s the most fitting for the challenge in that sense.', '2005-11-14 14:45:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1865440, 256509, 31133, '<td valign="top">Love the grain and the two figures at the bottom of the center image. Whites are a little on the too strong side, but overall, this is a very pleasing entry.</td>', 'Love the grain and the two figures at the bottom of the center image. Whites are a little on the too strong side, but overall, this is a very pleasing entry.', '2005-11-14 14:47:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1865446, 257111, 5354, '<td valign="top">I know who''s this is - well OK one of the Ripon team ;-)<br/>Nice images, my only comment would be that the tones in the centre one doesn''t keep in step with the other two. A nice warming filter would have brought it closer in ''feel''.<br/> <br/>I gotta get back up there to do that Abbey!</td>', 'I know who''s this is - well OK one of the Ripon team ;-)Nice images, my only comment would be that the tones in the centre one doesn''t keep in step with the other two. A nice warming filter would have brought it closer in ''feel''. I gotta get back up there to do that Abbey!', '2005-11-14 14:49:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1865447, 256137, 31133, '<td valign="top">Heh, heh. Nice work! The boy on the right is the stongest of the three images - awesome profile. This one put a smile on my face.</td>', 'Heh, heh. Nice work! The boy on the right is the stongest of the three images - awesome profile. This one put a smile on my face.', '2005-11-14 14:49:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1865449, 256867, 22379, '<td valign="top">Did the compliment i gave on your gabage photo drive you to do this? This isn''t even a triptych. You could have had fun with the doll for this one, what a shame.</td>', 'Did the compliment i gave on your gabage photo drive you to do this? This isn''t even a triptych. You could have had fun with the doll for this one, what a shame.', '2005-11-14 14:50:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1865451, 255709, 5354, '<td valign="top">These feel squeezed, which may have been intentional, not sure it worked.</td>', 'These feel squeezed, which may have been intentional, not sure it worked.', '2005-11-14 14:51:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1865461, 257323, 5354, '<td valign="top">The monochrome treatment has lost some of the tonal range. There are no true blacks and no true whites, which makes the images look flat.<br/>Good subjectt though</td>', 'The monochrome treatment has lost some of the tonal range. There are no true blacks and no true whites, which makes the images look flat.Good subjectt though', '2005-11-14 14:55:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1865462, 256120, 29474, '<td valign="top">There''s one too many feet there. Great idea.</td>', 'There''s one too many feet there. Great idea.', '2005-11-14 14:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1865466, 256734, 31133, '<td valign="top">Good story! The top and middle images - especially the top - look a tad blown in the highlights. Also, a little more punch in the contrast might be nice. Don''t mind my input though, because overall, I think  this is a really nice challenge entry with exceptionally cute subjects.</td>', 'Good story! The top and middle images - especially the top - look a tad blown in the highlights. Also, a little more punch in the contrast might be nice. Don''t mind my input though, because overall, I think  this is a really nice challenge entry with exceptionally cute subjects.', '2005-11-14 14:56:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1865470, 257444, 5354, '<td valign="top">Orange? wow that really pulls the eye away from the image. Concepts are good, images are beautiful, but orange????</td>', 'Orange? wow that really pulls the eye away from the image. Concepts are good, images are beautiful, but orange????', '2005-11-14 14:58:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1865471, 257359, 31133, '<td valign="top">GOOD catch! Not only am I impressed with the fact that you got to see this little scene unfold (and take a nice series of pictures in the process), I''m blown away - ha ha - by the fact that you could arrange it all in a square frame!</td>', 'GOOD catch! Not only am I impressed with the fact that you got to see this little scene unfold (and take a nice series of pictures in the process), I''m blown away - ha ha - by the fact that you could arrange it all in a square frame!', '2005-11-14 14:59:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1865475, 257299, 43565, '<td valign="top">I like the two ends, but the middle panel breaks the flow.</td>', 'I like the two ends, but the middle panel breaks the flow.', '2005-11-14 15:01:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1865478, 255392, 5354, '<td valign="top">OK, now this is going to be difficult to comment on without sounding very harsh.<br/>The whole image has a ''pink'' tinge, which should have been corrected in post processing.<br/>The image has no real central theme except for window frames you used to form the three panels.</td>', 'OK, now this is going to be difficult to comment on without sounding very harsh.The whole image has a ''pink'' tinge, which should have been corrected in post processing.The image has no real central theme except for window frames you used to form the three panels.', '2005-11-14 15:02:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1865479, 257307, 34759, '<td valign="top">Very creative idea and beautifully shot.</td>', 'Very creative idea and beautifully shot.', '2005-11-14 15:02:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1865481, 256836, 43565, '<td valign="top">Three good shots--the middle is my favorite.  I think a little wider seperation between the pictues would have looked better.</td>', 'Three good shots--the middle is my favorite.  I think a little wider seperation between the pictues would have looked better.', '2005-11-14 15:03:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1865482, 257186, 34759, '<td valign="top">I''m not crazy about the brown border, but I love the photos.</td>', 'I''m not crazy about the brown border, but I love the photos.', '2005-11-14 15:03:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1865484, 256814, 34759, '<td valign="top">Really beautiful shot. Definitely works very well cut into thirds.</td>', 'Really beautiful shot. Definitely works very well cut into thirds.', '2005-11-14 15:03:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1865487, 257444, 34759, '<td valign="top">This is really beautiful. The only thing I would change is the color of the border. Not sure I like the orange so much. It doesn''t really detract from the beauty of the photos though.</td>', 'This is really beautiful. The only thing I would change is the color of the border. Not sure I like the orange so much. It doesn''t really detract from the beauty of the photos though.', '2005-11-14 15:04:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1865489, 257274, 34759, '<td valign="top">Interesting shot. The colors are beautiful.</td>', 'Interesting shot. The colors are beautiful.', '2005-11-14 15:05:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1865491, 256690, 34759, '<td valign="top">Cute. The little one looks kind of like a tri colored version of my dog, who''s tan and white.</td>', 'Cute. The little one looks kind of like a tri colored version of my dog, who''s tan and white.', '2005-11-14 15:06:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1865492, 257035, 22379, '<td valign="top">I like that the background matches the image. It appears the smaller versions have either been oversharpen or are suffering from th resize. <br/>I didnt think macaws were native to america, so interesting that they would appear in a native american artifact</td>', 'I like that the background matches the image. It appears the smaller versions have either been oversharpen or are suffering from th resize. I didnt think macaws were native to america, so interesting that they would appear in a native american artifact', '2005-11-14 15:06:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1865496, 256821, 45000, '<td valign="top">very unique take on the borders...I like it a lot for it''s originality.</td>', 'very unique take on the borders...I like it a lot for it''s originality.', '2005-11-14 15:06:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1865498, 257119, 45000, '<td valign="top">This is a good example of how the three pictures compliment each other wonderfully.  Good good idea...and well execued</td>', 'This is a good example of how the three pictures compliment each other wonderfully.  Good good idea...and well execued', '2005-11-14 15:07:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1865500, 257191, 34759, '<td valign="top">I think this would have looked better if you had zoomed closer onf the squirrel/bird feeder. That way, there would have been more detail shown.</td>', 'I think this would have looked better if you had zoomed closer onf the squirrel/bird feeder. That way, there would have been more detail shown.', '2005-11-14 15:08:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1865501, 256510, 45000, '<td valign="top">All three pictures seem to be a little out of focus, but I really like the idea.  I just hink it would be better if the outer two pictures were more identifiable.</td>', 'All three pictures seem to be a little out of focus, but I really like the idea.  I just hink it would be better if the outer two pictures were more identifiable.', '2005-11-14 15:08:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1865504, 256836, 34759, '<td valign="top">Great photos. The adult''s beautiful  and the baby''s too adorable for words. Nice job.</td>', 'Great photos. The adult''s beautiful  and the baby''s too adorable for words. Nice job.', '2005-11-14 15:09:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1865506, 257111, 45000, '<td valign="top">For someone who has never been to the place in your pictures it is kind of hard to rate this.  I take it these three places are all withing the Fountains Abbey?  Each picture is wonderful in it''s own right, I don''t think they compliment each other as well as they could though.  But still a very good picture..</td>', 'For someone who has never been to the place in your pictures it is kind of hard to rate this.  I take it these three places are all withing the Fountains Abbey?  Each picture is wonderful in it''s own right, I don''t think they compliment each other as well as they could though.  But still a very good picture..', '2005-11-14 15:10:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1865508, 256871, 34759, '<td valign="top">Nice sharp photos, but not the most interesting subject.</td>', 'Nice sharp photos, but not the most interesting subject.', '2005-11-14 15:10:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1865509, 257201, 34759, '<td valign="top">A little blurry and pixelated unfortunately.</td>', 'A little blurry and pixelated unfortunately.', '2005-11-14 15:11:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1865513, 256915, 45000, '<td valign="top">I LOOOOVE this....One of my favorites in this challenge and one of my favorites ever.  The three pictures compliment each other beautifully and just transport me to another world, some kind of fairy land.  And the way the top picture is bigger than the bottom two is great...because it has the most detail and the most impact on the triptych overall.  Astonishing....you get one of my coveted 10''s</td>', 'I LOOOOVE this....One of my favorites in this challenge and one of my favorites ever.  The three pictures compliment each other beautifully and just transport me to another world, some kind of fairy land.  And the way the top picture is bigger than the bottom two is great...because it has the most detail and the most impact on the triptych overall.  Astonishing....you get one of my coveted 10''s', '2005-11-14 15:12:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1865516, 256809, 45000, '<td valign="top">The slanted horizon in the middle picture kind of hurts this...also it seems like the lighting is just a tad harsh on the left shell.  I like the idea though.</td>', 'The slanted horizon in the middle picture kind of hurts this...also it seems like the lighting is just a tad harsh on the left shell.  I like the idea though.', '2005-11-14 15:13:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1865518, 257134, 45000, '<td valign="top">I really liek the colors here and the sense of movement in each picture...although I think the size hurts it a little.</td>', 'I really liek the colors here and the sense of movement in each picture...although I think the size hurts it a little.', '2005-11-14 15:14:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1865523, 257065, 45000, '<td valign="top">Kind of a plain jane picture...Good pictures withing themselves but I don''t believe that the subject is the best for a triptych.</td>', 'Kind of a plain jane picture...Good pictures withing themselves but I don''t believe that the subject is the best for a triptych.', '2005-11-14 15:15:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1865526, 257107, 43565, '<td valign="top">This would make a great ad.  I wish all the lipsticks in the lower left panel were in focus.</td>', 'This would make a great ad.  I wish all the lipsticks in the lower left panel were in focus.', '2005-11-14 15:15:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1865527, 257307, 40019, '<td valign="top">Great concept!  Nicely executed!  This will be near the top! &lt;8&gt;</td>', 'Great concept!  Nicely executed!  This will be near the top! <8>', '2005-11-14 15:15:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1865528, 256982, 45000, '<td valign="top">Haha...I lke this a lot...I do believe it would of been better in color though.  That''s what I think of most when I think of clowns...their bright colors and red noses.</td>', 'Haha...I lke this a lot...I do believe it would of been better in color though.  That''s what I think of most when I think of clowns...their bright colors and red noses.', '2005-11-14 15:15:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1865533, 255739, 31133, '<td valign="top">I love everything about this except for the white in the frame. The oranges and yellows are so rich and deep - I feel that the white distracts from that. This is one truly wonderful flower photo, though.</td>', 'I love everything about this except for the white in the frame. The oranges and yellows are so rich and deep - I feel that the white distracts from that. This is one truly wonderful flower photo, though.', '2005-11-14 15:16:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1865536, 257418, 45000, '<td valign="top">This would of been better with a black border...or even a green one that matches the green green.</td>', 'This would of been better with a black border...or even a green one that matches the green green.', '2005-11-14 15:17:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1865544, 257389, 45000, '<td valign="top">Interesting placement of the border''s and pictures in general.  I probably would of cropped the three pictures to fit each other so it is a little more seamless and smooth.</td>', 'Interesting placement of the border''s and pictures in general.  I probably would of cropped the three pictures to fit each other so it is a little more seamless and smooth.', '2005-11-14 15:18:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1865545, 256948, 45000, '<td valign="top">Wonderful compostition...great colors.  Good job.</td>', 'Wonderful compostition...great colors.  Good job.', '2005-11-14 15:18:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1865547, 257423, 40019, '<td valign="top">The middle picture is outstanding! The others play a nice supporting role.  I''m mixed on the framing, not sure if I like the peach borders, but the placement of supporting pics is unique and does a good job of not cutting up the main shot. &lt;7&gt;</td>', 'The middle picture is outstanding! The others play a nice supporting role.  I''m mixed on the framing, not sure if I like the peach borders, but the placement of supporting pics is unique and does a good job of not cutting up the main shot. <7>', '2005-11-14 15:19:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1865548, 254737, 45000, '<td valign="top">Nice picture...I think it could of been made a little better with more a more interesting subject on the outer two panels.  But still a good picture.</td>', 'Nice picture...I think it could of been made a little better with more a more interesting subject on the outer two panels.  But still a good picture.', '2005-11-14 15:19:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1865549, 256381, 45000, '<td valign="top">Interesting take on a very familiar subject.</td>', 'Interesting take on a very familiar subject.', '2005-11-14 15:19:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1865550, 255994, 31133, '<td valign="top">I''d like to see this a little sharper and possibly even with a touch more color saturation. The left two images are my favorites; nice theme with the leaves moving down the river and under the bridge. The third image doesn''t really seem to fit (I had this happen with my entry, too).</td>', 'I''d like to see this a little sharper and possibly even with a touch more color saturation. The left two images are my favorites; nice theme with the leaves moving down the river and under the bridge. The third image doesn''t really seem to fit (I had this happen with my entry, too).', '2005-11-14 15:19:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1865553, 257389, 43565, '<td valign="top">I like this idea.  I think it might look better if there was a black border around the perimeter of the shots.</td>', 'I like this idea.  I think it might look better if there was a black border around the perimeter of the shots.', '2005-11-14 15:20:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1865555, 257186, 45000, '<td valign="top">Good idea...the ingredients for a recipe or drink make a wonderful idea for a triptych.  With I would of thought of that!</td>', 'Good idea...the ingredients for a recipe or drink make a wonderful idea for a triptych.  With I would of thought of that!', '2005-11-14 15:20:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1865557, 257197, 40019, '<td valign="top">This is a nice composition - well executed.  I could see this in a poster shop or on a wall somewhere.  Looks like it may have been a touch over sharpened, but still a striking picture.</td>', 'This is a nice composition - well executed.  I could see this in a poster shop or on a wall somewhere.  Looks like it may have been a touch over sharpened, but still a striking picture.', '2005-11-14 15:21:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1865558, 257442, 45000, '<td valign="top">Great action shots...I like how the lines match up also...good work.</td>', 'Great action shots...I like how the lines match up also...good work.', '2005-11-14 15:21:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1865560, 255933, 31133, '<td valign="top">This really is a melody - I like it a lot. Love how you''ve made the frame resemble a film negative.</td>', 'This really is a melody - I like it a lot. Love how you''ve made the frame resemble a film negative.', '2005-11-14 15:21:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1865566, 256309, 36060, '<td valign="top">Wow, this picture is wonderful...10</td>', 'Wow, this picture is wonderful...10', '2005-11-14 15:22:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1865569, 257255, 31133, '<td valign="top">I think this has a lot of potential, but for my taste it seems a little soft on the focus. I wonder if there might be more impact if you had chosen a third background color for the doors rather than the two blacks on each end.</td>', 'I think this has a lot of potential, but for my taste it seems a little soft on the focus. I wonder if there might be more impact if you had chosen a third background color for the doors rather than the two blacks on each end.', '2005-11-14 15:23:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1865570, 256221, 36060, '<td valign="top">Wow, this picture is wonderful.........10</td>', 'Wow, this picture is wonderful.........10', '2005-11-14 15:23:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1865572, 255739, 36060, '<td valign="top">Wow, this picture is wonderful.</td>', 'Wow, this picture is wonderful.', '2005-11-14 15:23:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1865573, 256034, 45000, '<td valign="top">Wonderful use of DOF.</td>', 'Wonderful use of DOF.', '2005-11-14 15:24:08.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(1865574, 256592, 39850, '<td valign="top">4 - Good concept.  Criticism; a bit dark, especially around the stamens, the yellow seems to have a green tinge to it too.  Not sure on the placement, nor frame.  The focus is best in 1 on the petals and 3 on the stamens, but not really able to discern the focus in the 2nd.</td>', '4 - Good concept.  Criticism; a bit dark, especially around the stamens, the yellow seems to have a green tinge to it too.  Not sure on the placement, nor frame.  The focus is best in 1 on the petals and 3 on the stamens, but not really able to discern the focus in the 2nd.', '2005-11-14 15:24:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1865575, 256734, 36060, '<td valign="top">Great capture, I like it very much.</td>', 'Great capture, I like it very much.', '2005-11-14 15:24:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1865577, 257142, 45000, '<td valign="top">Each picture is great in its own right...i like them a lot.  And they also compliment each other wonderfully.</td>', 'Each picture is great in its own right...i like them a lot.  And they also compliment each other wonderfully.', '2005-11-14 15:24:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1865578, 256836, 36060, '<td valign="top">Great capture.</td>', 'Great capture.', '2005-11-14 15:24:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1865581, 256734, 45000, '<td valign="top">I like how the images are stacked...reminds me of frames from a movie.</td>', 'I like how the images are stacked...reminds me of frames from a movie.', '2005-11-14 15:25:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1865583, 257125, 31133, '<td valign="top">The light in the left image is very nice. I love the contrast of the bold yellows with the dark backgrounds. This would also be nice with a black or dark green background where the deep red-brown is in the lower right of the center image.</td>', 'The light in the left image is very nice. I love the contrast of the bold yellows with the dark backgrounds. This would also be nice with a black or dark green background where the deep red-brown is in the lower right of the center image.', '2005-11-14 15:25:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1865584, 257095, 45000, '<td valign="top">I like the concept but I think each ball has a little over exposed area at the top.</td>', 'I like the concept but I think each ball has a little over exposed area at the top.', '2005-11-14 15:26:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1865587, 256121, 45000, '<td valign="top">Great colors...I also like the white to grey faded background.</td>', 'Great colors...I also like the white to grey faded background.', '2005-11-14 15:26:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1865588, 257138, 39057, '<td valign="top">Wow...I almost entered the same kind of shots titled Duck Day Afternoon! I chickened out though.</td>', 'Wow...I almost entered the same kind of shots titled Duck Day Afternoon! I chickened out though.', '2005-11-14 15:26:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1865589, 256765, 40019, '<td valign="top">Nice backyard!  :-)  The difference in saturation between the pictures is interesting.  I like the different sizings, but the black space leaves me feeling like something is missing, like it needs a cool border around the whole picture (not the individual ones).  Also, the blue sky in the middle shows some definite Photoshop play - detracts from the "natural feeling" of the sequence. Pretty and unique picture - overall I like it!</td>', 'Nice backyard!  :-)  The difference in saturation between the pictures is interesting.  I like the different sizings, but the black space leaves me feeling like something is missing, like it needs a cool border around the whole picture (not the individual ones).  Also, the blue sky in the middle shows some definite Photoshop play - detracts from the "natural feeling" of the sequence. Pretty and unique picture - overall I like it!', '2005-11-14 15:27:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1865590, 255979, 39057, '<td valign="top">Bravo.....10</td>', 'Bravo.....10', '2005-11-14 15:27:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1865595, 256690, 39057, '<td valign="top">Cool...made me laugh  7</td>', 'Cool...made me laugh  7', '2005-11-14 15:27:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1865598, 256496, 31133, '<td valign="top">Wow. Nice, nice, nice composition. I like the browns (including the frame) with the complimentary gray-blue of the long image on the left.</td>', 'Wow. Nice, nice, nice composition. I like the browns (including the frame) with the complimentary gray-blue of the long image on the left.', '2005-11-14 15:28:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1865600, 257130, 40019, '<td valign="top">I love graffiti art. Great capture of the artists in action!  Cool sequence. &lt;7&gt;</td>', 'I love graffiti art. Great capture of the artists in action!  Cool sequence. <7>', '2005-11-14 15:29:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1865602, 257383, 43565, '<td valign="top">To me this is not a triptych.</td>', 'To me this is not a triptych.', '2005-11-14 15:29:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1865606, 257297, 19959, '<td valign="top">Very neat idea.... To be picky you are missing the 5 ''o'' clock shadow in the third picture! :-)<br/> <br/>Great work.</td>', 'Very neat idea.... To be picky you are missing the 5 ''o'' clock shadow in the third picture! :-) Great work.', '2005-11-14 15:29:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1865607, 257389, 40019, '<td valign="top">Great job!  I love the juxtaposition of the pictures to the skyline.  Very cool.</td>', 'Great job!  I love the juxtaposition of the pictures to the skyline.  Very cool.', '2005-11-14 15:29:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1865610, 256307, 43565, '<td valign="top">This is not a triptych, but it is very artistic and creative.</td>', 'This is not a triptych, but it is very artistic and creative.', '2005-11-14 15:30:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1865614, 257273, 40019, '<td valign="top">Beautiful sky and picture!  The quintessential triptych!  Nicely done.</td>', 'Beautiful sky and picture!  The quintessential triptych!  Nicely done.', '2005-11-14 15:31:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1865615, 257328, 43565, '<td valign="top">Sorry, but to me this looks like it was divided into 3 parts just to meet the challenge.</td>', 'Sorry, but to me this looks like it was divided into 3 parts just to meet the challenge.', '2005-11-14 15:31:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1865616, 256809, 31133, '<td valign="top">The only - hopefully constructive - criticism I  can give is that the image on the left might benefit from being slightly darker in its lower left corner. The composition is perfect, as are the colors.A special note about the middle image:  I love this combination of the three shades of brown in the angled horizonal layers.</td>', 'The only - hopefully constructive - criticism I  can give is that the image on the left might benefit from being slightly darker in its lower left corner. The composition is perfect, as are the colors.A special note about the middle image:  I love this combination of the three shades of brown in the angled horizonal layers.', '2005-11-14 15:31:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1865621, 256909, 40019, '<td valign="top">The shadow bordering really adds to the overall image, nicely done.  The juxtaposition of action to destination is classic. Great shot.</td>', 'The shadow bordering really adds to the overall image, nicely done.  The juxtaposition of action to destination is classic. Great shot.', '2005-11-14 15:33:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1865624, 257243, 39850, '<td valign="top">4 - Like the concept.  Criticism; of course you know how much detail you''ve lost at this size, but cannot be helped.  The white background is not complementary to these shots in my opinion, not sure what color would have worked better.  Arrangement, again not sure, the brick is a lot ''harder'' than the first two and therefore seems a little out of ''line'', especially seeing as the grass is out of focus in it, which likely works better larger, but in this, the main focus is on the bricks.  Cannot discern what the ''sand'' colored surface is in 2, guessing sand or earth, but the pattern makes me wonder.  Perhaps, with the ''height'' seemingly available in these shots of the grasses, a more vertical framing may have worked better, not sure.</td>', '4 - Like the concept.  Criticism; of course you know how much detail you''ve lost at this size, but cannot be helped.  The white background is not complementary to these shots in my opinion, not sure what color would have worked better.  Arrangement, again not sure, the brick is a lot ''harder'' than the first two and therefore seems a little out of ''line'', especially seeing as the grass is out of focus in it, which likely works better larger, but in this, the main focus is on the bricks.  Cannot discern what the ''sand'' colored surface is in 2, guessing sand or earth, but the pattern makes me wonder.  Perhaps, with the ''height'' seemingly available in these shots of the grasses, a more vertical framing may have worked better, not sure.', '2005-11-14 15:34:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1865625, 257191, 31133, '<td valign="top">This is a cute scene - good capture. The bluish-purple frame doesn''t really seem to fit -  might be nice with all black or maybe pick up one of the colors from the image (brick red, dark green, or gray).</td>', 'This is a cute scene - good capture. The bluish-purple frame doesn''t really seem to fit -  might be nice with all black or maybe pick up one of the colors from the image (brick red, dark green, or gray).', '2005-11-14 15:34:56.000000', NULL, 1),
