(1865686, 256821, 46097, '<td valign="top">Simply stunning! Such a tidy interpretation of the challenge. Lovely monochromatic appeal. So well thought out, and perfectly executed. A ribbon, for sure. 10.</td>', 'Simply stunning! Such a tidy interpretation of the challenge. Lovely monochromatic appeal. So well thought out, and perfectly executed. A ribbon, for sure. 10.', '2005-11-14 15:49:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1865687, 257348, 43565, '<td valign="top">I think this would be more interesting if each panel had a different color effect.</td>', 'I think this would be more interesting if each panel had a different color effect.', '2005-11-14 15:49:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1865690, 256592, 20075, '<td valign="top">Not a bad idea.  The focus and DOF is good.  I like the water droplets on the petals.  I think this triptych would be better if the photo on the left didn''t have such a strong orange-yellow tone, while the other two have a greenish yellow tone.  I think that, for balance, either all the photos should have the same tone, or the right and left ones should be the same, while the middle one is different.  Otherwise, very nice shot.</td>', 'Not a bad idea.  The focus and DOF is good.  I like the water droplets on the petals.  I think this triptych would be better if the photo on the left didn''t have such a strong orange-yellow tone, while the other two have a greenish yellow tone.  I think that, for balance, either all the photos should have the same tone, or the right and left ones should be the same, while the middle one is different.  Otherwise, very nice shot.', '2005-11-14 15:50:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1865697, 256916, 39850, '<td valign="top">4 - Like the potential.  Nice colors.  Criticism; if possible slightly different crops, to not ''cut off'' the edges, especially 1 &amp; 2.  The angle in 3 doesn''t ''flow on'' from the first two in my opinion, but perhaps you were going for center detail.  The frame works, but I wonder if a different color may have enhanced the images, especially the colors.</td>', '4 - Like the potential.  Nice colors.  Criticism; if possible slightly different crops, to not ''cut off'' the edges, especially 1 & 2.  The angle in 3 doesn''t ''flow on'' from the first two in my opinion, but perhaps you were going for center detail.  The frame works, but I wonder if a different color may have enhanced the images, especially the colors.', '2005-11-14 15:55:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1865699, 256309, 20075, '<td valign="top">I like this concept a lot.  You''ve captured the birds beautifully!  Great detail and nice close-ups.  I find the background in each shot a bit distracting, however.  I know it wouldn''t be legal for the challenge, but afterwards, you might want to consider placing each bird on a black or very dark background, so that they just pop out.   Although, I admit, I''m not sure how well this would work for the water shots.  Overall, nice job!</td>', 'I like this concept a lot.  You''ve captured the birds beautifully!  Great detail and nice close-ups.  I find the background in each shot a bit distracting, however.  I know it wouldn''t be legal for the challenge, but afterwards, you might want to consider placing each bird on a black or very dark background, so that they just pop out.   Although, I admit, I''m not sure how well this would work for the water shots.  Overall, nice job!', '2005-11-14 15:55:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1865707, 256288, 39880, '<td valign="top">I like the whole look and feel of this one.</td>', 'I like the whole look and feel of this one.', '2005-11-14 15:57:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1865713, 256931, 39880, '<td valign="top">Very creative and the colors look great.  Good job.</td>', 'Very creative and the colors look great.  Good job.', '2005-11-14 15:57:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1865715, 257123, 37893, '<td valign="top">I have to say that this is a unique take on framing the images. I am sure that this will not be appreciated by much of the DPC crowd since it''s out of the box and sometimes non-conformity is nbadly judged. I for one have tried out of the box imagery. The images look under exposed. The squirrel almost looks like the pavement which is a shame. The thing taht attracted me to this image was your frame as you might notice in the abundance, perhaps, of your views but lack of votes (probably). This is of course just my opinion. Good luck. 5</td>', 'I have to say that this is a unique take on framing the images. I am sure that this will not be appreciated by much of the DPC crowd since it''s out of the box and sometimes non-conformity is nbadly judged. I for one have tried out of the box imagery. The images look under exposed. The squirrel almost looks like the pavement which is a shame. The thing taht attracted me to this image was your frame as you might notice in the abundance, perhaps, of your views but lack of votes (probably). This is of course just my opinion. Good luck. 5', '2005-11-14 15:58:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1865716, 257174, 20075, '<td valign="top">Great shot!  I like your composition for each photo.  I think the center shot could improve from som increased DOF, and all the shots could be improved by adjusting the color balance/curves.  There''s a lot of red and yellow here.  Nice job!</td>', 'Great shot!  I like your composition for each photo.  I think the center shot could improve from som increased DOF, and all the shots could be improved by adjusting the color balance/curves.  There''s a lot of red and yellow here.  Nice job!', '2005-11-14 15:58:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1865717, 256840, 39850, '<td valign="top">5 - Another shot which I am sure looks much better bigger.  Very nice - what I can discern.  Criticism; although the copy/flip of 1/3 works well here, I wonder if there may have been more simple beauty framing with just the original, but a different shot then, plus, would also depend how much space you had on the left to incorporate / arrange or not.  The toning works but again, especially with losing so much detail, whether leaving the colors may have given this a boost at this size.</td>', '5 - Another shot which I am sure looks much better bigger.  Very nice - what I can discern.  Criticism; although the copy/flip of 1/3 works well here, I wonder if there may have been more simple beauty framing with just the original, but a different shot then, plus, would also depend how much space you had on the left to incorporate / arrange or not.  The toning works but again, especially with losing so much detail, whether leaving the colors may have given this a boost at this size.', '2005-11-14 15:59:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1865722, 257307, 39880, '<td valign="top">At first glance I thought this was one picture.  As I looked closer I realized those were the same girls in the background.  Well done.</td>', 'At first glance I thought this was one picture.  As I looked closer I realized those were the same girls in the background.  Well done.', '2005-11-14 15:59:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1865725, 256801, 39880, '<td valign="top">The b&amp;w looks good.  I like the look of the buildings.  I would have put the church in the center with a more straight on look.  That way the two similar buildings would have flanked the church.</td>', 'The b&w looks good.  I like the look of the buildings.  I would have put the church in the center with a more straight on look.  That way the two similar buildings would have flanked the church.', '2005-11-14 16:01:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1865726, 257418, 39850, '<td valign="top">3 - Nice colors.  Criticism; a bit ''over bright''.  The arrangement and frame placement doesn''t work in my opinion.  The color and size also do not ''enhance''.  The cropping / framing / padding is not symmetrical.</td>', '3 - Nice colors.  Criticism; a bit ''over bright''.  The arrangement and frame placement doesn''t work in my opinion.  The color and size also do not ''enhance''.  The cropping / framing / padding is not symmetrical.', '2005-11-14 16:01:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1865728, 257352, 39880, '<td valign="top">Nice shots.  A simple and effective triptych.  I like it.</td>', 'Nice shots.  A simple and effective triptych.  I like it.', '2005-11-14 16:02:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1865732, 255987, 39880, '<td valign="top">I like the looking out a window feel I get from this one.</td>', 'I like the looking out a window feel I get from this one.', '2005-11-14 16:02:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1865736, 257201, 39880, '<td valign="top">I like the concept here, but feel the pictures need to crisp and clean.</td>', 'I like the concept here, but feel the pictures need to crisp and clean.', '2005-11-14 16:03:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1865742, 256087, 39880, '<td valign="top">I think a sharper more defined picture would help.   The borders  should all be the same size.</td>', 'I think a sharper more defined picture would help.   The borders  should all be the same size.', '2005-11-14 16:06:15.000000', NULL, 1),
