(1865819, 257307, 39768, '<td valign="top">Very nice! The choice of the white background and the sharp focus only on the front figures is excellent. (would give a 10 if I could vote, how about a favorite instead)</td>', 'Very nice! The choice of the white background and the sharp focus only on the front figures is excellent. (would give a 10 if I could vote, how about a favorite instead)', '2005-11-14 16:33:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1865822, 257348, 39850, '<td valign="top">4 - Colors and framing are nice.  Criticism; needs some variation, in some way, in my opinion, although I realize you may have been going for this ''effect/look''.</td>', '4 - Colors and framing are nice.  Criticism; needs some variation, in some way, in my opinion, although I realize you may have been going for this ''effect/look''.', '2005-11-14 16:34:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1865824, 256317, 20075, '<td valign="top">I love Ovation guitars. :)  Beautifully done.  I don''t know what to suggest for improvements.  Really nice job!</td>', 'I love Ovation guitars. :)  Beautifully done.  I don''t know what to suggest for improvements.  Really nice job!', '2005-11-14 16:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1865828, 256334, 40019, '<td valign="top">Great Xmas Card picture for the Grandparents!</td>', 'Great Xmas Card picture for the Grandparents!', '2005-11-14 16:36:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1865829, 256523, 39850, '<td valign="top">6 - Good concept, well done if this is original.  All nice shots.  Criticism; like to see more detail in at least one frame, obviously preferably the center one, but perhaps you lost a lot in the resize.  1 &amp; 3 do not seem to be cropped uniformly, which may be intentional, but in my opinion, would have looked better if they were, and it were ''balanced'' better.</td>', '6 - Good concept, well done if this is original.  All nice shots.  Criticism; like to see more detail in at least one frame, obviously preferably the center one, but perhaps you lost a lot in the resize.  1 & 3 do not seem to be cropped uniformly, which may be intentional, but in my opinion, would have looked better if they were, and it were ''balanced'' better.', '2005-11-14 16:37:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1865837, 256221, 39768, '<td valign="top">What can I say; WOW!!</td>', 'What can I say; WOW!!', '2005-11-14 16:39:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1865838, 256909, 39850, '<td valign="top">7 - Very nice, and simple, works well.  Criticism; not sure, just seems it needs a little ''lift'' somewhere, not sure how or where, be it colors/toning, outer frame, don''t know.   Of course, it may just be the small size/restrictions, which I have taken into consideration.</td>', '7 - Very nice, and simple, works well.  Criticism; not sure, just seems it needs a little ''lift'' somewhere, not sure how or where, be it colors/toning, outer frame, don''t know.   Of course, it may just be the small size/restrictions, which I have taken into consideration.', '2005-11-14 16:39:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1865849, 256835, 14736, '<td valign="top">I apologize if you have gotten several similar comments, but I think there are four images here...  The background image is kinda distracting to me (looks oversharpened and overexposed).  Maybe if it were blurred or just plain white I would keep my eyes on the three leaves, which are nice photos.</td>', 'I apologize if you have gotten several similar comments, but I think there are four images here...  The background image is kinda distracting to me (looks oversharpened and overexposed).  Maybe if it were blurred or just plain white I would keep my eyes on the three leaves, which are nice photos.', '2005-11-14 16:46:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1865856, 257380, 39850, '<td valign="top">3 - Good concept.  Criticism; the perspective/angle does not reach the potential I see in these shots.  Perhaps getting closer (might mean slowly), or in front, could have captured more ''feel'' for this ''story''.  The toning doesn''t work very well here, especially at this size and the focus doesn''t seem sharp enough, but perhaps you lost some in the resize.</td>', '3 - Good concept.  Criticism; the perspective/angle does not reach the potential I see in these shots.  Perhaps getting closer (might mean slowly), or in front, could have captured more ''feel'' for this ''story''.  The toning doesn''t work very well here, especially at this size and the focus doesn''t seem sharp enough, but perhaps you lost some in the resize.', '2005-11-14 16:50:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1865857, 257050, 39850, '<td valign="top">4 - Like the potential but, criticism; would have packed more punch in color I think, especially at this size, but I understand the concept you were going for.</td>', '4 - Like the potential but, criticism; would have packed more punch in color I think, especially at this size, but I understand the concept you were going for.', '2005-11-14 16:52:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1865858, 257138, 14736, '<td valign="top">The middle photo could use a bump in contrast.</td>', 'The middle photo could use a bump in contrast.', '2005-11-14 16:53:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1865863, 256871, 39850, '<td valign="top">6 - Nice.  Criticism; seems a little ''hazy'', but could be something lost in the resize, not sure, so a little more vivid in color, if possible, contrast dependent, may have made this better in my opinion.  Nice and ''simple''.  Also may have worked well at 640x640, if possible.</td>', '6 - Nice.  Criticism; seems a little ''hazy'', but could be something lost in the resize, not sure, so a little more vivid in color, if possible, contrast dependent, may have made this better in my opinion.  Nice and ''simple''.  Also may have worked well at 640x640, if possible.', '2005-11-14 16:58:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1865867, 255852, 39768, '<td valign="top">I knew there would be images that were "outside the boxes," but choosing a motion series and doing it so well, you deserve a 10. (Sorry, I''m a registered user)<br/></td>', 'I knew there would be images that were "outside the boxes," but choosing a motion series and doing it so well, you deserve a 10. (Sorry, I''m a registered user)', '2005-11-14 17:00:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1865869, 257283, 14736, '<td valign="top">I like the sharpness of the carpet, but on the Hershey bar it appears that the image is much too oversharpened.</td>', 'I like the sharpness of the carpet, but on the Hershey bar it appears that the image is much too oversharpened.', '2005-11-14 17:01:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1865873, 257112, 14736, '<td valign="top">Clever.</td>', 'Clever.', '2005-11-14 17:03:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1865875, 257201, 14736, '<td valign="top">I think you need a longer lens.  Blur and grain are too overwhelming in these photos to ignore.</td>', 'I think you need a longer lens.  Blur and grain are too overwhelming in these photos to ignore.', '2005-11-14 17:04:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1865881, 255987, 46020, '<td valign="top">Wow, the picture itself is. . .well perfect IMO.  What luck to have happened along a sky like that!   I really like the borders though I think I found a mistake on the left pane. Did you mean to have a shadow on the far left vertical?  The other two panes do not have it.  I also notice In the far upper right and lower left corners of the border a slight break in the grey area.  Other than that I wouldn''t change a thing.  Comments meant to be constructive, hope they help.</td>', 'Wow, the picture itself is. . .well perfect IMO.  What luck to have happened along a sky like that!   I really like the borders though I think I found a mistake on the left pane. Did you mean to have a shadow on the far left vertical?  The other two panes do not have it.  I also notice In the far upper right and lower left corners of the border a slight break in the grey area.  Other than that I wouldn''t change a thing.  Comments meant to be constructive, hope they help.', '2005-11-14 17:08:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1865884, 257445, 14736, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shots.  I love the third one especially-- it seems very genuine.  However, there is just so much black space that could have been filled with your lovely subject.</td>', 'Beautiful shots.  I love the third one especially-- it seems very genuine.  However, there is just so much black space that could have been filled with your lovely subject.', '2005-11-14 17:09:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1865891, 256424, 14736, '<td valign="top">Excellent use of DOF, grain, and rotary dial phones.</td>', 'Excellent use of DOF, grain, and rotary dial phones.', '2005-11-14 17:11:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1865898, 256690, 39850, '<td valign="top">7 - Very good.  Another good use of the triptych to show a ''range''.  Criticism; undecided on the framing/placement choice, it works but, if possible, depending what you had to work with, the bottom one full width, may have balanced this out better, or rather reduced the ''dead space'' there.  I do like the bottom shot though, good capture - as is on all.  Good colors and contrast control.  Just a touch more contrast in the bottom one as is with the top two, would also have made this better in my opinion.</td>', '7 - Very good.  Another good use of the triptych to show a ''range''.  Criticism; undecided on the framing/placement choice, it works but, if possible, depending what you had to work with, the bottom one full width, may have balanced this out better, or rather reduced the ''dead space'' there.  I do like the bottom shot though, good capture - as is on all.  Good colors and contrast control.  Just a touch more contrast in the bottom one as is with the top two, would also have made this better in my opinion.', '2005-11-14 17:12:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1865902, 255994, 46020, '<td valign="top">The image on the left is a bit too abstract to "go with" the other 2 images.  The shadows are a bit too dark as well.<br/> <br/>The image in the middle has a bit of leaves obscuring the left arch. (What a pain to clone over bricks!)<br/> <br/>I think the picture on the right could be improved by showing more of the fence to include all of the road. Your DOF in all 3 is impressive.  Comments meant to be constructive, hope they help.</td>', 'The image on the left is a bit too abstract to "go with" the other 2 images.  The shadows are a bit too dark as well. The image in the middle has a bit of leaves obscuring the left arch. (What a pain to clone over bricks!) I think the picture on the right could be improved by showing more of the fence to include all of the road. Your DOF in all 3 is impressive.  Comments meant to be constructive, hope they help.', '2005-11-14 17:14:28.000000', NULL, 1),
