(1865915, 257332, 39850, '<td valign="top">5 - Good.  Criticism; not sure on the toning, especially as it seems too much detail has been lost.  Frame is just a bit too thick, especially top and bottom, in my opinion.</td>', '5 - Good.  Criticism; not sure on the toning, especially as it seems too much detail has been lost.  Frame is just a bit too thick, especially top and bottom, in my opinion.', '2005-11-14 17:19:07.000000', NULL, 1),
