(1866110, 257305, 10047, '<td valign="top">A little small, and the colors seem oversaturated.</td>', 'A little small, and the colors seem oversaturated.', '2005-11-14 18:33:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1866111, 256910, 37103, '<td valign="top">I''m a fan of deserts and I think this badlands idea is great.  Each are beautiful images.  I am glad you ordered them the way you did.  I''m not sure that the background color of gray is my favorite.  It might make the photos pop out more if you used a more contrasty color, maybe white?  Each of these photos looks beautiful in their own right.  There is something a little funny about the placement of the rocks, maybe just that they are exactly on a line with each other.  Overall I love this image.  10.</td>', 'I''m a fan of deserts and I think this badlands idea is great.  Each are beautiful images.  I am glad you ordered them the way you did.  I''m not sure that the background color of gray is my favorite.  It might make the photos pop out more if you used a more contrasty color, maybe white?  Each of these photos looks beautiful in their own right.  There is something a little funny about the placement of the rocks, maybe just that they are exactly on a line with each other.  Overall I love this image.  10.', '2005-11-14 18:33:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1866112, 257418, 44754, '<td valign="top">beautiful shot but doesn''t feel right chopped up.</td>', 'beautiful shot but doesn''t feel right chopped up.', '2005-11-14 18:33:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1866113, 256872, 44754, '<td valign="top">love the perspective</td>', 'love the perspective', '2005-11-14 18:34:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1866116, 256306, 44754, '<td valign="top">very nice. what did it look in color.</td>', 'very nice. what did it look in color.', '2005-11-14 18:34:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1866117, 256307, 6179, '<td valign="top">Not really a Triptych by definition but interesting. I am afraid your score will reflect your use of 98 panels vs. 3 though.</td>', 'Not really a Triptych by definition but interesting. I am afraid your score will reflect your use of 98 panels vs. 3 though.', '2005-11-14 18:34:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1866119, 257186, 6179, '<td valign="top">I thought about doing one similar and calling it three wise men. (Johnny Walker, Jim, Beam and Jack Daniels) Nice.</td>', 'I thought about doing one similar and calling it three wise men. (Johnny Walker, Jim, Beam and Jack Daniels) Nice.', '2005-11-14 18:36:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1866121, 256660, 44754, '<td valign="top">The second and third panels are almost identicle. would have better if the wings were down on the third panel.</td>', 'The second and third panels are almost identicle. would have better if the wings were down on the third panel.', '2005-11-14 18:36:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1866122, 257068, 6179, '<td valign="top">Wow. this really stands out. I think your score would end up even higher if you used a consistent border width. There is even difference between the top and bottom. I think you definitely picked the right color scheme though.</td>', 'Wow. this really stands out. I think your score would end up even higher if you used a consistent border width. There is even difference between the top and bottom. I think you definitely picked the right color scheme though.', '2005-11-14 18:37:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1866123, 256902, 10047, '<td valign="top">Creative. I don''t think the shallow DOF helped this effort. I would have used the board lines when cropping to give all three shots the same angle.</td>', 'Creative. I don''t think the shallow DOF helped this effort. I would have used the board lines when cropping to give all three shots the same angle.', '2005-11-14 18:38:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1866124, 257337, 37103, '<td valign="top">This is beautiful.  I love the way the shore curve around the ocean.  I don''t know how you got those beautiful purple and blues in the water and sky, but they look perfect together.  I also like how you split up this image and used the shadows behind the frames. 9.</td>', 'This is beautiful.  I love the way the shore curve around the ocean.  I don''t know how you got those beautiful purple and blues in the water and sky, but they look perfect together.  I also like how you split up this image and used the shadows behind the frames. 9.', '2005-11-14 18:38:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1866125, 256835, 44754, '<td valign="top">I think this might not be following the rules since this is four shots. I could be wrong. I still like it though.</td>', 'I think this might not be following the rules since this is four shots. I could be wrong. I still like it though.', '2005-11-14 18:38:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1866127, 257140, 44754, '<td valign="top">This dudes been workin a long time. the shots of the eyes are great.</td>', 'This dudes been workin a long time. the shots of the eyes are great.', '2005-11-14 18:39:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1866128, 257257, 6179, '<td valign="top">Nice rosebuds. Looks like the rosebush needs trimmed a little though.</td>', 'Nice rosebuds. Looks like the rosebush needs trimmed a little though.', '2005-11-14 18:40:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1866131, 257123, 44754, '<td valign="top">funny</td>', 'funny', '2005-11-14 18:40:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1866133, 257201, 10047, '<td valign="top">I like the lighting, but the photos are a little soft.</td>', 'I like the lighting, but the photos are a little soft.', '2005-11-14 18:40:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1866134, 257299, 44754, '<td valign="top">I''m guessing this is Chicago. very nice. wish there was more umph in the third panel.</td>', 'I''m guessing this is Chicago. very nice. wish there was more umph in the third panel.', '2005-11-14 18:41:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1866138, 256810, 10047, '<td valign="top">Creative. A little small, and I think I would have made the right panel blue (RGB).</td>', 'Creative. A little small, and I think I would have made the right panel blue (RGB).', '2005-11-14 18:42:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1866140, 256221, 44754, '<td valign="top">interesting</td>', 'interesting', '2005-11-14 18:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1866143, 257441, 44754, '<td valign="top">images are overstreched</td>', 'images are overstreched', '2005-11-14 18:44:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1866149, 257238, 3102, '<td valign="top">Looks like the Neuferland models at work :)</td>', 'Looks like the Neuferland models at work :)', '2005-11-14 18:45:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1866150, 256034, 39850, '<td valign="top">7 - Very nice.  Criticism; not much, unsure on the inner white frame, but it does work.  Like the effect with the two ''side panels'' being blurred/softened/out of focus.  Good coloring.  Difficult at this size, but perhaps more definition, especially on the berries, in the center shot, may have made this better in my opinion.  Good overall balance.</td>', '7 - Very nice.  Criticism; not much, unsure on the inner white frame, but it does work.  Like the effect with the two ''side panels'' being blurred/softened/out of focus.  Good coloring.  Difficult at this size, but perhaps more definition, especially on the berries, in the center shot, may have made this better in my opinion.  Good overall balance.', '2005-11-14 18:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1866151, 256765, 44754, '<td valign="top">Nice yard. not sure how I feel about the sides being cropped</td>', 'Nice yard. not sure how I feel about the sides being cropped', '2005-11-14 18:46:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1866152, 257443, 10047, '<td valign="top">One of my favorites. Can''t think of what I would have done different. Good luck.</td>', 'One of my favorites. Can''t think of what I would have done different. Good luck.', '2005-11-14 18:47:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1866153, 257035, 44754, '<td valign="top">? four shots vs. three</td>', '? four shots vs. three', '2005-11-14 18:47:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1866155, 256221, 10047, '<td valign="top">Nicely done. One of my favorites. I might have put a border around the whole composition.</td>', 'Nicely done. One of my favorites. I might have put a border around the whole composition.', '2005-11-14 18:48:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1866156, 257272, 39850, '<td valign="top">6 - Good idea and execution.  Criticism; definitely at least 640 width, enabling ''larger squares'' would have made this even better.  Coloring is good, good detail (even at this size) in the spices and the pie.  Maybe not so tightly cropped on the right in the center frame, #2.  Framing works.  Nice and ''neat''.</td>', '6 - Good idea and execution.  Criticism; definitely at least 640 width, enabling ''larger squares'' would have made this even better.  Coloring is good, good detail (even at this size) in the spices and the pie.  Maybe not so tightly cropped on the right in the center frame, #2.  Framing works.  Nice and ''neat''.', '2005-11-14 18:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1866161, 255852, 10047, '<td valign="top">Really like the border treatment. I''ll have to learn how to make parts of the photo extend past the borders. Hope you left comments on how you did it.</td>', 'Really like the border treatment. I''ll have to learn how to make parts of the photo extend past the borders. Hope you left comments on how you did it.', '2005-11-14 18:50:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1866166, 256749, 11895, '<td valign="top">the colors look just a bit over-saturated to my eye, otherwise a nice triptych</td>', 'the colors look just a bit over-saturated to my eye, otherwise a nice triptych', '2005-11-14 18:52:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1866168, 257442, 10047, '<td valign="top">I like how you cascaded the photos to align the yard lines. Well composed.</td>', 'I like how you cascaded the photos to align the yard lines. Well composed.', '2005-11-14 18:52:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1866169, 255987, 39850, '<td valign="top">7 - Nice, simple, good 3d effect, good colors and good ''window illusion''.  Criticism; not much, seems to be a minor ''flaw'' top right on the semi-transparent blue inner frame.  Perhaps the ''3d effect'' (inner shadow) applied more uniformly may have given even more impact, not sure, but does seem you applied it to the first panel ''entirely'' but not 2 &amp; 3.  Good detail in the grass and sky, even at this size.  Nice balance and good ''flow''.</td>', '7 - Nice, simple, good 3d effect, good colors and good ''window illusion''.  Criticism; not much, seems to be a minor ''flaw'' top right on the semi-transparent blue inner frame.  Perhaps the ''3d effect'' (inner shadow) applied more uniformly may have given even more impact, not sure, but does seem you applied it to the first panel ''entirely'' but not 2 & 3.  Good detail in the grass and sky, even at this size.  Nice balance and good ''flow''.', '2005-11-14 18:52:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1866170, 257423, 42567, '<td valign="top">Very nice..!  Good job!</td>', 'Very nice..!  Good job!', '2005-11-14 18:53:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1866172, 257156, 42567, '<td valign="top">cool picture..Great job!</td>', 'cool picture..Great job!', '2005-11-14 18:53:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1866173, 256334, 42567, '<td valign="top">cute...</td>', 'cute...', '2005-11-14 18:54:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1866174, 257111, 47953, '<td valign="top">I love the contrasting themes behind the 3 images, greenery, animals, architecture</td>', 'I love the contrasting themes behind the 3 images, greenery, animals, architecture', '2005-11-14 18:54:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1866175, 257216, 42567, '<td valign="top">Great job with three different pictures into one..!!  9</td>', 'Great job with three different pictures into one..!!  9', '2005-11-14 18:55:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1866177, 256121, 11895, '<td valign="top">very nice shots of the feathers, and colorful, but the framing is a little too gimmicky, it takes attention away from the images</td>', 'very nice shots of the feathers, and colorful, but the framing is a little too gimmicky, it takes attention away from the images', '2005-11-14 18:55:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1866178, 257394, 42567, '<td valign="top">very nice!</td>', 'very nice!', '2005-11-14 18:55:34.000000', NULL, 1);
