(1866194, 257307, 43844, '<td valign="top">Great shot.  I love the borderless set up.  Should be in a fashion magazine.  I will pick at one tiny thing however, the girls in the back of your left frame aren''t on the same plane as in the other two frames.  Hey, still gave it a 10!</td>', 'Great shot.  I love the borderless set up.  Should be in a fashion magazine.  I will pick at one tiny thing however, the girls in the back of your left frame aren''t on the same plane as in the other two frames.  Hey, still gave it a 10!', '2005-11-14 19:01:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1866195, 256913, 42567, '<td valign="top">very nice..!!</td>', 'very nice..!!', '2005-11-14 19:01:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1866196, 256170, 42567, '<td valign="top">cool...very nice!</td>', 'cool...very nice!', '2005-11-14 19:02:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1866197, 256765, 43844, '<td valign="top">Great cropping job.  The shadows are very intense and prominent.  I wonder how it would look in b/w with a bump in contrast.  Might just give Ansel Adams a run for his money!</td>', 'Great cropping job.  The shadows are very intense and prominent.  I wonder how it would look in b/w with a bump in contrast.  Might just give Ansel Adams a run for his money!', '2005-11-14 19:02:25.000000', NULL, 1),
