(1866200, 256221, 43844, '<td valign="top">I can almost smell the air from here.  I like how you got the green to pop despite the clouds.  Original framing as well.</td>', 'I can almost smell the air from here.  I like how you got the green to pop despite the clouds.  Original framing as well.', '2005-11-14 19:03:09.000000', NULL, 1),
