(1866206, 256814, 43844, '<td valign="top">I''ve been here a few times before.  I wasn''t into photography then but even if I had been, not sure I would have come remotely close to this.  Beautiful picture.  Makes me want to move back to Frisco.</td>', 'I''ve been here a few times before.  I wasn''t into photography then but even if I had been, not sure I would have come remotely close to this.  Beautiful picture.  Makes me want to move back to Frisco.', '2005-11-14 19:05:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1866208, 256690, 11895, '<td valign="top">very good pictures but I don''t care for the set up</td>', 'very good pictures but I don''t care for the set up', '2005-11-14 19:05:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1866209, 257151, 42567, '<td valign="top">How cute.!!  9</td>', 'How cute.!!  9', '2005-11-14 19:06:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1866211, 256909, 43844, '<td valign="top">Peaceful.  Very soft and perfect for this challenge.  I love the 3-D frames.</td>', 'Peaceful.  Very soft and perfect for this challenge.  I love the 3-D frames.', '2005-11-14 19:06:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1866212, 257068, 38732, '<td valign="top">Kind of a giveaway as I was checking out your website today :)  Very beautiful.  I love the shadow effect for each individual shot.  Looks more like artwork hanging on a gallery wall instead of a typical flat triptych shot.<br/> <br/>Too bad I can''t vote.</td>', 'Kind of a giveaway as I was checking out your website today :)  Very beautiful.  I love the shadow effect for each individual shot.  Looks more like artwork hanging on a gallery wall instead of a typical flat triptych shot. Too bad I can''t vote.', '2005-11-14 19:07:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1866216, 257036, 43844, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure I would have "seen" this picture in the making had I been on location, but you certainly did.  That''s why you get a 9 from me while I continue to ponder for days anew.</td>', 'I''m not sure I would have "seen" this picture in the making had I been on location, but you certainly did.  That''s why you get a 9 from me while I continue to ponder for days anew.', '2005-11-14 19:09:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1866217, 257111, 40019, '<td valign="top">Lovely pictures, all of them!  I just think there are a little too close together.  I would have preferred some border between them (black) to make them stand out a little more.  Together like this - creates a very busy mix of images and you lose the subtilities of each.</td>', 'Lovely pictures, all of them!  I just think there are a little too close together.  I would have preferred some border between them (black) to make them stand out a little more.  Together like this - creates a very busy mix of images and you lose the subtilities of each.', '2005-11-14 19:09:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1866219, 257444, 11895, '<td valign="top">I like the way the color of the border goes with the shots but the middle image doesn''t seem to fit well with the other two</td>', 'I like the way the color of the border goes with the shots but the middle image doesn''t seem to fit well with the other two', '2005-11-14 19:11:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1866220, 257328, 40019, '<td valign="top">It''s a nice picture, and fits the challenge, but I''m not sure if the triptych really adds anything to the image.</td>', 'It''s a nice picture, and fits the challenge, but I''m not sure if the triptych really adds anything to the image.', '2005-11-14 19:12:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1866221, 256309, 43844, '<td valign="top">Great action shots.  I would have spent hours debating the sequence.  Seems top picture should be followed by the bottom one.  Yet, the center image is the right center image.</td>', 'Great action shots.  I would have spent hours debating the sequence.  Seems top picture should be followed by the bottom one.  Yet, the center image is the right center image.', '2005-11-14 19:12:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1866222, 257174, 43844, '<td valign="top">Original and inventive.  I wish I had a pool table!</td>', 'Original and inventive.  I wish I had a pool table!', '2005-11-14 19:13:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1866224, 256307, 11895, '<td valign="top">the gimmicky presentation doesn''t let the images breath</td>', 'the gimmicky presentation doesn''t let the images breath', '2005-11-14 19:13:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1866225, 257077, 40019, '<td valign="top">Lovely picture.  Not sure if the triptych adds or detracts from this image.  I love the picture itself though - great DOF, texture and rich colors.</td>', 'Lovely picture.  Not sure if the triptych adds or detracts from this image.  I love the picture itself though - great DOF, texture and rich colors.', '2005-11-14 19:13:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1866226, 256902, 43844, '<td valign="top">Ya, but how many are mortgaged?  Fun and very well done.  Fits the challenge very well.</td>', 'Ya, but how many are mortgaged?  Fun and very well done.  Fits the challenge very well.', '2005-11-14 19:14:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1866228, 256804, 40019, '<td valign="top">Oh, if only it were that easy!  Great concept!  Lighting is a little harsh though.</td>', 'Oh, if only it were that easy!  Great concept!  Lighting is a little harsh though.', '2005-11-14 19:14:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1866230, 256915, 43844, '<td valign="top">Makes me want to get out of the city.  Beautiful ensemble.</td>', 'Makes me want to get out of the city.  Beautiful ensemble.', '2005-11-14 19:15:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1866232, 256286, 40019, '<td valign="top">Strong powerful image!  You should sell this to the local authorities for a recruitment poster!  :-)</td>', 'Strong powerful image!  You should sell this to the local authorities for a recruitment poster!  :-)', '2005-11-14 19:15:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1866233, 255979, 43844, '<td valign="top">Not the first, not the only water drop triptych, but the best one...in my humble opinion.</td>', 'Not the first, not the only water drop triptych, but the best one...in my humble opinion.', '2005-11-14 19:16:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1866236, 257206, 43844, '<td valign="top">I have to learn how to do this.  Need a singer?</td>', 'I have to learn how to do this.  Need a singer?', '2005-11-14 19:16:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1866237, 257376, 40019, '<td valign="top">Great macro!  Not sure if the triptych really adds anything to the image, but I love the detail, colors and texture of the picture itself - nicely done.</td>', 'Great macro!  Not sure if the triptych really adds anything to the image, but I love the detail, colors and texture of the picture itself - nicely done.', '2005-11-14 19:16:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1866241, 256087, 40019, '<td valign="top">I like the concept, but the image is a little to blurry and noisey for me.  Also, the pictures themselves are not aligned - the image on the left is lower then the middle and far right side.</td>', 'I like the concept, but the image is a little to blurry and noisey for me.  Also, the pictures themselves are not aligned - the image on the left is lower then the middle and far right side.', '2005-11-14 19:19:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1866244, 256982, 11895, '<td valign="top">these look like some great photos, they probably deserve to be seen in larger versions, and maybe color;  triptych is technically well done but leaves me wishing to see the shots in a different venue</td>', 'these look like some great photos, they probably deserve to be seen in larger versions, and maybe color;  triptych is technically well done but leaves me wishing to see the shots in a different venue', '2005-11-14 19:19:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1866256, 256121, 39850, '<td valign="top">6 - Nice.  Good title.  Criticism; not sure on the outer ''padding'', does give a 3d type of effect but not sure it complements the ''light and delicate'' nature of the ''set''.  Middle shot not sure on, especially cropping, size and loss of color and detail - again though, likely looks quite different ''wall size''.  Colors overall are nice, but would like to see all a little ''richer''.  Similar detail in #3 as in #1 would also make this a better triptych in my opinion.</td>', '6 - Nice.  Good title.  Criticism; not sure on the outer ''padding'', does give a 3d type of effect but not sure it complements the ''light and delicate'' nature of the ''set''.  Middle shot not sure on, especially cropping, size and loss of color and detail - again though, likely looks quite different ''wall size''.  Colors overall are nice, but would like to see all a little ''richer''.  Similar detail in #3 as in #1 would also make this a better triptych in my opinion.', '2005-11-14 19:22:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1866276, 255835, 40019, '<td valign="top">Great concept, great alignment - nicely done!</td>', 'Great concept, great alignment - nicely done!', '2005-11-14 19:28:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1866279, 257359, 2560, '<td valign="top">I''m giving you points for telling a story, even if it isn''t the greatest story.</td>', 'I''m giving you points for telling a story, even if it isn''t the greatest story.', '2005-11-14 19:28:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1866283, 256034, 40019, '<td valign="top">I think this would have been more effective if all the pictures were in focus. IMO</td>', 'I think this would have been more effective if all the pictures were in focus. IMO', '2005-11-14 19:29:04.000000', NULL, 1),
