(1866530, 257371, 40718, '<td valign="top">The lighting is a bit tough.  The flames are quite blown on the left and the wine color on the right doesn''t blend well with candlelight.  A good idea though and I don''t mind the landscape center. 5</td>', 'The lighting is a bit tough.  The flames are quite blown on the left and the wine color on the right doesn''t blend well with candlelight.  A good idea though and I don''t mind the landscape center. 5', '2005-11-14 20:41:10.000000', NULL, 1),
