(1866741, 257273, 26313, '<td valign="top">Great colours. This is one of those photos that really doesn''t benefit from the triptych treatment. Not that it really takes away from it, but there are other submissions of equal or lesser photos that put the effect to good use, and have greater impact for it.</td>', 'Great colours. This is one of those photos that really doesn''t benefit from the triptych treatment. Not that it really takes away from it, but there are other submissions of equal or lesser photos that put the effect to good use, and have greater impact for it.', '2005-11-14 21:42:25.000000', NULL, 1),
