(1866771, 257348, 26313, '<td valign="top">I feel like I''m playing one of those "count the differences" games--these are the same photo right? Wouldn''t work for most, but I kind of like it here, the repetition of an interesting texture and pattern. I think I would simplify the border a little (plain black would do it for me I think).</td>', 'I feel like I''m playing one of those "count the differences" games--these are the same photo right? Wouldn''t work for most, but I kind of like it here, the repetition of an interesting texture and pattern. I think I would simplify the border a little (plain black would do it for me I think).', '2005-11-14 21:55:23.000000', NULL, 1),
