(1867070, 256424, 27763, '<td valign="top">Ooh.  Love the photos and the title.  Great use of shallow DOF.  Graininess and sepia is perfect for this.  Only nitpick is that I wish the left photo and the right photo were not mirrors of each other.  Still great work, though. 8.</td>', 'Ooh.  Love the photos and the title.  Great use of shallow DOF.  Graininess and sepia is perfect for this.  Only nitpick is that I wish the left photo and the right photo were not mirrors of each other.  Still great work, though. 8.', '2005-11-14 23:34:15.000000', NULL, 1),
