(1867086, 257157, 22379, '<td valign="top">Beautiful scene. The gaps (streets??) between the houses really lent well to a triptych. Love the  reflections, especially where they have been broken by the rocks. Very pretty.</td>', 'Beautiful scene. The gaps (streets??) between the houses really lent well to a triptych. Love the  reflections, especially where they have been broken by the rocks. Very pretty.', '2005-11-14 23:42:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1867088, 257394, 22379, '<td valign="top">I''m a suker for a smoke shot (probably ibecause i cant do them myself). I personally would have dropped the title and put the red smoke in the middle since it is more blobby and the g and b taller.</td>', 'I''m a suker for a smoke shot (probably ibecause i cant do them myself). I personally would have dropped the title and put the red smoke in the middle since it is more blobby and the g and b taller.', '2005-11-14 23:44:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1867106, 257173, 22379, '<td valign="top">Great use of selective desat. The method seems to work wonderfully in triptych. A normally don''t like ellaborate frames, but consider a thin (like 1 px) black frame around the white of the ikages. It is missing something to really make the images pop from the frame. Lovely scene, with great composition.</td>', 'Great use of selective desat. The method seems to work wonderfully in triptych. A normally don''t like ellaborate frames, but consider a thin (like 1 px) black frame around the white of the ikages. It is missing something to really make the images pop from the frame. Lovely scene, with great composition.', '2005-11-14 23:52:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1867107, 257157, 36920, '<td valign="top">love the transparent colors!  great capture!</td>', 'love the transparent colors!  great capture!', '2005-11-14 23:52:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1867111, 256765, 20075, '<td valign="top">I think you really made this one work by using smaller sized left and right panels.  It''s a great shot, but wouldn''t have been as interesting if you had left them all the same size.  Very beautifully done!</td>', 'I think you really made this one work by using smaller sized left and right panels.  It''s a great shot, but wouldn''t have been as interesting if you had left them all the same size.  Very beautifully done!', '2005-11-14 23:53:48.000000', NULL, 1),
