(1867420, 255852, 23478, '<td valign="top">Excellent job, the only downside is the background (the barn, fence, car) is a big distraction.  That is the only thing holding this back.  9.</td>', 'Excellent job, the only downside is the background (the barn, fence, car) is a big distraction.  That is the only thing holding this back.  9.', '2005-11-15 03:23:10.000000', NULL, 1),
