(1867559, 256221, 41999, '<td valign="top">The background image is absolutely stunning...a winner in any landscape challenge. Unfortunately, the insets detract from, rather than enhance, this fine image. 8</td>', 'The background image is absolutely stunning...a winner in any landscape challenge. Unfortunately, the insets detract from, rather than enhance, this fine image. 8', '2005-11-15 06:56:55.000000', NULL, 1),
