(1867561, 257205, 25742, '<td valign="top">ok, you''re trying to get outside the box with different locations for the frames. unfortunately, for me, it does not work. I find the broken line of the bridge particularly unsettling. <br/>however, the capture itself is good, the exposure and light good.<br/>better luck next time.</td>', 'ok, you''re trying to get outside the box with different locations for the frames. unfortunately, for me, it does not work. I find the broken line of the bridge particularly unsettling. however, the capture itself is good, the exposure and light good.better luck next time.', '2005-11-15 07:01:42.000000', NULL, 1),
