(1867574, 257444, 25742, '<td valign="top">border is too garish. the OOF BG in middle frame is distracting. other than that I really like the subject and handling and thougth in this.</td>', 'border is too garish. the OOF BG in middle frame is distracting. other than that I really like the subject and handling and thougth in this.', '2005-11-15 07:07:06.000000', NULL, 1),
