(1868368, 256306, 24454, '<td valign="top">This is SO pretty!   I think the triptich style works very well with this photo.   I can almost see an elegant cursive title on the bottom part of the border.  I really love this one.  10</td>', 'This is SO pretty!   I think the triptich style works very well with this photo.   I can almost see an elegant cursive title on the bottom part of the border.  I really love this one.  10', '2005-11-15 12:13:56.000000', NULL, 1),
