(1868736, 257205, 40718, '<td valign="top">This is a more unusual take on the single panorama view.  I like the duplicated portions.  Your colors are nice as well. 8</td>', 'This is a more unusual take on the single panorama view.  I like the duplicated portions.  Your colors are nice as well. 8', '2005-11-15 13:41:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1868741, 255782, 47184, '<td valign="top">Cool</td>', 'Cool', '2005-11-15 13:42:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1868742, 256801, 40718, '<td valign="top">Nice grayscale!  You did well.  I may have put the two modern buildings on each side as they echo each other better.  The classical building seems to stand on its own a bit. 7</td>', 'Nice grayscale!  You did well.  I may have put the two modern buildings on each side as they echo each other better.  The classical building seems to stand on its own a bit. 7', '2005-11-15 13:42:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1868744, 257142, 40718, '<td valign="top">There is a blue cast to the pictures.  I like the composition of each though.  I think the deer in the middle would have been nice to provide balance to the birds.</td>', 'There is a blue cast to the pictures.  I like the composition of each though.  I think the deer in the middle would have been nice to provide balance to the birds.', '2005-11-15 13:43:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1868746, 256347, 40718, '<td valign="top">Cool effect.  I don''t quite like the vertical filter.</td>', 'Cool effect.  I don''t quite like the vertical filter.', '2005-11-15 13:43:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1868749, 257184, 40718, '<td valign="top">Nice shots.  The top and bottom are too alike though.  The lighting looks a little flat, but that was a product of the weather and not you.</td>', 'Nice shots.  The top and bottom are too alike though.  The lighting looks a little flat, but that was a product of the weather and not you.', '2005-11-15 13:44:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1868750, 256334, 22379, '<td valign="top">This is so festive and entertaining.  Sneaky Santa. I''m glad you were brave and went frameless, this is not suited to a frame. I hope this ends up being youre xmas card!!</td>', 'This is so festive and entertaining.  Sneaky Santa. I''m glad you were brave and went frameless, this is not suited to a frame. I hope this ends up being youre xmas card!!', '2005-11-15 13:45:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1868753, 255782, 40718, '<td valign="top">Nice temporal progression.  The splash in the middle looks out of place as the lighting looks different.</td>', 'Nice temporal progression.  The splash in the middle looks out of place as the lighting looks different.', '2005-11-15 13:45:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1868756, 257443, 40718, '<td valign="top">Very cool.  Each panel could stand on it''s own.  They go together i n a nice vista.  I''m not sure about the double color border, but I can''t tell you what would look better. 8</td>', 'Very cool.  Each panel could stand on it''s own.  They go together i n a nice vista.  I''m not sure about the double color border, but I can''t tell you what would look better. 8', '2005-11-15 13:46:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1868757, 257431, 40718, '<td valign="top">An interesting study. The texture is nicely captured.</td>', 'An interesting study. The texture is nicely captured.', '2005-11-15 13:47:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1868759, 256911, 22379, '<td valign="top">I believe this most be the most effective description of an object via a triptych i have seen in this challenge. The middle one seems to lack the sharpness of the top and bottom. Made me want a bike again!</td>', 'I believe this most be the most effective description of an object via a triptych i have seen in this challenge. The middle one seems to lack the sharpness of the top and bottom. Made me want a bike again!', '2005-11-15 13:47:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1868760, 256712, 40718, '<td valign="top">The buoy on the left is great.  Could you have replaced the object on the right?  It looks too much like a plastic bag.  The color of the boat is excellent. 7</td>', 'The buoy on the left is great.  Could you have replaced the object on the right?  It looks too much like a plastic bag.  The color of the boat is excellent. 7', '2005-11-15 13:48:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1868761, 256309, 16154, '<td valign="top">Great background, great sharpness, great capture. 100% winner</td>', 'Great background, great sharpness, great capture. 100% winner', '2005-11-15 13:48:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1868764, 255979, 40718, '<td valign="top">The grey bottom is weird.  Is that the dish?  I like the splashes though.  They go together well.  The color isn''t too bad, but might have been better in a different direction.</td>', 'The grey bottom is weird.  Is that the dish?  I like the splashes though.  They go together well.  The color isn''t too bad, but might have been better in a different direction.', '2005-11-15 13:49:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1868768, 256915, 22379, '<td valign="top">This is just a stunning set. You can allmost feel the dampness of the morning mist on your skin. What a blessing to be present at this serene moment.</td>', 'This is just a stunning set. You can allmost feel the dampness of the morning mist on your skin. What a blessing to be present at this serene moment.', '2005-11-15 13:50:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1868771, 256697, 40718, '<td valign="top">The small canvas costs you detail.  Too bad.  The images go together well though. 6</td>', 'The small canvas costs you detail.  Too bad.  The images go together well though. 6', '2005-11-15 13:51:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1868772, 256910, 40718, '<td valign="top">Great contrasts.  I think the center panel would have echoed stronger if you had included sky there as well.  I like the textures and colors. 7</td>', 'Great contrasts.  I think the center panel would have echoed stronger if you had included sky there as well.  I like the textures and colors. 7', '2005-11-15 13:52:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1868775, 257206, 22379, '<td valign="top">Nice one man band you have got goingn there! Extra point for letting the story pop to the frame and get in the way of the next "member". Very neat conception.</td>', 'Nice one man band you have got goingn there! Extra point for letting the story pop to the frame and get in the way of the next "member". Very neat conception.', '2005-11-15 13:52:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1868776, 257381, 40718, '<td valign="top">Neat idea.  i like it a lot.  8 for now.</td>', 'Neat idea.  i like it a lot.  8 for now.', '2005-11-15 13:53:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1868785, 256821, 22379, '<td valign="top">This is a fantastically creative take on the theme. I love where you chose the frames. The image really plays well to be broken into 3 smaller sections with the curves and perspective of the bank. I can see this as a website layout on so easierly. Bumping Up.</td>', 'This is a fantastically creative take on the theme. I love where you chose the frames. The image really plays well to be broken into 3 smaller sections with the curves and perspective of the bank. I can see this as a website layout on so easierly. Bumping Up.', '2005-11-15 13:57:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1868798, 256909, 22379, '<td valign="top">It is just amazing what a difference an effective boarder can make in these triptychs. Without the addition of the shadow, i feel the image would have been lost in the white. The reasons i like this triptych is that the man is in ilhouette, with a ripple from the water at his feet that pulls your attention into the section frame. The distant silhouette of the boat then pulls your eyes into that final frame. I would have liked to have seen the sky/clouds a little darker on that third frame to match the intensity of the clouds withthe first.</td>', 'It is just amazing what a difference an effective boarder can make in these triptychs. Without the addition of the shadow, i feel the image would have been lost in the white. The reasons i like this triptych is that the man is in ilhouette, with a ripple from the water at his feet that pulls your attention into the section frame. The distant silhouette of the boat then pulls your eyes into that final frame. I would have liked to have seen the sky/clouds a little darker on that third frame to match the intensity of the clouds withthe first.', '2005-11-15 14:06:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1868811, 257373, 30049, '<td valign="top">Neat idea.  I like how you mirrored one image to use on both ends.  I think the composition is a bit tight...could have used a bit more negative space, especially at the top.  Also looks like the spacing is off just a tad...the right divider is wider than the left.<br/> <br/>Pretty cool to get your kid to do this and capture it with your camera.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Neat idea.  I like how you mirrored one image to use on both ends.  I think the composition is a bit tight...could have used a bit more negative space, especially at the top.  Also looks like the spacing is off just a tad...the right divider is wider than the left. Pretty cool to get your kid to do this and capture it with your camera.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2005-11-15 14:07:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1868814, 257285, 44860, '<td valign="top">Why there''s a glow around birds? If it is made on purpose, I think it''s not a good idea.</td>', 'Why there''s a glow around birds? If it is made on purpose, I think it''s not a good idea.', '2005-11-15 14:08:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1868818, 257077, 25742, '<td valign="top">the colours seem to be strange, but the comp and division is very good.</td>', 'the colours seem to be strange, but the comp and division is very good.', '2005-11-15 14:09:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1868821, 255987, 44860, '<td valign="top">...or through the Windows XP :) I have in mind similiarity with XP standart desktop picture.</td>', '...or through the Windows XP :) I have in mind similiarity with XP standart desktop picture.', '2005-11-15 14:11:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1868832, 257112, 22379, '<td valign="top">This picture in thumb gave me a little heart flutter because i thought the baby was looking blue! I clicked it right away, what a relief it was a doll. Excellent lining up of the faces to match. Must have taken quite some time.</td>', 'This picture in thumb gave me a little heart flutter because i thought the baby was looking blue! I clicked it right away, what a relief it was a doll. Excellent lining up of the faces to match. Must have taken quite some time.', '2005-11-15 14:14:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1868834, 256810, 25742, '<td valign="top">strange and very colourful. not sure how I feel about it. not appealing at first sight, but the details grow on you. better than average, so I think it deserves at least a 6</td>', 'strange and very colourful. not sure how I feel about it. not appealing at first sight, but the details grow on you. better than average, so I think it deserves at least a 6', '2005-11-15 14:14:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1868855, 256087, 25742, '<td valign="top">good "panes" of different size, the noise in the photo is a bit too much for my taste.</td>', 'good "panes" of different size, the noise in the photo is a bit too much for my taste.', '2005-11-15 14:19:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1868856, 257130, 44860, '<td valign="top">I really contemn those guys - nobody but them are making those "arts" on buildings around the cities around the world. They are "marking" places like<br/> dogs... And it stinks... But this is different story. Your tryptich is OK, and raising my emotions is a positive result from challenge point of view...8</td>', 'I really contemn those guys - nobody but them are making those "arts" on buildings around the cities around the world. They are "marking" places like dogs... And it stinks... But this is different story. Your tryptich is OK, and raising my emotions is a positive result from challenge point of view...8', '2005-11-15 14:19:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1868861, 257396, 25742, '<td valign="top">Good photo, but the division into three "panes" seems pointless.</td>', 'Good photo, but the division into three "panes" seems pointless.', '2005-11-15 14:19:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1868868, 256309, 10432, '<td valign="top">Wow - all three are amazing photos.<br/>Very nicely done.</td>', 'Wow - all three are amazing photos.Very nicely done.', '2005-11-15 14:21:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1868869, 257257, 25742, '<td valign="top">quite impressionistic</td>', 'quite impressionistic', '2005-11-15 14:21:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1868876, 257107, 44860, '<td valign="top">Could be ad...8</td>', 'Could be ad...8', '2005-11-15 14:24:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1868877, 257272, 25742, '<td valign="top">funny and interesting. good work. I esp like the colours in the middle pane</td>', 'funny and interesting. good work. I esp like the colours in the middle pane', '2005-11-15 14:24:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1868879, 256765, 45931, '<td valign="top">Almost looks like a painting.  Good Job!</td>', 'Almost looks like a painting.  Good Job!', '2005-11-15 14:24:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1868880, 257056, 25742, '<td valign="top">less is more, nice abstract feel to this. good work.</td>', 'less is more, nice abstract feel to this. good work.', '2005-11-15 14:25:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1868889, 257373, 45931, '<td valign="top">Neat</td>', 'Neat', '2005-11-15 14:26:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1868899, 257441, 25742, '<td valign="top">the left pane and bottom seem to be suffering from distortion, the left one squeesed and the bottom one stretched.</td>', 'the left pane and bottom seem to be suffering from distortion, the left one squeesed and the bottom one stretched.', '2005-11-15 14:29:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1868901, 256307, 44860, '<td valign="top">Questionable framing but OK, I can see 3 objects. Interesting...8</td>', 'Questionable framing but OK, I can see 3 objects. Interesting...8', '2005-11-15 14:29:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1868903, 256749, 45931, '<td valign="top">Red really makes it stand out.  Nice.</td>', 'Red really makes it stand out.  Nice.', '2005-11-15 14:30:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1868904, 256288, 24789, '<td valign="top">I LIke this concept, was thinking of something similar myself, just couldnt figure out how to pull it off,  courage, honor, work well, not sure how the third panel relates to integrity, but i still like this image. 6. Mike</td>', 'I LIke this concept, was thinking of something similar myself, just couldnt figure out how to pull it off,  courage, honor, work well, not sure how the third panel relates to integrity, but i still like this image. 6. Mike', '2005-11-15 14:30:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1868905, 255852, 25742, '<td valign="top">very well blended together. one of the best in this challenge.</td>', 'very well blended together. one of the best in this challenge.', '2005-11-15 14:30:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1868911, 257310, 45931, '<td valign="top">This should be in a Contemporary Art Museum.  Sehr Gut!</td>', 'This should be in a Contemporary Art Museum.  Sehr Gut!', '2005-11-15 14:32:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1868914, 257326, 25742, '<td valign="top">reminds me a lot of BradP''s Daybreak. good one.</td>', 'reminds me a lot of BradP''s Daybreak. good one.', '2005-11-15 14:33:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1868923, 256909, 44860, '<td valign="top">This is how I understand triptych - not just dividing a picture, but creating a set of relatively independent and self-containing pictures that together makes interesting entirety...10</td>', 'This is how I understand triptych - not just dividing a picture, but creating a set of relatively independent and self-containing pictures that together makes interesting entirety...10', '2005-11-15 14:35:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1868931, 256835, 44860, '<td valign="top">Actually I can count 4, not 3 pictures. Fourth makes a frame.</td>', 'Actually I can count 4, not 3 pictures. Fourth makes a frame.', '2005-11-15 14:37:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1868933, 257112, 45931, '<td valign="top">Cleverly Sneeky.  I love it!  Wunderbar! Magnifique! Bravo!</td>', 'Cleverly Sneeky.  I love it!  Wunderbar! Magnifique! Bravo!', '2005-11-15 14:39:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1868939, 256309, 70, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous shots. As far as the triptych goes, I''d like to see a bit more obvious division between the three photos. There''s just so much detail that it''s difficult to immediately discern the end of one scene and the start of the next. Perhaps a thin gray border around the shots themselves. With more space (I realize you are constricted by the dimensions here) you could add a bit more black as well. Stunning detail!</td>', 'Gorgeous shots. As far as the triptych goes, I''d like to see a bit more obvious division between the three photos. There''s just so much detail that it''s difficult to immediately discern the end of one scene and the start of the next. Perhaps a thin gray border around the shots themselves. With more space (I realize you are constricted by the dimensions here) you could add a bit more black as well. Stunning detail!', '2005-11-15 14:40:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1868941, 255782, 45931, '<td valign="top">Sneeky.</td>', 'Sneeky.', '2005-11-15 14:41:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1868950, 255352, 45931, '<td valign="top">Funky.</td>', 'Funky.', '2005-11-15 14:42:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1868954, 257174, 70, '<td valign="top">Love the idea. Unfortunately, the shot is hampered by the strong yellow overcast.</td>', 'Love the idea. Unfortunately, the shot is hampered by the strong yellow overcast.', '2005-11-15 14:43:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1868959, 256679, 45931, '<td valign="top">Multiple Personalities...thats what I see.   Very unique and creative! Tres Bien!</td>', 'Multiple Personalities...thats what I see.   Very unique and creative! Tres Bien!', '2005-11-15 14:45:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1868966, 257418, 70, '<td valign="top">A nice shot, although a bit neon. My main issue is with the divisions. This doesn''t really strike me as a triptych, but seems more like a photo with lines drawn through it and is especially difficult in the portion where there are whitecaps. Perhaps a thin black border would  have helped. In addition, the top and bottom sections do not line up properly on the sides.</td>', 'A nice shot, although a bit neon. My main issue is with the divisions. This doesn''t really strike me as a triptych, but seems more like a photo with lines drawn through it and is especially difficult in the portion where there are whitecaps. Perhaps a thin black border would  have helped. In addition, the top and bottom sections do not line up properly on the sides.', '2005-11-15 14:47:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1868969, 255916, 70, '<td valign="top">I can see where you were going with this but there is just something awkward feeling about having the dogs chopped in half. Nicely posed, though.</td>', 'I can see where you were going with this but there is just something awkward feeling about having the dogs chopped in half. Nicely posed, though.', '2005-11-15 14:47:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1868975, 257116, 25742, '<td valign="top">good. the comp (esp framing) is very well done. good luck</td>', 'good. the comp (esp framing) is very well done. good luck', '2005-11-15 14:50:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1868978, 256757, 25742, '<td valign="top">I like this one. it''s engaging and interesting. best of luck</td>', 'I like this one. it''s engaging and interesting. best of luck', '2005-11-15 14:51:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1868980, 257040, 25742, '<td valign="top">this one tells an interesting story, I could see this in national geographic. good luck</td>', 'this one tells an interesting story, I could see this in national geographic. good luck', '2005-11-15 14:52:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1868981, 257231, 46063, '<td valign="top">What a nice and peaceful composition</td>', 'What a nice and peaceful composition', '2005-11-15 14:52:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1868982, 256660, 25742, '<td valign="top">the difference between the lower two is too slight, which detracts from this otherwise very good series.</td>', 'the difference between the lower two is too slight, which detracts from this otherwise very good series.', '2005-11-15 14:52:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1868984, 256523, 70, '<td valign="top">Love the idea but feel the execution could be improved a bit. The right side feels quite a bit flatter than the left side and gives the whole thing a sort of uneven feeling. I do think the idea lends itself well to a triptych, though.</td>', 'Love the idea but feel the execution could be improved a bit. The right side feels quite a bit flatter than the left side and gives the whole thing a sort of uneven feeling. I do think the idea lends itself well to a triptych, though.', '2005-11-15 14:53:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1868990, 256034, 25742, '<td valign="top">interesting. the lack of focus at the outer ones, forces the attention to the middle. nice colours. I, however, would prefer sharper focus in all three.</td>', 'interesting. the lack of focus at the outer ones, forces the attention to the middle. nice colours. I, however, would prefer sharper focus in all three.', '2005-11-15 14:54:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1869005, 257283, 70, '<td valign="top">This shot doesn''t seem to lend itself well to the triptych layout. There''s no obvious reason for or improvement from the separation of shots and the hand being chopped in half feels somewhat awkward. Also, the images do not line up properly and the Hershey bar seems to be quite a bit oversharpened.</td>', 'This shot doesn''t seem to lend itself well to the triptych layout. There''s no obvious reason for or improvement from the separation of shots and the hand being chopped in half feels somewhat awkward. Also, the images do not line up properly and the Hershey bar seems to be quite a bit oversharpened.', '2005-11-15 14:57:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1869013, 257157, 70, '<td valign="top">A gorgeous scene and I like the way you''ve set up your triptych. My only complaint would be that the divisions are uneven which makes the presentation feel somewhat lopsided and the picture on the far right a little cramped.</td>', 'A gorgeous scene and I like the way you''ve set up your triptych. My only complaint would be that the divisions are uneven which makes the presentation feel somewhat lopsided and the picture on the far right a little cramped.', '2005-11-15 14:59:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1869015, 256170, 36619, '<td valign="top">what a neat idea, love the colors!</td>', 'what a neat idea, love the colors!', '2005-11-15 15:00:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1869020, 257201, 70, '<td valign="top">Your triptych is nicely arranged and set up but the photo quality is pretty poor. There seems to be quite a bit of blur and perhaps too much digital zoom and/or cropping? The birds are barely discernable.</td>', 'Your triptych is nicely arranged and set up but the photo quality is pretty poor. There seems to be quite a bit of blur and perhaps too much digital zoom and/or cropping? The birds are barely discernable.', '2005-11-15 15:02:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1869021, 257307, 35786, '<td valign="top">cool idea &amp; execution! 9 &amp; bumped to 10 :0)</td>', 'cool idea & execution! 9 & bumped to 10 :0)', '2005-11-15 15:02:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1869022, 257243, 36619, '<td valign="top">i really like this theme and the contrasts of the enviroments.</td>', 'i really like this theme and the contrasts of the enviroments.', '2005-11-15 15:02:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1869024, 256734, 36619, '<td valign="top">awwwwwwwwwwwww... how cute!</td>', 'awwwwwwwwwwwww... how cute!', '2005-11-15 15:04:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1869034, 256712, 36619, '<td valign="top">nice clean shot, i like how you framed the scene.<br/></td>', 'nice clean shot, i like how you framed the scene.', '2005-11-15 15:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1869035, 256713, 40819, '<td valign="top">This is a gret ideam however, maybe it is because I am looking at a 640 image but I would have cropped out bout a third from the top and also would have used cruves or levels to brighten it up a bit to show the lights better.BTW Like the drop shadows too.</td>', 'This is a gret ideam however, maybe it is because I am looking at a 640 image but I would have cropped out bout a third from the top and also would have used cruves or levels to brighten it up a bit to show the lights better.BTW Like the drop shadows too.', '2005-11-15 15:11:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1869038, 257430, 40819, '<td valign="top">Good one.</td>', 'Good one.', '2005-11-15 15:12:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1869043, 257423, 40819, '<td valign="top">WOW</td>', 'WOW', '2005-11-15 15:13:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1869050, 257274, 40819, '<td valign="top">That''s a sharp picture. But really it shows wonderful colors.</td>', 'That''s a sharp picture. But really it shows wonderful colors.', '2005-11-15 15:17:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1869063, 255750, 35280, '<td valign="top">Love it :)</td>', 'Love it :)', '2005-11-15 15:26:08.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(1869068, 256613, 45897, '<td valign="top">Very cool.  The bw is perfect for the theme (Zen)</td>', 'Very cool.  The bw is perfect for the theme (Zen)', '2005-11-15 15:28:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1869082, 257440, 44860, '<td valign="top">OK, real nurses does not wear these red things, but I would lie telling I don''t like this tryptich. Moreover, I find it compositionwise very sound - dividing picture into three self-containing parts and joining them in single frame is exactly how I understand tryptich. At least one of possible variations. Technically it is also very good - red color definition, shades of white. Content is a bit provoking, but it adds to picture too...10</td>', 'OK, real nurses does not wear these red things, but I would lie telling I don''t like this tryptich. Moreover, I find it compositionwise very sound - dividing picture into three self-containing parts and joining them in single frame is exactly how I understand tryptich. At least one of possible variations. Technically it is also very good - red color definition, shades of white. Content is a bit provoking, but it adds to picture too...10', '2005-11-15 15:34:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1869123, 257131, 45897, '<td valign="top">I like the photo, my suggestion is to do the split on the right the same as the one on the left.  I mean not split the image at teeth (possibly do the center one wider than the outside ones).</td>', 'I like the photo, my suggestion is to do the split on the right the same as the one on the left.  I mean not split the image at teeth (possibly do the center one wider than the outside ones).', '2005-11-15 15:53:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1869128, 256334, 811, '<td valign="top">OMG -- I am loving this!!!  Great expressions, and a selective desaturation that truly adds to the shot, I think.  I do hope that at least one of these (if not all) are your family Christmas pics this year (if it is your kid.  if not, better not use it -- hahaha).<br/> <br/>Great work.  10</td>', 'OMG -- I am loving this!!!  Great expressions, and a selective desaturation that truly adds to the shot, I think.  I do hope that at least one of these (if not all) are your family Christmas pics this year (if it is your kid.  if not, better not use it -- hahaha). Great work.  10', '2005-11-15 15:56:08.000000', NULL, 1),
