(1869708, 257440, 5728, '<td valign="top">This is good, the reds and the whites together wow! The quality of the photo is also awesome, but what gets me, and what doesn''t do this image justice is the thick black borders you chose. I would have reduced them a lot thinner, to at least a third of the size. For me they borders are taking too much away from the photo.</td>', 'This is good, the reds and the whites together wow! The quality of the photo is also awesome, but what gets me, and what doesn''t do this image justice is the thick black borders you chose. I would have reduced them a lot thinner, to at least a third of the size. For me they borders are taking too much away from the photo.', '2005-11-15 19:08:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1869709, 256821, 12962, '<td valign="top">Very good idea.  Original, different.  Hope the ''validation'' thing didn''t hurt you.</td>', 'Very good idea.  Original, different.  Hope the ''validation'' thing didn''t hurt you.', '2005-11-15 19:09:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1869710, 255954, 70, '<td valign="top">Very cool. I don''t think I will ever get tired of water drop shots. I think I would prefer the shot on the right to be in the middle. The red and yellow ones feel a bit heavier and I think it would balance the image out a little. Nice job!</td>', 'Very cool. I don''t think I will ever get tired of water drop shots. I think I would prefer the shot on the right to be in the middle. The red and yellow ones feel a bit heavier and I think it would balance the image out a little. Nice job!', '2005-11-15 19:09:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1869713, 256893, 12962, '<td valign="top">Cute factor is high!</td>', 'Cute factor is high!', '2005-11-15 19:09:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1869716, 255374, 5728, '<td valign="top">Good idea!!! I like it, the eyes are awesome. BUT! There are a couple of points which subtract from this image for me. The stripes on the sides and the bottom of the middle image shouldn''t be there in my opinion, they don''t do anything to enhance the photo. And the hair protruding down from the top image is cut off, I would have liked to see that hair come down more into the middle image. The top and bottom are good, it is only the processing of the middle section that spoils it for me.</td>', 'Good idea!!! I like it, the eyes are awesome. BUT! There are a couple of points which subtract from this image for me. The stripes on the sides and the bottom of the middle image shouldn''t be there in my opinion, they don''t do anything to enhance the photo. And the hair protruding down from the top image is cut off, I would have liked to see that hair come down more into the middle image. The top and bottom are good, it is only the processing of the middle section that spoils it for me.', '2005-11-15 19:12:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1869717, 257389, 70, '<td valign="top">An interesting take on a triptych, I think I like it. Definitely a gorgeous shot.</td>', 'An interesting take on a triptych, I think I like it. Definitely a gorgeous shot.', '2005-11-15 19:12:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1869719, 256613, 70, '<td valign="top">Love the simplicity. The progression serves the triptych format well.</td>', 'Love the simplicity. The progression serves the triptych format well.', '2005-11-15 19:15:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1869724, 256137, 70, '<td valign="top">Haha, very cute. Graphically, I think I''d prefer a bit more space between the photos, but I realize you''re confined to a relatively small space for challenges.</td>', 'Haha, very cute. Graphically, I think I''d prefer a bit more space between the photos, but I realize you''re confined to a relatively small space for challenges.', '2005-11-15 19:16:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1869726, 257209, 5728, '<td valign="top">Nice eye work. A bit too much magenta in the skin tones and the flash on the lips is too harsh, although the lighting on a whole is very good. Not bad, I like the idea, definitely one of the better shots here.</td>', 'Nice eye work. A bit too much magenta in the skin tones and the flash on the lips is too harsh, although the lighting on a whole is very good. Not bad, I like the idea, definitely one of the better shots here.', '2005-11-15 19:16:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1869727, 256120, 40797, '<td valign="top">Roll over, Roll Over-  Thanks for making smile. You did a nice job in metting the challenge.</td>', 'Roll over, Roll Over-  Thanks for making smile. You did a nice job in metting the challenge.', '2005-11-15 19:16:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1869732, 256669, 40797, '<td valign="top">Very nice!  Each photo is good and together they are even better.</td>', 'Very nice!  Each photo is good and together they are even better.', '2005-11-15 19:18:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1869734, 256836, 70, '<td valign="top">Nice progression. I love that photo in the middle with her huge tongue and her cub just looks so conquered. Very cute.</td>', 'Nice progression. I love that photo in the middle with her huge tongue and her cub just looks so conquered. Very cute.', '2005-11-15 19:18:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1869738, 256871, 70, '<td valign="top">I like the layout you''ve chosen but I think I''d prefer the top righthand photo to be more different from the larger photo than it is. Those two photos also seem to be a bit out of focus.</td>', 'I like the layout you''ve chosen but I think I''d prefer the top righthand photo to be more different from the larger photo than it is. Those two photos also seem to be a bit out of focus.', '2005-11-15 19:20:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1869742, 257122, 40797, '<td valign="top">Interesting!  Nice placement of panels. With the panels of the sky during the day on the sides and the panel with the sky at sunset/sunrise in the middle. Nice contrast.</td>', 'Interesting!  Nice placement of panels. With the panels of the sky during the day on the sides and the panel with the sky at sunset/sunrise in the middle. Nice contrast.', '2005-11-15 19:22:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1869744, 257327, 70, '<td valign="top">I really like the progression of these photos. So simple but there''s something really cool about it. The photos are a tad bit busy but not bad. Good job.</td>', 'I really like the progression of these photos. So simple but there''s something really cool about it. The photos are a tad bit busy but not bad. Good job.', '2005-11-15 19:24:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1869755, 257394, 5728, '<td valign="top">Nice, good idea. Similar to what I did once. I know it would have been very difficult but this would have been way cool if the smoke from each photo had protruded into the adjacent photos. It would be a hard task I know, but I would have tried it. As it is though, super!</td>', 'Nice, good idea. Similar to what I did once. I know it would have been very difficult but this would have been way cool if the smoke from each photo had protruded into the adjacent photos. It would be a hard task I know, but I would have tried it. As it is though, super!', '2005-11-15 19:27:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1869761, 257307, 5728, '<td valign="top">Good idea, very original!</td>', 'Good idea, very original!', '2005-11-15 19:29:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1869763, 257140, 5728, '<td valign="top">Impressive!</td>', 'Impressive!', '2005-11-15 19:29:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1869765, 256424, 5728, '<td valign="top">This is good!</td>', 'This is good!', '2005-11-15 19:30:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1869769, 256613, 5728, '<td valign="top">Alright now we are talking!</td>', 'Alright now we are talking!', '2005-11-15 19:31:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1869770, 256327, 41554, '<td valign="top">Great idea, a bit let down by: 1) out of focus feel on the "day" shot; 2) poor triptych execution (there is a kind of line visible between the 1st ans 2nd pic); and 3) a bit too much JPEG compression.<br/>But as I said, the idea is very nice, and I think it has a lot of potential. - 6</td>', 'Great idea, a bit let down by: 1) out of focus feel on the "day" shot; 2) poor triptych execution (there is a kind of line visible between the 1st ans 2nd pic); and 3) a bit too much JPEG compression.But as I said, the idea is very nice, and I think it has a lot of potential. - 6', '2005-11-15 19:31:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1869774, 256911, 5728, '<td valign="top">Fine work. Clear, crisp and clean!</td>', 'Fine work. Clear, crisp and clean!', '2005-11-15 19:32:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1869782, 257209, 41554, '<td valign="top">Great skin textures, focus, expressions - very good.</td>', 'Great skin textures, focus, expressions - very good.', '2005-11-15 19:34:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1869787, 256006, 70, '<td valign="top">I really like the first two images - great color and contrast. The third image feels a bit off. The bright white pulls my eyes off the other images and gives the whole kind of an unbalanced feeling. I''m not really sure I know what industry this is referring to, either.</td>', 'I really like the first two images - great color and contrast. The third image feels a bit off. The bright white pulls my eyes off the other images and gives the whole kind of an unbalanced feeling. I''m not really sure I know what industry this is referring to, either.', '2005-11-15 19:36:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1869799, 257206, 47487, '<td valign="top">Clever! I like it. Thinking out of the box. (ha ha.) The colors seem a wee, tiny bit flat to me, but still, a really good use of the format.</td>', 'Clever! I like it. Thinking out of the box. (ha ha.) The colors seem a wee, tiny bit flat to me, but still, a really good use of the format.', '2005-11-15 19:40:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1869805, 257371, 70, '<td valign="top">A good concept but some problems with the execution. The main problem is the large, emtpy white spaces which really ruin the feeling of the photo. I think the best thing would be to have the photos be the same size, maybe increase the height of the middle one to match the other two. Otherwise, a darker color like black would have helped. The photos themselves seem a tad bit soft in the details but together create a nice mood.</td>', 'A good concept but some problems with the execution. The main problem is the large, emtpy white spaces which really ruin the feeling of the photo. I think the best thing would be to have the photos be the same size, maybe increase the height of the middle one to match the other two. Otherwise, a darker color like black would have helped. The photos themselves seem a tad bit soft in the details but together create a nice mood.', '2005-11-15 19:41:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1869808, 255976, 70, '<td valign="top">Cute!</td>', 'Cute!', '2005-11-15 19:42:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1869814, 256087, 70, '<td valign="top">I think the glaring black and white borders detract from the shot quite a bit. A thinner and perhaps darker (gray rather than white) border would probably help to emphasize the shot.</td>', 'I think the glaring black and white borders detract from the shot quite a bit. A thinner and perhaps darker (gray rather than white) border would probably help to emphasize the shot.', '2005-11-15 19:44:56.000000', NULL, 1),
