(1869838, 256690, 70, '<td valign="top">A really cool progression with excellent, sharp photos but the layout really detracts. The empty white space makes this feel more like I''m looking at the photos in photoshop than viewing a final presentation. Flip that bottom one up to the side and you''ve got a great image.</td>', 'A really cool progression with excellent, sharp photos but the layout really detracts. The empty white space makes this feel more like I''m looking at the photos in photoshop than viewing a final presentation. Flip that bottom one up to the side and you''ve got a great image.', '2005-11-15 19:51:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1869842, 257443, 70, '<td valign="top">This is a really cool shot but the presentation just isn''t doing it for me. I''m not sure if it would be better if the panels were farther apart or if this just isn''t an image that works well with triptychs.</td>', 'This is a really cool shot but the presentation just isn''t doing it for me. I''m not sure if it would be better if the panels were farther apart or if this just isn''t an image that works well with triptychs.', '2005-11-15 19:53:23.000000', NULL, 1),
