(1870291, 257080, 40718, '<td valign="top">Is that halo around the boat?  Only a minor beef.  The picture is nice and the triptych works with each panel having a discreet subject (or lack of). 8</td>', 'Is that halo around the boat?  Only a minor beef.  The picture is nice and the triptych works with each panel having a discreet subject (or lack of). 8', '2005-11-15 21:50:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1870295, 257112, 39588, '<td valign="top">i love it! such a great idea and well done!!! 9!</td>', 'i love it! such a great idea and well done!!! 9!', '2005-11-15 21:51:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1870296, 256751, 27763, '<td valign="top">More like "Smoke Break"!  This is cool.  Definitely different.  This is a photo you can look at for much longer than many of the predictable, seen-it-a-million-times  photos that you see.   The score of this image will be much lower than it deserves, I''m afraid.   I hope I''m wrong...</td>', 'More like "Smoke Break"!  This is cool.  Definitely different.  This is a photo you can look at for much longer than many of the predictable, seen-it-a-million-times  photos that you see.   The score of this image will be much lower than it deserves, I''m afraid.   I hope I''m wrong...', '2005-11-15 21:51:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1870298, 256146, 40718, '<td valign="top">I like single vistas better when there is a subject for each panel.  It''s a nice picture though. I''m jealous of those who have the ability to do IR. 6</td>', 'I like single vistas better when there is a subject for each panel.  It''s a nice picture though. I''m jealous of those who have the ability to do IR. 6', '2005-11-15 21:51:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1870299, 255374, 70, '<td valign="top">An interesting concept. I think lightening up the top portion would help balance out the image a little. You seem to have just drawn the lines over the image rather than actually splitting it and you''ve missed the edges quite a bit. Also not sure what the white stripes down the sides are for?</td>', 'An interesting concept. I think lightening up the top portion would help balance out the image a little. You seem to have just drawn the lines over the image rather than actually splitting it and you''ve missed the edges quite a bit. Also not sure what the white stripes down the sides are for?', '2005-11-15 21:51:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1870301, 257337, 70, '<td valign="top">A lovely image and one of the few single images that actually works well split up. Nice job.</td>', 'A lovely image and one of the few single images that actually works well split up. Nice job.', '2005-11-15 21:52:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1870303, 255287, 40718, '<td valign="top">Neat and creative.  I like the patterns of the birds.  The high contrast works well. 8</td>', 'Neat and creative.  I like the patterns of the birds.  The high contrast works well. 8', '2005-11-15 21:52:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1870307, 257112, 36619, '<td valign="top">really cute, i like how you lined up the faces.</td>', 'really cute, i like how you lined up the faces.', '2005-11-15 21:53:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1870310, 256804, 40718, '<td valign="top">Cute.  These never actually win a ribbon, but they are good for a laugh. It looks a tiny bit overexposed.</td>', 'Cute.  These never actually win a ribbon, but they are good for a laugh. It looks a tiny bit overexposed.', '2005-11-15 21:54:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1870313, 256525, 39588, '<td valign="top">i love it! 10.</td>', 'i love it! 10.', '2005-11-15 21:55:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1870315, 257348, 70, '<td valign="top">I really like this. The repetition of the photo seems to work well and you''ve done a nice job presenting it.</td>', 'I really like this. The repetition of the photo seems to work well and you''ve done a nice job presenting it.', '2005-11-15 21:56:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1870316, 256006, 40718, '<td valign="top">I can''t tell what the right panel is.  A bullet hole?  The rope and bolt are nicely lit.  I''m also unsure of the "industry"...6</td>', 'I can''t tell what the right panel is.  A bullet hole?  The rope and bolt are nicely lit.  I''m also unsure of the "industry"...6', '2005-11-15 21:56:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1870320, 257186, 40718, '<td valign="top">well lit.  The plastic? stoli bottle isn''t quite as pretty. 7</td>', 'well lit.  The plastic? stoli bottle isn''t quite as pretty. 7', '2005-11-15 21:59:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1870324, 256902, 70, '<td valign="top">Neat idea!</td>', 'Neat idea!', '2005-11-15 21:59:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1870330, 257216, 70, '<td valign="top">Really nice shots (Alan?). I think I''d prefer the stadium seats in the middle because it feels a little heavier than the other two, but it''s hard to say without seeing it. Maybe the symmetry of the guy makes him a better middle.</td>', 'Really nice shots (Alan?). I think I''d prefer the stadium seats in the middle because it feels a little heavier than the other two, but it''s hard to say without seeing it. Maybe the symmetry of the guy makes him a better middle.', '2005-11-15 22:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1870334, 255098, 70, '<td valign="top">A really nice shot but doesn''t seem well suited for a triptych.</td>', 'A really nice shot but doesn''t seem well suited for a triptych.', '2005-11-15 22:04:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1870339, 256414, 70, '<td valign="top">Really a very stunning shot. I''d prefer the segments to be equal, though, rather than decreasing in size. I''d like to see it as a whole picture after the challenge ends.</td>', 'Really a very stunning shot. I''d prefer the segments to be equal, though, rather than decreasing in size. I''d like to see it as a whole picture after the challenge ends.', '2005-11-15 22:06:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1870350, 257307, 41802, '<td valign="top">Wow this is wickedly cool.  I love the coloring, the girls are awesome.</td>', 'Wow this is wickedly cool.  I love the coloring, the girls are awesome.', '2005-11-15 22:11:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1870398, 257243, 70, '<td valign="top">I like the colors and textures in this. Perhaps a thin border around each individual shot?</td>', 'I like the colors and textures in this. Perhaps a thin border around each individual shot?', '2005-11-15 22:25:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1870416, 256765, 70, '<td valign="top">Wow, I''m moving in! A gorgeous view. I''m curious about the difference in the trees on the left and right. Have they been desaturated or something. That part seems a bit odd. I''m not convinced I like the different sizes of the photos but it does create an interesting effect.</td>', 'Wow, I''m moving in! A gorgeous view. I''m curious about the difference in the trees on the left and right. Have they been desaturated or something. That part seems a bit odd. I''m not convinced I like the different sizes of the photos but it does create an interesting effect.', '2005-11-15 22:28:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1870421, 256826, 70, '<td valign="top">I think this photo works okay as divided but for me lacks a point of interest.</td>', 'I think this photo works okay as divided but for me lacks a point of interest.', '2005-11-15 22:29:27.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(1870422, 257125, 70, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous colors! Very vibrant. Nice layout as well.</td>', 'Gorgeous colors! Very vibrant. Nice layout as well.', '2005-11-15 22:29:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1870439, 256414, 8624, '<td valign="top">terrific perspective of strking architecture. I like your use of the decreasing frame sizes which empasizes the souring space overhead.</td>', 'terrific perspective of strking architecture. I like your use of the decreasing frame sizes which empasizes the souring space overhead.', '2005-11-15 22:32:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1870446, 257396, 70, '<td valign="top">This is a really nice shot but doesn''t lend itself well to the triptych layout. The chopping off of the wings and back part feel quite awkward. A nice job on the graphical layout though.</td>', 'This is a really nice shot but doesn''t lend itself well to the triptych layout. The chopping off of the wings and back part feel quite awkward. A nice job on the graphical layout though.', '2005-11-15 22:33:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1870460, 255758, 8624, '<td valign="top">great color and cropping. the details and textures really pop.</td>', 'great color and cropping. the details and textures really pop.', '2005-11-15 22:35:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1870471, 256509, 36619, '<td valign="top">i like the vintage look towards the top of each section. it''s a great view with a lot to look at..</td>', 'i like the vintage look towards the top of each section. it''s a great view with a lot to look at..', '2005-11-15 22:37:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1870472, 256660, 8624, '<td valign="top">great motion sequence. I love how you see the hawk tuck his talons in as he swoops down. my only criticism is that the bird seems crowded within the frames.</td>', 'great motion sequence. I love how you see the hawk tuck his talons in as he swoops down. my only criticism is that the bird seems crowded within the frames.', '2005-11-15 22:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1870476, 257112, 8624, '<td valign="top">clever arrangement of the frames. an interesting take on the challenge.</td>', 'clever arrangement of the frames. an interesting take on the challenge.', '2005-11-15 22:38:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1870484, 256286, 36619, '<td valign="top">interesting subject, i like how you pieced it together.</td>', 'interesting subject, i like how you pieced it together.', '2005-11-15 22:39:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1870488, 256669, 8624, '<td valign="top">clever title. fun images. highlights are a bit blown out on the sheep''s snout</td>', 'clever title. fun images. highlights are a bit blown out on the sheep''s snout', '2005-11-15 22:40:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1870494, 257107, 70, '<td valign="top">Neat. Would work well for an ad. I find the out of focus lipstick in the front to be a bit bothersome, though.</td>', 'Neat. Would work well for an ad. I find the out of focus lipstick in the front to be a bit bothersome, though.', '2005-11-15 22:41:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1870510, 257206, 70, '<td valign="top">This is really cool! Not something I''ve seen before and well executed. Definitely one of my favorites in the challenge.</td>', 'This is really cool! Not something I''ve seen before and well executed. Definitely one of my favorites in the challenge.', '2005-11-15 22:43:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1870519, 256898, 70, '<td valign="top">Too cute. The expression on the bottom is hilarious. Nice coloring.</td>', 'Too cute. The expression on the bottom is hilarious. Nice coloring.', '2005-11-15 22:45:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1870527, 254737, 7485, '<td valign="top">Excellent photo! The fog provides the perfect athmosphere. But the black lines just come across as a frame gone wrong. (Of course I can''t think of a good way to make this photo into a triptych either) 7</td>', 'Excellent photo! The fog provides the perfect athmosphere. But the black lines just come across as a frame gone wrong. (Of course I can''t think of a good way to make this photo into a triptych either) 7', '2005-11-15 22:46:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1870531, 257277, 45926, '<td valign="top">Pretty! The inside of the flower is a little dark, but nice use of borders, and color.</td>', 'Pretty! The inside of the flower is a little dark, but nice use of borders, and color.', '2005-11-15 22:47:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1870536, 256910, 70, '<td valign="top">This is really fun. I love the background color you''ve chosen, it really accents the photos.</td>', 'This is really fun. I love the background color you''ve chosen, it really accents the photos.', '2005-11-15 22:47:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1870541, 257140, 45926, '<td valign="top">Very intense. Great job, and good use of black and white.</td>', 'Very intense. Great job, and good use of black and white.', '2005-11-15 22:48:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1870548, 257321, 35078, '<td valign="top">I like it. A model with ATTITUDE!</td>', 'I like it. A model with ATTITUDE!', '2005-11-15 22:49:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1870551, 257445, 45926, '<td valign="top">I don''t love the positioning of the photographs. But I think that they in themselves, are wonderful. Great job!</td>', 'I don''t love the positioning of the photographs. But I think that they in themselves, are wonderful. Great job!', '2005-11-15 22:50:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1870552, 256307, 70, '<td valign="top">Poor Ursula. :(  An interesting idea for sure but not my one of my favorites of yours. It''s okay, you''ve kind of been monopolizing the top of the ranks these days.</td>', 'Poor Ursula. :(  An interesting idea for sure but not my one of my favorites of yours. It''s okay, you''ve kind of been monopolizing the top of the ranks these days.', '2005-11-15 22:50:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1870556, 257443, 24846, '<td valign="top">Great work. The white balance of the birds is great! Good luck...-10-</td>', 'Great work. The white balance of the birds is great! Good luck...-10-', '2005-11-15 22:51:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1870558, 257238, 15711, '<td valign="top">I like the idea of this very much. The left and right images seem to have the same exposure and light whereas the middle one seems a tad different.  Other than that - nicely done.</td>', 'I like the idea of this very much. The left and right images seem to have the same exposure and light whereas the middle one seems a tad different.  Other than that - nicely done.', '2005-11-15 22:51:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1870564, 255352, 70, '<td valign="top">Excellent concept. I like the shots and especially the coloring on the first one. I also like the differing colors but something feels not *quite* right about the other two. Maybe the purple is a little too intense? I''m not sure. Otherwise, nicely done.</td>', 'Excellent concept. I like the shots and especially the coloring on the first one. I also like the differing colors but something feels not *quite* right about the other two. Maybe the purple is a little too intense? I''m not sure. Otherwise, nicely done.', '2005-11-15 22:53:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1870566, 256836, 15711, '<td valign="top">Nice action sequence. Really clear too. For some reason, I''d like the width of the divider to be equal to the wider stripes of the mother.  Just my personal taste.</td>', 'Nice action sequence. Really clear too. For some reason, I''d like the width of the divider to be equal to the wider stripes of the mother.  Just my personal taste.', '2005-11-15 22:54:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1870571, 256301, 70, '<td valign="top">An interesting idea. A whiter background and a bit more contrast would have helped boost the image.</td>', 'An interesting idea. A whiter background and a bit more contrast would have helped boost the image.', '2005-11-15 22:56:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1870573, 256872, 7485, '<td valign="top">You really have a style of your own. So many photos on this site look interesting, but in a generic way. This one is so wonderfully unique, it''s looks like the work of an established artist who has honed his/her style for years. I''m looking forward to checking out your portfolio! 10</td>', 'You really have a style of your own. So many photos on this site look interesting, but in a generic way. This one is so wonderfully unique, it''s looks like the work of an established artist who has honed his/her style for years. I''m looking forward to checking out your portfolio! 10', '2005-11-15 22:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1870575, 257125, 24846, '<td valign="top">Very vibrant use of lighting. Your selection of angles brings in motion. A great shot. I wonder how it would look with the center full instead of a break in the petals in the lower portion? Good Luck -9-</td>', 'Very vibrant use of lighting. Your selection of angles brings in motion. A great shot. I wonder how it would look with the center full instead of a break in the petals in the lower portion? Good Luck -9-', '2005-11-15 22:57:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1870590, 255916, 7485, '<td valign="top">Cute, but doesn''t really lend itself to being a triptych.</td>', 'Cute, but doesn''t really lend itself to being a triptych.', '2005-11-15 23:00:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1870591, 256660, 24846, '<td valign="top">Great capture. Would love a fourth panel with its prey. Good Luck -9-</td>', 'Great capture. Would love a fourth panel with its prey. Good Luck -9-', '2005-11-15 23:00:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1870594, 256765, 36692, '<td valign="top">what a beautiful backyard!</td>', 'what a beautiful backyard!', '2005-11-15 23:01:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1870595, 256909, 70, '<td valign="top">I love this picture! I love it a little less as a triptych. It works okay, but not perfectly. Maybe better without the drop shadow, with just borders instead? With a black background! But still, love the photo. :)</td>', 'I love this picture! I love it a little less as a triptych. It works okay, but not perfectly. Maybe better without the drop shadow, with just borders instead? With a black background! But still, love the photo. :)', '2005-11-15 23:01:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1870597, 256893, 41802, '<td valign="top">Great job, I love the expressions you captured.</td>', 'Great job, I love the expressions you captured.', '2005-11-15 23:01:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1870599, 257111, 7485, '<td valign="top">The side panels are really excellent, but I''m not fond of the stark white sky in the middle one. 6</td>', 'The side panels are really excellent, but I''m not fond of the stark white sky in the middle one. 6', '2005-11-15 23:02:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1870602, 255750, 41802, '<td valign="top">Great idea, prefect expression of the holidays</td>', 'Great idea, prefect expression of the holidays', '2005-11-15 23:02:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1870603, 256014, 70, '<td valign="top">I LOVE this photo. The colors, the depth of focus, everything. I''m not sure about it as a triptych, though. It doesn''t ruin the photo but it doesn''t really do anything to improve it, either.  As a single shot, though, it''s perfect.</td>', 'I LOVE this photo. The colors, the depth of focus, everything. I''m not sure about it as a triptych, though. It doesn''t ruin the photo but it doesn''t really do anything to improve it, either.  As a single shot, though, it''s perfect.', '2005-11-15 23:03:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1870606, 257381, 41802, '<td valign="top">Wicked! I love the white and black contrast.</td>', 'Wicked! I love the white and black contrast.', '2005-11-15 23:03:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1870611, 257119, 15711, '<td valign="top">Nice how the left and right images mimic each other.  Nice clear image of the squirrel too!!! 8</td>', 'Nice how the left and right images mimic each other.  Nice clear image of the squirrel too!!! 8', '2005-11-15 23:04:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1870613, 257116, 15711, '<td valign="top">Great use of black, charcoal and white tones.  I like the division of this very much.  Not over the top - just simply done in a beautiful fashion. 8</td>', 'Great use of black, charcoal and white tones.  I like the division of this very much.  Not over the top - just simply done in a beautiful fashion. 8', '2005-11-15 23:05:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1870614, 257394, 70, '<td valign="top">Good set up for a triptych. The way the smoke is cut off feels a bit uncomfortable, though.</td>', 'Good set up for a triptych. The way the smoke is cut off feels a bit uncomfortable, though.', '2005-11-15 23:05:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1870621, 256898, 15711, '<td valign="top">Cute! I like the old time sense of it with the sepia/aged type filter. The shadow around each image adds to the depth nicely.  Very cute.</td>', 'Cute! I like the old time sense of it with the sepia/aged type filter. The shadow around each image adds to the depth nicely.  Very cute.', '2005-11-15 23:06:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1870625, 256821, 24846, '<td valign="top">I like the feel of seeing through the haze, can''t imagine why a validation was requested. Good luck on this well balanced piece. -9-</td>', 'I like the feel of seeing through the haze, can''t imagine why a validation was requested. Good luck on this well balanced piece. -9-', '2005-11-15 23:06:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1870627, 257140, 15711, '<td valign="top">Nicely done.  The detail is good. For some reason, I''d like to see another body part on the right, since the center shot isn''t part of the left one.  Just my personal taste.  Still, well done and a nice choice for the challenge. 7</td>', 'Nicely done.  The detail is good. For some reason, I''d like to see another body part on the right, since the center shot isn''t part of the left one.  Just my personal taste.  Still, well done and a nice choice for the challenge. 7', '2005-11-15 23:07:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1870628, 256910, 7485, '<td valign="top">The photo on the right works well with either of the other two, but those two are too similar, especially being next to each other. Also wish they were all a little bigger, at the expense of some of the frame at the bottom. But still well above average - 7</td>', 'The photo on the right works well with either of the other two, but those two are too similar, especially being next to each other. Also wish they were all a little bigger, at the expense of some of the frame at the bottom. But still well above average - 7', '2005-11-15 23:07:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1870631, 257137, 24846, '<td valign="top">A delight of innocence, like the leaf. Good luck on this -8-</td>', 'A delight of innocence, like the leaf. Good luck on this -8-', '2005-11-15 23:08:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1870632, 256910, 15711, '<td valign="top">I like that each image is different, yet they are all very similar with the different rock at the front of each one.  They work well together and tell a nice story.  I like your color choice for the border and that the bottom part is thicker.</td>', 'I like that each image is different, yet they are all very similar with the different rock at the front of each one.  They work well together and tell a nice story.  I like your color choice for the border and that the bottom part is thicker.', '2005-11-15 23:08:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1870634, 256801, 15711, '<td valign="top">Reminds me of that old Petula Clark song from the 60''s.  Good use of line and architecture. 7</td>', 'Reminds me of that old Petula Clark song from the 60''s.  Good use of line and architecture. 7', '2005-11-15 23:09:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1870635, 255750, 70, '<td valign="top">Hilarious! This would make such a good Christmas card. Excellent use of triptych.</td>', 'Hilarious! This would make such a good Christmas card. Excellent use of triptych.', '2005-11-15 23:09:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1870641, 257216, 41802, '<td valign="top">Heinz field a 10 all the way! Great job!</td>', 'Heinz field a 10 all the way! Great job!', '2005-11-15 23:10:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1870643, 257433, 15711, '<td valign="top">I LOVE THIS.  I''m a sucker for red leaves.  Great background detail as well as the veins on the leaf.  I like the difference in the width of the outside edge and the dividers of the shot.</td>', 'I LOVE THIS.  I''m a sucker for red leaves.  Great background detail as well as the veins on the leaf.  I like the difference in the width of the outside edge and the dividers of the shot.', '2005-11-15 23:11:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1870647, 257343, 70, '<td valign="top">The dogs in these shots are hysterical! I think I''d prefer a bit tighter crop for more dog and less drapey background.</td>', 'The dogs in these shots are hysterical! I think I''d prefer a bit tighter crop for more dog and less drapey background.', '2005-11-15 23:12:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1870649, 255392, 70, '<td valign="top">Nice catch on the natural triptych but overall not an especially appealing photo.</td>', 'Nice catch on the natural triptych but overall not an especially appealing photo.', '2005-11-15 23:13:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1870650, 257396, 7485, '<td valign="top">I hate to say it, but this looks like a fabulous photo that''s been ruined by arbitrary lines slashing through it. For a triptych to work, there has to be three of something. Three views, three parts to a composition, just something that calls for three panels.</td>', 'I hate to say it, but this looks like a fabulous photo that''s been ruined by arbitrary lines slashing through it. For a triptych to work, there has to be three of something. Three views, three parts to a composition, just something that calls for three panels.', '2005-11-15 23:13:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1870654, 257051, 70, '<td valign="top">Cute. The coloring and placement of the middle image don''t seem to quite match the other two.</td>', 'Cute. The coloring and placement of the middle image don''t seem to quite match the other two.', '2005-11-15 23:14:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1870658, 256105, 7485, '<td valign="top">Good idea, but I''d find this far more interesting if the side panels were actually different.</td>', 'Good idea, but I''d find this far more interesting if the side panels were actually different.', '2005-11-15 23:15:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1870668, 257125, 33400, '<td valign="top">Good lighting. Looks like ALMOST natural sunlight. Great focus.  Would like to see better centering for the middle pic.</td>', 'Good lighting. Looks like ALMOST natural sunlight. Great focus.  Would like to see better centering for the middle pic.', '2005-11-15 23:20:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1870674, 257299, 15711, '<td valign="top">Great night lights.  The vivid blue is just stunning.  WOW. Would make an excellent city souvenir.</td>', 'Great night lights.  The vivid blue is just stunning.  WOW. Would make an excellent city souvenir.', '2005-11-15 23:23:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1870681, 257257, 7485, '<td valign="top">Intriguing, and superb use of color. But I find myself wishing the model''s head was in there too. Maybe not aligned with the body, and maybe some other body part in the third panel? But quite good anyway - 7</td>', 'Intriguing, and superb use of color. But I find myself wishing the model''s head was in there too. Maybe not aligned with the body, and maybe some other body part in the third panel? But quite good anyway - 7', '2005-11-15 23:25:24.000000', NULL, 1),
