(1870760, 256984, 19831, '<td valign="top">A clever and creative concept. Fits the challenge nicely IMo. I''m thinking that perhaps the photo could be enhanced with some minor editing. The lighting overall is even,  no distracting shadows or hot spots, but it seems a wee bit ''drab''. Maybe a little bit of color adjustment and some levels tweaking, even a bit of contrast boost could give a little stronger tonality to the image. What I would do if working with wood grain like that, is to try and bring out stronger darks and mids, but maybe that''s just me :-)</td>', 'A clever and creative concept. Fits the challenge nicely IMo. I''m thinking that perhaps the photo could be enhanced with some minor editing. The lighting overall is even,  no distracting shadows or hot spots, but it seems a wee bit ''drab''. Maybe a little bit of color adjustment and some levels tweaking, even a bit of contrast boost could give a little stronger tonality to the image. What I would do if working with wood grain like that, is to try and bring out stronger darks and mids, but maybe that''s just me :-)', '2005-11-15 23:47:42.000000', NULL, 1),
