(1871749, 256893, 19831, '<td valign="top">Heeheehee, you are evil :-) Just when you have forgotten all about that song, there it is again! aaaarrrrggghhhh!  :-P   I don''t know if you conceived the idea and purposely went seeking llamas, or just came across them and it all came together, but either way, in the context of dpc here, sheer brilliance, and quite torturous! I love it. Technically well executed also. Great detail. Good pics, and they work together well, the image flows nicely. I would love to see this ribbon and be on the front page for a week...that would be...maddening! (in a fun way)  Well, the song will be in my head for the next couple of days now, thanks ;-P  Very well done. Nice pic :-)</td>', 'Heeheehee, you are evil :-) Just when you have forgotten all about that song, there it is again! aaaarrrrggghhhh!  :-P   I don''t know if you conceived the idea and purposely went seeking llamas, or just came across them and it all came together, but either way, in the context of dpc here, sheer brilliance, and quite torturous! I love it. Technically well executed also. Great detail. Good pics, and they work together well, the image flows nicely. I would love to see this ribbon and be on the front page for a week...that would be...maddening! (in a fun way)  Well, the song will be in my head for the next couple of days now, thanks ;-P  Very well done. Nice pic :-)', '2005-11-16 04:45:09.000000', NULL, 1),
