(1873296, 257418, 29474, '<td valign="top">The colours seem to be artificial ... too blue ... too green ... too yellow. I don''t think that the white was the best colour for the frames ... It gets lost in the sky.</td>', 'The colours seem to be artificial ... too blue ... too green ... too yellow. I don''t think that the white was the best colour for the frames ... It gets lost in the sky.', '2005-11-16 13:49:44.000000', NULL, 1),
