(1874188, 256809, 25742, '<td valign="top">a bit too static for my taste, the right frame seems to be lacking in something, more dynamic needed there. I''m probably not making myself clear here, so I''ll just stop and hope you understand what I''m trying to say. <br/>Good series though and technically very good.</td>', 'a bit too static for my taste, the right frame seems to be lacking in something, more dynamic needed there. I''m probably not making myself clear here, so I''ll just stop and hope you understand what I''m trying to say. Good series though and technically very good.', '2005-11-16 17:18:53.000000', NULL, 1),
