(1874420, 256014, 25742, '<td valign="top">interesting. I like the bokeh. the focus on the shell is a bit too shallow for my taste, but you manage to bring it off. the colours and their combination is good. best of luck.</td>', 'interesting. I like the bokeh. the focus on the shell is a bit too shallow for my taste, but you manage to bring it off. the colours and their combination is good. best of luck.', '2005-11-16 18:20:37.000000', NULL, 1),
