(1874467, 256191, 39221, '<td valign="top">nice idea but the descriptions of each reallllllllly don''t fit... 2nd eye looks more like a squint than joyfull :) original though, and isn''t just a picture chopped into 3 sections (which really isn''t a triptych) so grats on that :)</td>', 'nice idea but the descriptions of each reallllllllly don''t fit... 2nd eye looks more like a squint than joyfull :) original though, and isn''t just a picture chopped into 3 sections (which really isn''t a triptych) so grats on that :)', '2005-11-16 18:33:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1874475, 256911, 40718, '<td valign="top">I love the sharpness of this one.  Excellent B&amp;W transfer. 9</td>', 'I love the sharpness of this one.  Excellent B&W transfer. 9', '2005-11-16 18:35:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1874477, 255976, 40718, '<td valign="top">Elegant.  There seems to be a little too much red as a cast. 7</td>', 'Elegant.  There seems to be a little too much red as a cast. 7', '2005-11-16 18:36:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1874482, 255954, 40718, '<td valign="top">I like the colors.  It adds more compared to the other drop pictures.  You did well putting your center image in the center.  It is clearly the strongest. 7</td>', 'I like the colors.  It adds more compared to the other drop pictures.  You did well putting your center image in the center.  It is clearly the strongest. 7', '2005-11-16 18:36:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1874483, 257273, 40718, '<td valign="top">Good picture, the triptych doesn''t add a lot.</td>', 'Good picture, the triptych doesn''t add a lot.', '2005-11-16 18:37:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1874486, 256910, 39221, '<td valign="top">great effort - although the lack of sky in the 2nd image i think really breaks up the overall effect</td>', 'great effort - although the lack of sky in the 2nd image i think really breaks up the overall effect', '2005-11-16 18:37:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1874488, 256014, 40718, '<td valign="top">I like the picture, but the triptych isn''t adding much.  I like the picture a lot though. 6</td>', 'I like the picture, but the triptych isn''t adding much.  I like the picture a lot though. 6', '2005-11-16 18:38:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1874503, 255954, 39221, '<td valign="top">great idea, although the shots seem unbalanced (with respect to eachother)</td>', 'great idea, although the shots seem unbalanced (with respect to eachother)', '2005-11-16 18:41:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1874520, 256814, 40718, '<td valign="top">A nice picture.  The triptych quality isn''t adding too much, but it isn''t completely wasted either.  The verticals echo the bridge nicely and there is a "subject" in the two frames and lack in the third.  This seems to be a popular style. 7</td>', 'A nice picture.  The triptych quality isn''t adding too much, but it isn''t completely wasted either.  The verticals echo the bridge nicely and there is a "subject" in the two frames and lack in the third.  This seems to be a popular style. 7', '2005-11-16 18:46:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1874525, 256826, 40718, '<td valign="top">The triptych isn''t adding a lot here.</td>', 'The triptych isn''t adding a lot here.', '2005-11-16 18:47:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1874528, 256901, 40718, '<td valign="top">nice idea.  Surpised I haven''t seen more.  They might be out there, haven''t been through yet.  B&amp;W quality is nice. 7</td>', 'nice idea.  Surpised I haven''t seen more.  They might be out there, haven''t been through yet.  B&W quality is nice. 7', '2005-11-16 18:47:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1874553, 256523, 43380, '<td valign="top">I really like this shot and it''s artistic quality.  However, looking at it is making me strain to see more details in the pieces.  With so little light, it''s difficult to see much... a down side but also one of things that I like about this set up.  The colors are also great; the division of the wedding parties split up by tint is a fantastic element.  In any case, I hope that you offer a print of it so that I can hang it in my livingroom!  I give it a 9!<br/>**edit....I was on a bad monitor... my home computer sees the details in front very well...I''m bumping up the score too.  :)**</td>', 'I really like this shot and it''s artistic quality.  However, looking at it is making me strain to see more details in the pieces.  With so little light, it''s difficult to see much... a down side but also one of things that I like about this set up.  The colors are also great; the division of the wedding parties split up by tint is a fantastic element.  In any case, I hope that you offer a print of it so that I can hang it in my livingroom!  I give it a 9!**edit....I was on a bad monitor... my home computer sees the details in front very well...I''m bumping up the score too.  :)**', '2005-11-16 18:55:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1874563, 256191, 43380, '<td valign="top">This photograph arrangement is touching for some reason.  I think the colors are great and it warms my heart.  My only critique is that maybe the frame is too large on the top and bottom.</td>', 'This photograph arrangement is touching for some reason.  I think the colors are great and it warms my heart.  My only critique is that maybe the frame is too large on the top and bottom.', '2005-11-16 18:57:47.000000', NULL, 1),
