(1875708, 255979, 28276, '<td valign="top">first time i tried to get a photo of a droplet, it took me 200 tries to get a really good one.  i can only imagine how long it took to get 3 really good shots to make this spectacular sequence.  hope this is getting the votes it deserves.</td>', 'first time i tried to get a photo of a droplet, it took me 200 tries to get a really good one.  i can only imagine how long it took to get 3 really good shots to make this spectacular sequence.  hope this is getting the votes it deserves.', '2005-11-16 23:53:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1875722, 255287, 22379, '<td valign="top">i honestly cannot tell if this is 1 or 3 photos, but if it is one i am very very impressed with the story one image can tell. If it is 3 good work lining up the trees. <br/>I feel this image may benifit from a thin black boarder around each frame to seperate the neutral grey from the white and pull the image forad. Again, very impressed whichever way it goes.</td>', 'i honestly cannot tell if this is 1 or 3 photos, but if it is one i am very very impressed with the story one image can tell. If it is 3 good work lining up the trees. I feel this image may benifit from a thin black boarder around each frame to seperate the neutral grey from the white and pull the image forad. Again, very impressed whichever way it goes.', '2005-11-16 23:56:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1875733, 256221, 28276, '<td valign="top">i''m not a big fan of the borders chosen for the inset photos, but i think the entry as a whole is quite amazing.  congratulations on an obvious ribbon winner...</td>', 'i''m not a big fan of the borders chosen for the inset photos, but i think the entry as a whole is quite amazing.  congratulations on an obvious ribbon winner...', '2005-11-17 00:00:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1875736, 256872, 22379, '<td valign="top">i really like the first two. The PP really suits the images. The third is a blown out to the point that i cannot really tell what to think (with the size limitations this has made it more difficult).</td>', 'i really like the first two. The PP really suits the images. The third is a blown out to the point that i cannot really tell what to think (with the size limitations this has made it more difficult).', '2005-11-17 00:01:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1875746, 256523, 22379, '<td valign="top">Looks likt they are telling secrets. ANd the others are trying to listen in. I wish it was a little less dark so we could see the details on the Knights (is that what they are called?) faces.</td>', 'Looks likt they are telling secrets. ANd the others are trying to listen in. I wish it was a little less dark so we could see the details on the Knights (is that what they are called?) faces.', '2005-11-17 00:04:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1875749, 256317, 19831, '<td valign="top">Beautiful axe. Clever title :-) I really like your lighting in the shots, very nice. Good detail. The shots work nicely together. Well done.</td>', 'Beautiful axe. Clever title :-) I really like your lighting in the shots, very nice. Good detail. The shots work nicely together. Well done.', '2005-11-17 00:05:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1875776, 256835, 35321, '<td valign="top">Nice concept and execution.  I''ll assume you used at most three shots and not four. ;-)  The background on the rightmost leaf seems a little less dark than the other two.</td>', 'Nice concept and execution.  I''ll assume you used at most three shots and not four. ;-)  The background on the rightmost leaf seems a little less dark than the other two.', '2005-11-17 00:14:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1875781, 256221, 19831, '<td valign="top">Now this is just brilliant! I really like the composition of the ''main'' photo. And then very creative to compose your trip of ''inset'' like closeups. I like how they are overlapping too. Beautiful lighting, and the luminosity of the grassy stones is great. Just lovely, I really like this one. Well done!</td>', 'Now this is just brilliant! I really like the composition of the ''main'' photo. And then very creative to compose your trip of ''inset'' like closeups. I like how they are overlapping too. Beautiful lighting, and the luminosity of the grassy stones is great. Just lovely, I really like this one. Well done!', '2005-11-17 00:15:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1875790, 257272, 19831, '<td valign="top">hehe, the photo is fine, but your pie looks a little well done to me :-)</td>', 'hehe, the photo is fine, but your pie looks a little well done to me :-)', '2005-11-17 00:19:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1875791, 257396, 35321, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, and I like the choice of matching border color.  It looks like you sharpened after adding the border?  The border lines might look cleaner if you add them after other post-processing steps.</td>', 'Nice shot, and I like the choice of matching border color.  It looks like you sharpened after adding the border?  The border lines might look cleaner if you add them after other post-processing steps.', '2005-11-17 00:20:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1875792, 256307, 15511, '<td valign="top">Well done - for originality. Among many great images in this challenge, yours is one of my favorites. It''s a shame that the lines are jagged.</td>', 'Well done - for originality. Among many great images in this challenge, yours is one of my favorites. It''s a shame that the lines are jagged.', '2005-11-17 00:21:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1875795, 256137, 19831, '<td valign="top">Very cute :-) Creative and executed nicely. I can definitely relate :-) <br/>the kids look like they were having a lot of fun with the shoot! Well done :-)</td>', 'Very cute :-) Creative and executed nicely. I can definitely relate :-) the kids look like they were having a lot of fun with the shoot! Well done :-)', '2005-11-17 00:22:39.000000', NULL, 1),
