(1877115, 257300, 26255, '<td valign="top">Great shot!!!  I love the colors.  The first and third image seem a touch soft.  I''m not a big fan of the white borders, but other than that, great shot.</td>', 'Great shot!!!  I love the colors.  The first and third image seem a touch soft.  I''m not a big fan of the white borders, but other than that, great shot.', '2005-11-17 13:38:45.000000', NULL, 1),
