(1877128, 256288, 26255, '<td valign="top">Wow!  Very powerful image.  I love the selective desat in the second image.  The glove in the third image has some blown highlights which takes away from the overall image, but still I give it a 9.</td>', 'Wow!  Very powerful image.  I love the selective desat in the second image.  The glove in the third image has some blown highlights which takes away from the overall image, but still I give it a 9.', '2005-11-17 13:42:04.000000', NULL, 1),
