(1877138, 257156, 26255, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot, but I don''t agree with your choice of "breaks" in the image.  The separations in the image seem unnatural and forced.  I love the colors and think this image would do very well as a single image in another challenge.</td>', 'Beautiful shot, but I don''t agree with your choice of "breaks" in the image.  The separations in the image seem unnatural and forced.  I love the colors and think this image would do very well as a single image in another challenge.', '2005-11-17 13:45:14.000000', NULL, 1),
