(1877158, 257327, 37103, '<td valign="top">This is a series with a lot of personality.  I love the the tree and the lamp post naturally divide each image into three parts.  It''s a little bit hard to focus on the men because there is so much else going on in the photo.  But when you do their actions are really humorous.</td>', 'This is a series with a lot of personality.  I love the the tree and the lamp post naturally divide each image into three parts.  It''s a little bit hard to focus on the men because there is so much else going on in the photo.  But when you do their actions are really humorous.', '2005-11-17 13:49:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1877164, 256014, 26255, '<td valign="top">I love the very shallow DOF and the image by itself.  I''m not a big fan of the "separation choice".  The image by itself would definitely be one of my favs, but as a triptych I don''t think it works quite as well.  I also think the extra wide white border is a bit overkill.</td>', 'I love the very shallow DOF and the image by itself.  I''m not a big fan of the "separation choice".  The image by itself would definitely be one of my favs, but as a triptych I don''t think it works quite as well.  I also think the extra wide white border is a bit overkill.', '2005-11-17 13:50:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1877202, 255852, 37103, '<td valign="top">This is great and so creative!  I love the body parts cross over from one image to the next.</td>', 'This is great and so creative!  I love the body parts cross over from one image to the next.', '2005-11-17 14:05:32.000000', NULL, 1),
