(1878843, 256801, 31403, '<td valign="top">love the tones of the images, the lines are what makes my eyes go "woobly".<br/> <br/>The temple is great with nice vertical lines, center photos lines leaning right of vertical, then COB is pointing at one oclock - so the impressing as I "read this" is the whole thing is kind of tipping over.  I think the lines need to match, or offset each other with the vertical in the middle, for this kind of treatment (triptych).<br/> <br/>But did I mention I think the black and white conversions are just spot on - excellent.  Did you happen to shoot this at lunch? 7</td>', 'love the tones of the images, the lines are what makes my eyes go "woobly". The temple is great with nice vertical lines, center photos lines leaning right of vertical, then COB is pointing at one oclock - so the impressing as I "read this" is the whole thing is kind of tipping over.  I think the lines need to match, or offset each other with the vertical in the middle, for this kind of treatment (triptych). But did I mention I think the black and white conversions are just spot on - excellent.  Did you happen to shoot this at lunch? 7', '2005-11-17 23:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
