(1878866, 255987, 36444, '<td valign="top">I feel like I could run up that hill forever. The color really draws me in.</td>', 'I feel like I could run up that hill forever. The color really draws me in.', '2005-11-17 23:26:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1878869, 257272, 17507, '<td valign="top">Ah, I like that you have a ''story'' here. There is a much stronger concept in this piece than in a great many in this challenge. I think you could have done a bit more with your measuring spoons - look at the angles from which the three shots were taken. the measuring spoons are all straight overhead, but the pie is at a 45 degree angle. I think it would have been compositionally stronger to have the leftmost shot of the spoons also taken at 45 degrees, which would give you a nice symmetry of perspective: 45 - 90 - 45. It would also have been nice to see some more consistency in the lighting. The pie shot has a lovely soft shadow - I''d like to see that soft lighting on the spoons as well. (7)</td>', 'Ah, I like that you have a ''story'' here. There is a much stronger concept in this piece than in a great many in this challenge. I think you could have done a bit more with your measuring spoons - look at the angles from which the three shots were taken. the measuring spoons are all straight overhead, but the pie is at a 45 degree angle. I think it would have been compositionally stronger to have the leftmost shot of the spoons also taken at 45 degrees, which would give you a nice symmetry of perspective: 45 - 90 - 45. It would also have been nice to see some more consistency in the lighting. The pie shot has a lovely soft shadow - I''d like to see that soft lighting on the spoons as well. (7)', '2005-11-17 23:26:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1878872, 257337, 17507, '<td valign="top">A nice picture, and I think the triptych format does work well for it here. the composition is complex enough that the invitation to look at each part seperately is rewarding. as for the presentation, I find the drop shadow distracting. I think you''d have been better off with a more traditional outlining stroke.</td>', 'A nice picture, and I think the triptych format does work well for it here. the composition is complex enough that the invitation to look at each part seperately is rewarding. as for the presentation, I find the drop shadow distracting. I think you''d have been better off with a more traditional outlining stroke.', '2005-11-17 23:28:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1878878, 257343, 17507, '<td valign="top">What a great silly series. Somehow I don''t mind the loud border. Those lights are quite the studio prop. compositionally speaking, I think this would be stronger with a more darkly colored dog on the right, something to balance out the darkness of the one on the left.</td>', 'What a great silly series. Somehow I don''t mind the loud border. Those lights are quite the studio prop. compositionally speaking, I think this would be stronger with a more darkly colored dog on the right, something to balance out the darkness of the one on the left.', '2005-11-17 23:30:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1878880, 256697, 39429, '<td valign="top">I like the movement and posturing of this grand goose. Your goose in the right corner of each frame distracts me a bit - I find I want it complete.  You''ve caught the light just right on the goose on the left two frames.</td>', 'I like the movement and posturing of this grand goose. Your goose in the right corner of each frame distracts me a bit - I find I want it complete.  You''ve caught the light just right on the goose on the left two frames.', '2005-11-17 23:30:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1878884, 256915, 38032, '<td valign="top">wow. all are awesome.</td>', 'wow. all are awesome.', '2005-11-17 23:31:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1878886, 257140, 38032, '<td valign="top">perfect. 10</td>', 'perfect. 10', '2005-11-17 23:31:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1878889, 256496, 17507, '<td valign="top">A good set of graceful images presented in pleasing earth tones. My only gripe is the brightness of the stroke border - I think the golden hue is nice, but it would be better toned down to a lesser contrast with the background brown.</td>', 'A good set of graceful images presented in pleasing earth tones. My only gripe is the brightness of the stroke border - I think the golden hue is nice, but it would be better toned down to a lesser contrast with the background brown.', '2005-11-17 23:32:16.000000', NULL, 1),
