(1878906, 257352, 17507, '<td valign="top">Great colors and detail on the wings, especially in the middle shot. I see a fair amount of haloing around the birds - this can be alleviated by applying the unsharp mask on a duplicate layer and changing the blending to Darken.</td>', 'Great colors and detail on the wings, especially in the middle shot. I see a fair amount of haloing around the birds - this can be alleviated by applying the unsharp mask on a duplicate layer and changing the blending to Darken.', '2005-11-17 23:36:25.000000', NULL, 1),
