(1878943, 255287, 46737, '<td valign="top">love the way you have broken up the image. Going with a non linear set up makes your picture different from everyone elses<br/></td>', 'love the way you have broken up the image. Going with a non linear set up makes your picture different from everyone elses', '2005-11-17 23:44:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1878945, 257111, 39429, '<td valign="top">Each of these images are wonderful apart.  They don''t blend together as well as each works apart, IMO.</td>', 'Each of these images are wonderful apart.  They don''t blend together as well as each works apart, IMO.', '2005-11-17 23:44:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1878953, 256288, 17507, '<td valign="top">[i] Compositionally very strong. [ii] The highlights on the glove in the third panel are all dead and gone. They could possibly be saved with masking adjustment layers or burning them in. Try selecting highlights with CTRL-ALT-~ (tilde), copying to a new layer with CTRL-J, and setting the blending to multiply. That is often helpful to me. [iii] The differing color treatment of the middle panel is throwing me off. I would guess that you wanted to ensure primary focus on the middle panel - perfectly understandable - but my eye is strongly drawn to the red in the flowers to the point of real distraction from the rest of the image.</td>', '[i] Compositionally very strong. [ii] The highlights on the glove in the third panel are all dead and gone. They could possibly be saved with masking adjustment layers or burning them in. Try selecting highlights with CTRL-ALT-~ (tilde), copying to a new layer with CTRL-J, and setting the blending to multiply. That is often helpful to me. [iii] The differing color treatment of the middle panel is throwing me off. I would guess that you wanted to ensure primary focus on the middle panel - perfectly understandable - but my eye is strongly drawn to the red in the flowers to the point of real distraction from the rest of the image.', '2005-11-17 23:45:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1878963, 257423, 39429, '<td valign="top">Wonderful captures, well put together.  The peach in the border does not add, however.</td>', 'Wonderful captures, well put together.  The peach in the border does not add, however.', '2005-11-17 23:47:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1878964, 257327, 17507, '<td valign="top">good use of fisheye.</td>', 'good use of fisheye.', '2005-11-17 23:47:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1878968, 256893, 17507, '<td valign="top">what a jolly llama. I wonder if he''s someone''s reincarnation.</td>', 'what a jolly llama. I wonder if he''s someone''s reincarnation.', '2005-11-17 23:47:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1878977, 256801, 17507, '<td valign="top">Very stark and imposing. I find myself thinking this would look better with the left and middle panels switched for compositional rather than tonal symmetry.</td>', 'Very stark and imposing. I find myself thinking this would look better with the left and middle panels switched for compositional rather than tonal symmetry.', '2005-11-17 23:49:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1878980, 256014, 17507, '<td valign="top">looks kinda like a Dax, which is a good thing!</td>', 'looks kinda like a Dax, which is a good thing!', '2005-11-17 23:49:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1878983, 256915, 17507, '<td valign="top">I can imagine a sign over the entrance gate saying, "Welcome to the WWW!"</td>', 'I can imagine a sign over the entrance gate saying, "Welcome to the WWW!"', '2005-11-17 23:50:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1879041, 256810, 21362, '<td valign="top">I don''t care for the color treatment, but otherwise this is nice.</td>', 'I don''t care for the color treatment, but otherwise this is nice.', '2005-11-18 00:10:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1879050, 256909, 36832, '<td valign="top">I''m not a member so I can''t vote, but I would give this a 10.  I love it!  The sky, the silhouette, the reflection--everything about it is captivating.  Best of luck.  Can''t wait to see this ribbon!</td>', 'I''m not a member so I can''t vote, but I would give this a 10.  I love it!  The sky, the silhouette, the reflection--everything about it is captivating.  Best of luck.  Can''t wait to see this ribbon!', '2005-11-18 00:14:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1879056, 257307, 36832, '<td valign="top">This is a great concept and photo.  I am sure this will be a lot of people''s favorites.  Non-member so I can''t vote on it but thought this is worthy of a comment.  Best of luck!</td>', 'This is a great concept and photo.  I am sure this will be a lot of people''s favorites.  Non-member so I can''t vote on it but thought this is worthy of a comment.  Best of luck!', '2005-11-18 00:19:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1879065, 256915, 36832, '<td valign="top">Wow!  Each photo is very beautiful.  It makes me want to be there.  Simply lovely captures.  Good luck.</td>', 'Wow!  Each photo is very beautiful.  It makes me want to be there.  Simply lovely captures.  Good luck.', '2005-11-18 00:21:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1879070, 257327, 36832, '<td valign="top">There are quite a few good pictures out there, but this one is definitely a contender.  It''s crisp, clean, colorful, and very well composed.  Good luck.<br/></td>', 'There are quite a few good pictures out there, but this one is definitely a contender.  It''s crisp, clean, colorful, and very well composed.  Good luck.', '2005-11-18 00:24:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1879076, 256821, 36832, '<td valign="top">The way you framed this truly adds beauty and character to the picture.  Well done and good luck!</td>', 'The way you framed this truly adds beauty and character to the picture.  Well done and good luck!', '2005-11-18 00:27:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1879084, 256221, 36832, '<td valign="top">I would definitely vote this in the top 5.  Aside from the absolute beauty, I love how you''ve composed it--putting the two smaller photos on top and tying the whole thing by taking photos of the foreground and background interests.  Very well thought out.  Good luck.</td>', 'I would definitely vote this in the top 5.  Aside from the absolute beauty, I love how you''ve composed it--putting the two smaller photos on top and tying the whole thing by taking photos of the foreground and background interests.  Very well thought out.  Good luck.', '2005-11-18 00:32:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1879133, 257174, 19831, '<td valign="top">Very cool concept. I like that. It seems like your white balance is kind of off though. The whites look very yellow to me. Maybe some levels or color adj. could help?</td>', 'Very cool concept. I like that. It seems like your white balance is kind of off though. The whites look very yellow to me. Maybe some levels or color adj. could help?', '2005-11-18 00:57:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1879155, 255852, 19831, '<td valign="top">Not only is this just a really cool idea, but put together very well and technically excellant IMO. Exposure and focus are great. And you totally nailed the action, speed wise. Really cool, great job!</td>', 'Not only is this just a really cool idea, but put together very well and technically excellant IMO. Exposure and focus are great. And you totally nailed the action, speed wise. Really cool, great job!', '2005-11-18 01:04:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1879164, 257077, 19831, '<td valign="top">Nice photo. Great lighting, very nice texture and detail. I really like how the colors work together. Nice job.</td>', 'Nice photo. Great lighting, very nice texture and detail. I really like how the colors work together. Nice job.', '2005-11-18 01:07:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1879200, 257206, 43156, '<td valign="top">Excellent idea, very well executed, 10</td>', 'Excellent idea, very well executed, 10', '2005-11-18 01:41:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1879204, 255352, 43156, '<td valign="top">My favorite in this challenge, 10</td>', 'My favorite in this challenge, 10', '2005-11-18 01:42:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1879207, 257307, 43156, '<td valign="top">Excellent idea, very well executed, 9</td>', 'Excellent idea, very well executed, 9', '2005-11-18 01:43:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1879317, 256867, 30861, '<td valign="top">Highly intriguing image but it really doesn''t seem at all triptychy to me... It seems to be a single image and the split lines fail to divide it in 3, so... I donno... lemme think on it some more. In the end, I am bumping you up 2 points. I choose to view this as a wildly creative triptych, and I find it even more appealing artistically as I look at it more.<br/> <br/>I don''t usually give particularly high scores to images that border on crossing over from photography into graphic arts, which this one is tending to do, but given the nature of the challenge it seems right here.</td>', 'Highly intriguing image but it really doesn''t seem at all triptychy to me... It seems to be a single image and the split lines fail to divide it in 3, so... I donno... lemme think on it some more. In the end, I am bumping you up 2 points. I choose to view this as a wildly creative triptych, and I find it even more appealing artistically as I look at it more. I don''t usually give particularly high scores to images that border on crossing over from photography into graphic arts, which this one is tending to do, but given the nature of the challenge it seems right here.', '2005-11-18 03:40:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1879318, 257348, 30861, '<td valign="top">It takes a certain amount of bravery to repeat the same image, without variation, in all three panels of a triptych, in here at least :-) Based on comments my entry is receiving I suspect you''re seeing some downgrading for this. Nevertheless, if any image can support that treatment, this one can. It is surprisingly complex, and somehow the double repetition forces a closer study of the singular, repeated image, paying dividends in greater appreciation of the thing itself. So I like this very much.</td>', 'It takes a certain amount of bravery to repeat the same image, without variation, in all three panels of a triptych, in here at least :-) Based on comments my entry is receiving I suspect you''re seeing some downgrading for this. Nevertheless, if any image can support that treatment, this one can. It is surprisingly complex, and somehow the double repetition forces a closer study of the singular, repeated image, paying dividends in greater appreciation of the thing itself. So I like this very much.', '2005-11-18 03:43:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1879321, 257172, 30861, '<td valign="top">This is beautifully rendered. I''m vaguely uneasy about the overall greenish-cyan cast, but I''m sure it was a conscious decision on your part. There''s nevertheless a sense that the dominant cyans don''t quite match int he 3 panels, and this is bothering me a little. Good luck with this entry; I believe you''ll do very well.</td>', 'This is beautifully rendered. I''m vaguely uneasy about the overall greenish-cyan cast, but I''m sure it was a conscious decision on your part. There''s nevertheless a sense that the dominant cyans don''t quite match int he 3 panels, and this is bothering me a little. Good luck with this entry; I believe you''ll do very well.', '2005-11-18 03:46:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1879323, 256909, 30861, '<td valign="top">A finely-balanced image with a great deal of emotive content, one of my high scorers. I''m not quite comfortable with the balance of the white space here, but I am trying to view them as I suspect you intended me too, as 4 panels floating borderless and unframed on a white wall.<br/> <br/>Bumping on review. Good luck!</td>', 'A finely-balanced image with a great deal of emotive content, one of my high scorers. I''m not quite comfortable with the balance of the white space here, but I am trying to view them as I suspect you intended me too, as 4 panels floating borderless and unframed on a white wall. Bumping on review. Good luck!', '2005-11-18 03:47:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1879326, 256814, 30861, '<td valign="top">Lovely iamge, but it doesn''t ft comfortably into the format for me. The divisions seem quite arbitrary to me.<br/> <br/>Reviewing this, I find myself wondering how it would work if the panels were of ascending size from left to right, so both towers were in the right-most panel, and the leftmost panel were narrower than the central panel. I donno. Regardless, it''s a lovely rendering, very serene, and I am bumping it up a notch. Good luck!</td>', 'Lovely iamge, but it doesn''t ft comfortably into the format for me. The divisions seem quite arbitrary to me. Reviewing this, I find myself wondering how it would work if the panels were of ascending size from left to right, so both towers were in the right-most panel, and the leftmost panel were narrower than the central panel. I donno. Regardless, it''s a lovely rendering, very serene, and I am bumping it up a notch. Good luck!', '2005-11-18 03:50:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1879328, 257108, 24983, '<td valign="top">good set , the cat looks quite domestic  9</td>', 'good set , the cat looks quite domestic  9', '2005-11-18 03:54:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1879329, 257327, 30861, '<td valign="top">This is in many ways one of the more interesting triptychs, conceptually, in this challenge. There''s a palpable sense of immediacy, of the passage of time and life. Technically it [i]appears[/i ]flawed, with the bright vertical haloing on the right edges, and the tiny, disheveled wedge of gutter showing in each image is oddly attention-getting, but overall this leaves a certain gritty, homespun texture to the whole that''s appealing to me. Bumping up, and good luck!</td>', 'This is in many ways one of the more interesting triptychs, conceptually, in this challenge. There''s a palpable sense of immediacy, of the passage of time and life. Technically it [i]appears[/i ]flawed, with the bright vertical haloing on the right edges, and the tiny, disheveled wedge of gutter showing in each image is oddly attention-getting, but overall this leaves a certain gritty, homespun texture to the whole that''s appealing to me. Bumping up, and good luck!', '2005-11-18 03:54:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1879330, 257130, 30861, '<td valign="top">I have come back to this one. It is very strong. Powerful and graphic, good strong weight to it visually. Bumping you up a notch.</td>', 'I have come back to this one. It is very strong. Powerful and graphic, good strong weight to it visually. Bumping you up a notch.', '2005-11-18 03:56:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1879337, 256353, 36616, '<td valign="top">Cruel at this time of year - assuminmg you''re as cold as I am right now. Only real criticism  is the difference in size between the three heads is a little off putting.</td>', 'Cruel at this time of year - assuminmg you''re as cold as I am right now. Only real criticism  is the difference in size between the three heads is a little off putting.', '2005-11-18 04:04:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1879338, 257056, 30861, '<td valign="top">This is a very gentle green, indeed. The image itself is extremely appealing, sich and gauzy and soothing. But the overlaying of the triptych seems to me very much at war with the image itself. What I find especially odd is that the three panels are NOT the same size, so clearly you were putting thought into exactly where the panels should break. <br/> <br/>In other words, you consciously used the rightmost panel-break to split the raised stem of the leaf.  And I don''t know why you made that choice. I am presuming you had a very specific reason to do it, but it seems to me to be the wrong choice here. I''d be interested in hearing why you did it this way, what you were after. Feel free to PM me if you wish.</td>', 'This is a very gentle green, indeed. The image itself is extremely appealing, sich and gauzy and soothing. But the overlaying of the triptych seems to me very much at war with the image itself. What I find especially odd is that the three panels are NOT the same size, so clearly you were putting thought into exactly where the panels should break.  In other words, you consciously used the rightmost panel-break to split the raised stem of the leaf.  And I don''t know why you made that choice. I am presuming you had a very specific reason to do it, but it seems to me to be the wrong choice here. I''d be interested in hearing why you did it this way, what you were after. Feel free to PM me if you wish.', '2005-11-18 04:04:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1879342, 257125, 36616, '<td valign="top">Some great contrasts here. Well done</td>', 'Some great contrasts here. Well done', '2005-11-18 04:14:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1879343, 256871, 36616, '<td valign="top">Technically excellent I find the overall impression to have too little contrast for my taste.</td>', 'Technically excellent I find the overall impression to have too little contrast for my taste.', '2005-11-18 04:15:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1879346, 257123, 36616, '<td valign="top">The subject and capture are good but the overall effect leaves me with too little contrast where it matters and too much where it doesn''t</td>', 'The subject and capture are good but the overall effect leaves me with too little contrast where it matters and too much where it doesn''t', '2005-11-18 04:16:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1879348, 255739, 36616, '<td valign="top">An excellent pic but I''m not sure about the panels, the black and white seem over dominant and detract from the beauty of the flower.</td>', 'An excellent pic but I''m not sure about the panels, the black and white seem over dominant and detract from the beauty of the flower.', '2005-11-18 04:18:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1879350, 255979, 36616, '<td valign="top">Well executed and captured - its just a little bland for me with this particular colour.</td>', 'Well executed and captured - its just a little bland for me with this particular colour.', '2005-11-18 04:19:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1879351, 257317, 36616, '<td valign="top">Insufficient focus in the centre panel particularlyand the apparent misaligned photo between panels one and two is another distraction.</td>', 'Insufficient focus in the centre panel particularlyand the apparent misaligned photo between panels one and two is another distraction.', '2005-11-18 04:22:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1879353, 256836, 36616, '<td valign="top">Just what everyone needs -  a good lick. <br/>Nice set of three - well done</td>', 'Just what everyone needs -  a good lick. Nice set of three - well done', '2005-11-18 04:23:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1879354, 256648, 36616, '<td valign="top">Sweet. Particularly like the centre one.</td>', 'Sweet. Particularly like the centre one.', '2005-11-18 04:24:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1879356, 255857, 36616, '<td valign="top">Almost excellent. reflection on centre slice marks it down a fraction.</td>', 'Almost excellent. reflection on centre slice marks it down a fraction.', '2005-11-18 04:27:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1879358, 257445, 36616, '<td valign="top">Like the overlaps but it does leave a lot of black</td>', 'Like the overlaps but it does leave a lot of black', '2005-11-18 04:29:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1879359, 257040, 16154, '<td valign="top">beautiful image, the green is great just perfectly saturated. the softness increases its the pleasant nature. The reflection on the beans are not to harsh and therefore create a fresh appealing look.<br/> <br/> I hate coffee though! ill never drink it!</td>', 'beautiful image, the green is great just perfectly saturated. the softness increases its the pleasant nature. The reflection on the beans are not to harsh and therefore create a fresh appealing look.  I hate coffee though! ill never drink it!', '2005-11-18 04:29:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1879361, 256414, 16154, '<td valign="top">i really hope its 3 different pictures! so simple, and so effective. Recreating an illusion that no lens could reproduce without serious barrel distortion. great!  8 (because the colors dont match from top and middle frames)</td>', 'i really hope its 3 different pictures! so simple, and so effective. Recreating an illusion that no lens could reproduce without serious barrel distortion. great!  8 (because the colors dont match from top and middle frames)', '2005-11-18 04:32:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1879362, 255230, 36616, '<td valign="top">My eye gets pulled to the two pics on the right. The alignment is most peculiar giving several false impressions. The jawline of the right hand one can lead into the mouth of the centre giving a surreal experience. Difficult to explain. The left hand pic does nothing for this piece.</td>', 'My eye gets pulled to the two pics on the right. The alignment is most peculiar giving several false impressions. The jawline of the right hand one can lead into the mouth of the centre giving a surreal experience. Difficult to explain. The left hand pic does nothing for this piece.', '2005-11-18 04:34:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1879363, 257035, 36616, '<td valign="top">Very colourful. Not sure about the repeated use of the large pic.</td>', 'Very colourful. Not sure about the repeated use of the large pic.', '2005-11-18 04:36:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1879365, 256902, 36616, '<td valign="top">Shame that the focus iand angle are different for each</td>', 'Shame that the focus iand angle are different for each', '2005-11-18 04:37:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1879367, 255852, 36616, '<td valign="top">Excellent composition. Looks like a promising athlete</td>', 'Excellent composition. Looks like a promising athlete', '2005-11-18 04:39:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1879369, 256660, 36616, '<td valign="top">Fabulous capture</td>', 'Fabulous capture', '2005-11-18 04:40:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1879372, 257172, 36616, '<td valign="top">With more skill it would have been nice to overlap the middle bird onto the two outer panels.</td>', 'With more skill it would have been nice to overlap the middle bird onto the two outer panels.', '2005-11-18 04:45:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1879413, 255758, 45316, '<td valign="top">Like it! :)</td>', 'Like it! :)', '2005-11-18 05:33:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1879417, 256909, 45316, '<td valign="top">I like it and the shadow effects.</td>', 'I like it and the shadow effects.', '2005-11-18 05:36:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1879430, 256288, 23478, '<td valign="top">Nice images... it seems that the range of contrast is narrow, which makes the image appear flat.</td>', 'Nice images... it seems that the range of contrast is narrow, which makes the image appear flat.', '2005-11-18 06:01:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1879433, 257305, 23478, '<td valign="top">Nice sequence, the colors are a bit odd.</td>', 'Nice sequence, the colors are a bit odd.', '2005-11-18 06:03:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1879439, 257373, 23478, '<td valign="top">Very cute!</td>', 'Very cute!', '2005-11-18 06:08:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1879442, 257307, 42171, '<td valign="top">This is very clever - I like it a lot...</td>', 'This is very clever - I like it a lot...', '2005-11-18 06:19:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1879447, 257337, 35720, '<td valign="top">One of my favorites in this challenge. Wonderful shot, great work! 10</td>', 'One of my favorites in this challenge. Wonderful shot, great work! 10', '2005-11-18 06:33:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1879448, 257273, 35720, '<td valign="top">Beautiful colours, well done and good luck!</td>', 'Beautiful colours, well done and good luck!', '2005-11-18 06:34:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1879449, 257173, 35720, '<td valign="top">Great capture, good work. I like it a lot, good luck!</td>', 'Great capture, good work. I like it a lot, good luck!', '2005-11-18 06:35:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1879521, 257307, 47347, '<td valign="top">Great. I love this one. Each subject replaceing another in each third is fun....</td>', 'Great. I love this one. Each subject replaceing another in each third is fun....', '2005-11-18 07:49:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1879633, 256840, 34192, '<td valign="top">Love this image.  No clue how you did it but does that really matter?  There is something wistful about it.  10</td>', 'Love this image.  No clue how you did it but does that really matter?  There is something wistful about it.  10', '2005-11-18 08:43:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1879636, 256137, 34192, '<td valign="top">Excellent work.  Something for a family to hang on their wall and enjoy. 9</td>', 'Excellent work.  Something for a family to hang on their wall and enjoy. 9', '2005-11-18 08:44:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1879639, 257327, 34192, '<td valign="top">I find this very intriguing and amusing.  Not a fan of the vertical placement but it works well here. 9</td>', 'I find this very intriguing and amusing.  Not a fan of the vertical placement but it works well here. 9', '2005-11-18 08:45:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1879640, 256909, 34192, '<td valign="top">excellent choice for a triptych.  Edited well. Tones excellent. 9</td>', 'excellent choice for a triptych.  Edited well. Tones excellent. 9', '2005-11-18 08:46:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1879642, 257430, 34192, '<td valign="top">well done. Like the lack of frames. 8</td>', 'well done. Like the lack of frames. 8', '2005-11-18 08:47:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1879643, 256221, 34192, '<td valign="top">beautiful rendering.  I find the triptych aspect distracting and would rather see the large without the small, but that is personal choice.  8</td>', 'beautiful rendering.  I find the triptych aspect distracting and would rather see the large without the small, but that is personal choice.  8', '2005-11-18 08:48:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1879687, 256916, 10634, '<td valign="top">Nice progression. Good Luck</td>', 'Nice progression. Good Luck', '2005-11-18 09:31:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1879693, 257420, 10634, '<td valign="top">Knowing what beautiful colors this baby could have, I would have liked to see it that way. What kind is it? We had a Mexican Red Leg and a Cobalt Blue. Good Luck!</td>', 'Knowing what beautiful colors this baby could have, I would have liked to see it that way. What kind is it? We had a Mexican Red Leg and a Cobalt Blue. Good Luck!', '2005-11-18 09:35:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1879696, 257396, 10634, '<td valign="top">I don''t think the division works well here.</td>', 'I don''t think the division works well here.', '2005-11-18 09:37:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1879699, 257243, 10634, '<td valign="top">I like the idea. Unfortunately, the size limitations here on DPC really hinder this type of image. I think if this shot were larger it would be wonderful. The colors and textures are excellent. This is something I wouldn''t mind having on my wall. Good Luck.</td>', 'I like the idea. Unfortunately, the size limitations here on DPC really hinder this type of image. I think if this shot were larger it would be wonderful. The colors and textures are excellent. This is something I wouldn''t mind having on my wall. Good Luck.', '2005-11-18 09:40:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1879705, 257111, 10634, '<td valign="top">The first shot in this series doesn''t have the same appeal as the other two for me. I think because it feels unbalanced to me.</td>', 'The first shot in this series doesn''t have the same appeal as the other two for me. I think because it feels unbalanced to me.', '2005-11-18 09:43:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1879707, 256804, 10634, '<td valign="top">Very nice... and funny to boot. Good Luck</td>', 'Very nice... and funny to boot. Good Luck', '2005-11-18 09:44:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1879712, 256814, 10634, '<td valign="top">This is a beautiful photo that I feel works well as a tryptich and alone. It feels as though you are looking out your living room window and seeing this awesome view. Good Luck.</td>', 'This is a beautiful photo that I feel works well as a tryptich and alone. It feels as though you are looking out your living room window and seeing this awesome view. Good Luck.', '2005-11-18 09:47:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1879715, 257433, 10634, '<td valign="top">I don''t know if I like this divided in three. I think the colors and textures make it a wonderful photo without the division. I also think the border is a bit heavy.</td>', 'I don''t know if I like this divided in three. I think the colors and textures make it a wonderful photo without the division. I also think the border is a bit heavy.', '2005-11-18 09:49:40.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(1879719, 256669, 12962, '<td valign="top">Love the subject ... and its air of nonchalance ...</td>', 'Love the subject ... and its air of nonchalance ...', '2005-11-18 09:51:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1879723, 256327, 10634, '<td valign="top">An interesting idea and a nice attempt. The outer two photos are rather soft while the middle is more in focus. I think this lack of continuity hurts the overall compilation.</td>', 'An interesting idea and a nice attempt. The outer two photos are rather soft while the middle is more in focus. I think this lack of continuity hurts the overall compilation.', '2005-11-18 09:52:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1879727, 257077, 10634, '<td valign="top">I have to admit, I''m torn on this one. I think that as one photo, it would be lacking a little  in the "wow" factor. While splitting it up does give it more impact, I''m just not sure if I like it. :-)  I''ve come back to your shot many times over the last couple of days and it has grown on me a bit. Good Luck.</td>', 'I have to admit, I''m torn on this one. I think that as one photo, it would be lacking a little  in the "wow" factor. While splitting it up does give it more impact, I''m just not sure if I like it. :-)  I''ve come back to your shot many times over the last couple of days and it has grown on me a bit. Good Luck.', '2005-11-18 09:56:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1879729, 257418, 10634, '<td valign="top">This is a nice shot by itself, but I feel like the division takes something away from it. Part of it is the color you decided to make the border. You lose it in the surf and the sky and that is distracting. I think it is also the way you decided to break it up.</td>', 'This is a nice shot by itself, but I feel like the division takes something away from it. Part of it is the color you decided to make the border. You lose it in the surf and the sky and that is distracting. I think it is also the way you decided to break it up.', '2005-11-18 09:58:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1879732, 256712, 10634, '<td valign="top">I like this. The thick black border is a little much and a more dramatic sky would have given this more impact, but I like it just the same.</td>', 'I like this. The thick black border is a little much and a more dramatic sky would have given this more impact, but I like it just the same.', '2005-11-18 10:00:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1879743, 256034, 48211, '<td valign="top">this is just beautiful, i don''t know what it is about this picture, but i love it...well done.</td>', 'this is just beautiful, i don''t know what it is about this picture, but i love it...well done.', '2005-11-18 10:08:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1879750, 257307, 22748, '<td valign="top">Brilliant, quality work!! This is such a cool, original idea, and perfectly executed.</td>', 'Brilliant, quality work!! This is such a cool, original idea, and perfectly executed.', '2005-11-18 10:12:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1879755, 257107, 22748, '<td valign="top">WOW. All I can say is QUALITY. Very, very nice, are you sure you didn''t scan this from a 2-page ad in Vogue? ;-) Perfect lighting, color, exposure, etc. Cool, original idea for arranging the triptych. Nice variety of angles.</td>', 'WOW. All I can say is QUALITY. Very, very nice, are you sure you didn''t scan this from a 2-page ad in Vogue? ;-) Perfect lighting, color, exposure, etc. Cool, original idea for arranging the triptych. Nice variety of angles.', '2005-11-18 10:14:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1879756, 257274, 22748, '<td valign="top">This is a beautiful image. I just love the lighting and to colors of it. The only thing that I could point out that I would change is the text on the blade, since it''s the only text anywhere, it kind of interrupts the "flow" a little, but this is still one of my top faves this challenge.</td>', 'This is a beautiful image. I just love the lighting and to colors of it. The only thing that I could point out that I would change is the text on the blade, since it''s the only text anywhere, it kind of interrupts the "flow" a little, but this is still one of my top faves this challenge.', '2005-11-18 10:16:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1879760, 255758, 22748, '<td valign="top">Great detail, nice even lighting. I like the consistency it has between the 3 images, tying them together, and the way you made the angles symmetrical for the main lines in the balls.</td>', 'Great detail, nice even lighting. I like the consistency it has between the 3 images, tying them together, and the way you made the angles symmetrical for the main lines in the balls.', '2005-11-18 10:18:07.000000', NULL, 1),
