(1880235, 257376, 22379, '<td valign="top">I really wish you had saved this picture for free study. It is fabulous, and without the dividers (ie in free study) i would have scored it a lot higher. The image just does not lend itselfwell to a triptych, andit appears that it has just been made into a trip to fit thechallenge.</td>', 'I really wish you had saved this picture for free study. It is fabulous, and without the dividers (ie in free study) i would have scored it a lot higher. The image just does not lend itselfwell to a triptych, andit appears that it has just been made into a trip to fit thechallenge.', '2005-11-18 14:08:58.000000', NULL, 1),
