(1880248, 257152, 22379, '<td valign="top">I really feel you could have done a better job dividing the panels. The image does lend itfel to a triptych, but not in the manner in which you have cut it. If you had kept the (i dont know what to call them) stations? that the air trams go thorugh both on the inside or both on the outside of the middle panel instead of awkwardly cutting them in half on both sides, this image would be a lot stronger as a triptych.</td>', 'I really feel you could have done a better job dividing the panels. The image does lend itfel to a triptych, but not in the manner in which you have cut it. If you had kept the (i dont know what to call them) stations? that the air trams go thorugh both on the inside or both on the outside of the middle panel instead of awkwardly cutting them in half on both sides, this image would be a lot stronger as a triptych.', '2005-11-18 14:13:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1880254, 257396, 22379, '<td valign="top">This is another image i wish had been saved for the free study. Dividing the the firefly into three seems only to have been done to fit the challenge, and does not enhance the visual appearance of the image overall.</td>', 'This is another image i wish had been saved for the free study. Dividing the the firefly into three seems only to have been done to fit the challenge, and does not enhance the visual appearance of the image overall.', '2005-11-18 14:16:39.000000', NULL, 1),
