(1880609, 257216, 32378, '<td valign="top">Hmmm, lets see I''m from Cleveland..should I let my loyalties judge this?  Actually I like it...even if it is from Pittsburgh. I like the way the shots run diagonally, and the colors all work very well together.  I may have cropped some from the bottom of the left hand shot and added to the top so the flag wasn''t cut off.</td>', 'Hmmm, lets see I''m from Cleveland..should I let my loyalties judge this?  Actually I like it...even if it is from Pittsburgh. I like the way the shots run diagonally, and the colors all work very well together.  I may have cropped some from the bottom of the left hand shot and added to the top so the flag wasn''t cut off.', '2005-11-18 16:15:21.000000', NULL, 1),
