(1881280, 257273, 6999, '<td valign="top">Whilst this is certainly a [retty sunset, I don''t fiond anything in it to particularly require the use of three frames, and, after all, it remains simply a sunset shot: not uncommon, not special, not particularly different. The tonality is good, the focus is good, and technically otherwise it''s fine - but it''s just a sunset, no?</td>', 'Whilst this is certainly a [retty sunset, I don''t fiond anything in it to particularly require the use of three frames, and, after all, it remains simply a sunset shot: not uncommon, not special, not particularly different. The tonality is good, the focus is good, and technically otherwise it''s fine - but it''s just a sunset, no?', '2005-11-18 20:46:38.000000', NULL, 1),
