(1882360, 256872, 36616, '<td valign="top">Lack of contrast in the top two and too much in the bottom one. The top one is the best of the three - probably because the centre is a middle colour. With white in the centre the exposure tends to get set wrongly. Hope this helps.</td>', 'Lack of contrast in the top two and too much in the bottom one. The top one is the best of the three - probably because the centre is a middle colour. With white in the centre the exposure tends to get set wrongly. Hope this helps.', '2005-11-19 06:07:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1882361, 256822, 36616, '<td valign="top">Could have been an excellent study of one flower - but time is needed. Although the individual exposures seems OK the overall impression is too dark for my taste</td>', 'Could have been an excellent study of one flower - but time is needed. Although the individual exposures seems OK the overall impression is too dark for my taste', '2005-11-19 06:09:31.000000', NULL, 1),
