(1882560, 256613, 26773, '<td valign="top">i like the subject, but it has a blueish tint to it i think that kinda distracts me, or maybe if the frame was black. and could still be simple</td>', 'i like the subject, but it has a blueish tint to it i think that kinda distracts me, or maybe if the frame was black. and could still be simple', '2005-11-19 10:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
