(1885341, 256814, 17507, '<td valign="top">great perspective on the bridge! I don''t think I''ve ever seen a GG photo taken from this place before.</td>', 'great perspective on the bridge! I don''t think I''ve ever seen a GG photo taken from this place before.', '2005-11-20 19:09:05.000000', NULL, 1),
