(1886343, 257068, 18552, '<td valign="top">This is really lovely, Laurie. Everything about it is just right, I like the fact that you left space at the bottom for text to be added. What a nice thing that your town has such a beautiful garden in the winter.</td>', 'This is really lovely, Laurie. Everything about it is just right, I like the fact that you left space at the bottom for text to be added. What a nice thing that your town has such a beautiful garden in the winter.', '2005-11-21 01:29:51.000000', NULL, 0),
