(1886372, 256137, 40718, '<td valign="top">Good catch by the few who noticed that Laine''s face was blue.  I had the adjustment layers screwed up and I had done a mask on her face to lighten it.  I think I forgot to readjust that mask after I used the channel mixer to convert to B&amp;W.  I used the blue channel heavier than the others and it wound up showing.  Luckily not too many people spotted it, but as soon as WonderBread made the comment I knew exactly what had happened and had to stare at it the rest of the week.</td>', 'Good catch by the few who noticed that Laine''s face was blue.  I had the adjustment layers screwed up and I had done a mask on her face to lighten it.  I think I forgot to readjust that mask after I used the channel mixer to convert to B&W.  I used the blue channel heavier than the others and it wound up showing.  Luckily not too many people spotted it, but as soon as WonderBread made the comment I knew exactly what had happened and had to stare at it the rest of the week.', '2005-11-21 01:36:47.000000', NULL, 0),
(1886376, 257307, 41746, '<td valign="top">Til hamingju Lalli með þann bláa. Verðskuldaður. Glæsilegt.</td>', 'Til hamingju Lalli með þann bláa. Verðskuldaður. Glæsilegt.', '2005-11-21 01:37:31.000000', NULL, 0),
