(1886421, 256648, 35786, '<td valign="top">you said you did no other post processing, but now that I''m looking agin, I think this could have benifetted from some Unsharp Mask... Still lovin'' it tho! :0P</td>', 'you said you did no other post processing, but now that I''m looking agin, I think this could have benifetted from some Unsharp Mask... Still lovin'' it tho! :0P', '2005-11-21 01:56:17.000000', NULL, 0),
