(1886471, 256902, 17507, '<td valign="top">Oh, man, this was vastly underappreciated! I gave this an 8. Criticisms aside, I think this picture deserved much better than it got. It''s such a fun illustration of a good concept.</td>', 'Oh, man, this was vastly underappreciated! I gave this an 8. Criticisms aside, I think this picture deserved much better than it got. It''s such a fun illustration of a good concept.', '2005-11-21 02:29:24.000000', NULL, 0),
