(1887785, 256835, 19672, '<td valign="top">Good effort...<br/> <br/>I think this was a very "technical" DQ and one that might not have been clear by the rules in the form they were laid out. But I think your choice of actions, and choosing not to blast and decry the site council and concede DQ on a technicality however slim and uninsightful is very noble.<br/> <br/>You have a good photograph, and you now know better. You''ll ribbon eventually soon enough... ;)<br/> <br/>By the way, I think this phot may demostrate a way to shoot the above legally. Had you arranged the leaves on the black border so you did not have to move them. Then it would have been only two images used.  And been valid.<br/> <br/>;)<br/> <br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=256821" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=256821</a></td>', 'Good effort... I think this was a very "technical" DQ and one that might not have been clear by the rules in the form they were laid out. But I think your choice of actions, and choosing not to blast and decry the site council and concede DQ on a technicality however slim and uninsightful is very noble. You have a good photograph, and you now know better. You''ll ribbon eventually soon enough... ;) By the way, I think this phot may demostrate a way to shoot the above legally. Had you arranged the leaves on the black border so you did not have to move them. Then it would have been only two images used.  And been valid. ;) //www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=256821', '2005-11-21 17:55:32.000000', NULL, 0),
