(1894897, 255758, 19912, '<td valign="top">very nice :-)</td>', 'very nice :-)', '2005-11-24 07:52:11.000000', NULL, 0),
(1894955, 255709, 47117, '<td valign="top">This was easily done using PSP and the magnifying tools (frames), without using the magnifier.  The person who commented that the photos look blurred, it is because the DOF was on the butterfly, and the branch he is on along with him are in focus. The original shots, the surrounding branches were purposely not in focus.  Someone also said that they looked pinched. It is the opposite; they were stretched a bit, but not pinched. The trip tells a bit of a small story.  The top one is where he landed, the second one down shows him looking at me and posing, and the third is where he opened his wings for me to take the shot of his full color.  Thank you for taking the time to look and vote.</td>', 'This was easily done using PSP and the magnifying tools (frames), without using the magnifier.  The person who commented that the photos look blurred, it is because the DOF was on the butterfly, and the branch he is on along with him are in focus. The original shots, the surrounding branches were purposely not in focus.  Someone also said that they looked pinched. It is the opposite; they were stretched a bit, but not pinched. The trip tells a bit of a small story.  The top one is where he landed, the second one down shows him looking at me and posing, and the third is where he opened his wings for me to take the shot of his full color.  Thank you for taking the time to look and vote.', '2005-11-24 08:46:15.000000', NULL, 0),
(1894958, 256309, 7531, '<td valign="top">Some great shots here, wow!!!!</td>', 'Some great shots here, wow!!!!', '2005-11-24 08:47:16.000000', NULL, 0),
