(1945999, 255230, 42013, '<td valign="top">Another recent challenge, wasn''t a member yet so didnt'' vote on this one, but, I really think it should have placed a higher than it did.  My main comment is the frames, have a pretty distinct contrast between them which keeps them from flowing from L to R and makes my eyes bounce around.  and I keep trying to line up the eye with the picture on the right like I''m trying to see a complete face.  Maybe putting the hair pic in the middle would have helped.</td>', 'Another recent challenge, wasn''t a member yet so didnt'' vote on this one, but, I really think it should have placed a higher than it did.  My main comment is the frames, have a pretty distinct contrast between them which keeps them from flowing from L to R and makes my eyes bounce around.  and I keep trying to line up the eye with the picture on the right like I''m trying to see a complete face.  Maybe putting the hair pic in the middle would have helped.', '2005-12-12 22:59:17.000000', NULL, 0),
