(2413286, 255857, 36628, '<td valign="top">This looks like some shots I''ve seen using tape to split things up, I thought it was done with electrical tape until I read your description. I really like the composition and the idea but I think there are two things that detract a little. A minor thing is that the pear looks a bit soft, but the big thing for me is the highlight caused by the lighting. I guess thats contrary to all the other comments, but I feel like if the lighting were more to the side and a little more diffused it would help the shot out alot.</td>', 'This looks like some shots I''ve seen using tape to split things up, I thought it was done with electrical tape until I read your description. I really like the composition and the idea but I think there are two things that detract a little. A minor thing is that the pear looks a bit soft, but the big thing for me is the highlight caused by the lighting. I guess thats contrary to all the other comments, but I feel like if the lighting were more to the side and a little more diffused it would help the shot out alot.', '2006-05-14 00:45:20.000000', NULL, 0),
(2420609, 256496, 75713, '<td valign="top">I lke your wildlife shots a lot... herons are one of my favourite things to photograph... I really like the colors, the warm browns that are in some of yours... How do you get them to look like that?  I am not very good at all in PShop but would appreciate it if you could give me a few suggestions.</td>', 'I lke your wildlife shots a lot... herons are one of my favourite things to photograph... I really like the colors, the warm browns that are in some of yours... How do you get them to look like that?  I am not very good at all in PShop but would appreciate it if you could give me a few suggestions.', '2006-05-16 12:27:54.000000', NULL, 0),
