(3589304, 256327, 72467, '<td valign="top">i was just looking through &amp; i really like the idea &amp; from far away it looks really really good.<br/> <br/>but if you get close up its not just soft focus [trust me, i know a lot about soft focus &amp; how annoying it is when peple complain] its more just blurry =/<br/> <br/>dang.<br/>i really really liked this too.<br/>but the soft focus doesn''t bother me ALL the much.<br/>it just would be better a little softer =]</td>', 'i was just looking through & i really like the idea & from far away it looks really really good. but if you get close up its not just soft focus [trust me, i know a lot about soft focus & how annoying it is when peple complain] its more just blurry =/ dang.i really really liked this too.but the soft focus doesn''t bother me ALL the much.it just would be better a little softer =]', '2007-04-27 22:03:45.000000', NULL, 0),
